e.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/01/opinion/saying-i-do-amid-the-roses.html', 'snippet': 'After a historic year for marriage equality, a same-sex wedding on the first day of 2014 is scheduled to take place on a float at the Tournament of Roses Parade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By all accounts, the standout entry in Wednesday’s Tournament of Roses Parade in Pasadena, Calif., will surely be the marriage of two men, Danny Leclair and Aubrey Loots, beaming amid the array of lavishly flowered floats to be viewed on national television and beyond. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Saying ‘I Do’ Amid the Roses', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Saying ‘I Do’ Amid the Roses', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parades', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pasadena (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-01T00:44:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/13485d4f-d4c4-5b31-99f0-10a163d657fc', 'word_count': 298, 'uri': 'nyt://article/13485d4f-d4c4-5b31-99f0-10a163d657fc'}, {'abstract': 'In the 1940s, R. Buckminster Fuller converted grain bins into emergency housing. It seemed that these structures had disappeared, but at least a dozen have survived in New Jersey.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/01/02/garden/20140102-FULLER.html', 'snippet': 'In the 1940s, R. Buckminster Fuller convert