is-behind-bald-eagle-deaths-in-utah.html', 'snippet': 'Officials believe that the birds contracted the virus by eating infected waterfowl that died in the Great Salt Lake.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The mysterious deaths of at least 27 bald eagles in Utah were caused by the West Nile virus, state officials said on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'West Nile Virus Is Behind Bald Eagle Deaths in Utah', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bald Eagles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'West Nile Virus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Birds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Utah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Salt Lake (Utah)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-01T04:25:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emma G. Fitzsimmons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emma', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'Fitzsimmons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/efd372eb-301f-5361-932a-6faa74c1f7f0', 'word_count': 358, 'uri': 'nyt://article/efd372eb-301f-5361-932a-6faa74c1f7f0'}, {'abstract': 'Initially making her mark as a secretary at Sports Illustrated who knew horses, Ms. Ryan was among the first women to lead major publications.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/01/business/media/patricia-ryan-75-an-editor-at-time-inc-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Initially making her mark as a secretary at Sports Illustrated who knew horses, Ms. Ryan was among the first women to lead major publications.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Patricia Ryan, who started at Time Inc. as a typist in the secretarial pool and rose to become the manag