 hockey competition.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Talent Abundant, U.S. Makes Tough Cuts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Talent Abundant, U.S. Makes Tough Cuts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2014)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Poile, David', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-02T02:24:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/83f6d270-0296-5fd0-bfa6-1a00188f492a', 'word_count': 698, 'uri': 'nyt://article/83f6d270-0296-5fd0-bfa6-1a00188f492a'}, {'abstract': 'The political mentors who flanked Mayor Bill de Blasio during his inauguration speech, Bill Clinton and Andrew M. Cuomo, are both cautious, centrist Democrats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/02/nyregion/plenty-of-reminders-of-populisms-limits.html', 'snippet': 'The political mentors who flanked Mayor Bill de Blasio during his inauguration speech, Bill Clinton and Andrew M. Cuomo, are both cautious, centrist Democrats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shedding coat and gloves, and the last inhibitions of the inside operative, Bill de Blasio used the ice-edged tapestry of his inauguration to make clear that his campaign oratory would become the lodestar for his administration.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'x