act': 'The presence of former President Bill Clinton and former Secretary of State Hillary Rodham Clinton at Mayor Bill de Blasio’s inauguration signals an alliance that could prove mutually beneficial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/02/nyregion/with-clintons-in-his-corner-de-blasio-bolsters-ties-to-his-partys-gold-standard.html', 'snippet': 'The presence of former President Bill Clinton and former Secretary of State Hillary Rodham Clinton at Mayor Bill de Blasio’s inauguration signals an alliance that could prove mutually beneficial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At an inauguration infused with populist talk about racial tensions, social inequities and the Dickensian conditions of New York City’s poorest residents, Mayor Bill de Blasio had the support of the centrist standard bearers of the Democratic Party: former President Bill Clinton and former Secretary of State Hillary Rodham Clinton.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/nyregion/clinton/clinton-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/02/nyregion/clinton/clinton-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/nyregion/clinton/clinton-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/nyregion/clinton/clinton-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1403, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/nyregion/clinton/clinton-thumbStandard.jpg