h food before it was cool. There were only two other people I knew who frequented my neighborhood health food store in the late ’80s: an emaciated man with a gray ponytail and a woman with a surprising amount of underarm hair, who smelled of B.O. and patchouli.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kale? Juicing? Trouble Ahead', 'kicker': 'Private Lives', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kale? Juicing? Trouble Ahead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teeth and Dentistry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetables', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-02T04:16:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Berman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29311767-318d-5941-abf1-dce029a385a5', 'word_count': 845, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29311767-318d-5941-abf1-dce029a385a5'}, {'abstract': 'The Israeli prime minister, Benjamin Netanyahu, has said that Palestinians’ recognition of the Jewish state is an issue that underpins all others.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/middleeast/100000002623485/netanyahu-demands-recognition-of-israel.html', 'snippet': 'The Israeli prime minister, Benjamin Netanyahu, has said that Palestinians’ recognition of the Jewish state is an issue that underpins all others.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Israeli prime minister, Benjamin Netanyahu, has said that Palestinians’ recognition of the Jewish state is an issue that underpins all others.', 's