: 'The former senator from Connecticut and onetime vice presidential candidate is expected to help Victory Park Capital with his regulatory expertise.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/02/joseph-lieberman-joins-private-equity-firm/', 'snippet': 'The former senator from Connecticut and onetime vice presidential candidate is expected to help Victory Park Capital with his regulatory expertise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over lunch in Manhattan several months ago, Brendan Carroll, a partner and co-founder of the private equity firm Victory Park Capital, had a proposition for his former boss, Joseph I. Lieberman, the former senator from Connecticut and onetime vice-presidential candidate: Would Mr. Lieberman be interested in joining his firm?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/business/dealbook/dbpix-lieberman/dbpix-lieberman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/02/business/dealbook/dbpix-lieberman/dbpix-lieberman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/business/dealbook/dbpix-lieberman/dbpix-lieberman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/business/dealbook/dbpix-lieberman/dbpix-lieberman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/business/dealbook/dbpix-lieberman/dbpix-lieberman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75