', 'word_count': 231, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df6ae359-19b5-5346-a9fc-6a95e724d7ef'}, {'abstract': 'An exhibition at the Newark Museum focuses on objects manufactured when Newark was a precious-metals epicenter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/03/arts/design/newark-recalls-its-lustrous-metals-past.html', 'snippet': 'An exhibition at the Newark Museum focuses on objects manufactured when Newark was a precious-metals epicenter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWARK — Artisans specializing in precious metals largely left this city decades ago, and their buildings have been razed, renovated beyond recognition or converted into apartment complexes with names like Tiffany Manor.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03ANTIQUES_SPAN/03ANTIQUES01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03ANTIQUES_SPAN/03ANTIQUES01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 425}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03ANTIQUES_SPAN/03ANTIQUES01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03ANTIQUES_SPAN/03ANTIQUES01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 880, 'width': 1243, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03ANTIQUES_SPAN/03ANTIQUES01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03ANTIQUES_SPAN/03ANTIQUES01-thumbStandard.jpg', 't