_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/02/a-snow-day-coming-dantes-friends-want-to-know/', 'snippet': 'Being the son of a mayor has its advantages. Friends of Dante de Blasio apparently hope they include influencing decisions on school cancellations, or at least knowing about them ahead of time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Being the son of a mayor unquestionably has its advantages. Dante de Blasio will have four years or more to learn what those advantages are, and to decide how he will play them. But it has taken just one day – the one frozen and overcast day since his father’s inauguration on – to experience the drawbacks. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Snow Day Coming? Dante’s Friends Want to Know', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Dante', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-02T20:27:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ariel Kaminer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ariel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaminer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c52250c-dea4-5aac-9be6-ab9e4c2ba771', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c52250c-dea4-5aac-9be6-ab9e4c2ba771'}, {'abstract': 'The updated Jeep Grand Cherokee passes a “moose test,” and N.H.T.S.A. submits proposed backup camera rule to the White House.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/03/automobiles/wheelies-the-moose-proof-jeep-edition.html', 'snippet': 'The updated Jeep Grand Cherokee passes a “moose test,” and N.H.T.S.A. submits proposed backup camera rule to the Wh