aead-3f681b2c4182'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio said he had no qualms about the criticism that others directed at his predecessor, former Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/03/nyregion/de-blasio-defends-his-inaugurations-sometimes-harsh-tone-toward-bloomberg.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio said he had no qualms about the criticism that others directed at his predecessor, former Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio said on Thursday that he had no qualms about the harsh words directed at his predecessor, Michael R. Bloomberg, at Mr. de Blasio’s inauguration ceremony.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'De Blasio Defends His Inauguration’s Sometimes Harsh Tone Toward Bloomberg', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-02T21:38:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8007c380-2192-558d-9da0-d4b6db0a5137', 'word_count': 501, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8007c380-2192-558d-9da0-d4b6db0a5137'}, {'abstract': 'Tennessee Jed’s tries to appease all barbecue preferences with its Texas’s brisket, Memphis baby back ribs, St. Louis-style ribs and Carolina pulled pork.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/nyregion/a-review-of-tennessee-jeds-in-wantagh.html', 'snippet': 'Tennessee Jed’s tries to appease all barbecue preferences with its Texas’s brisket, Memphis baby back ribs, St. Louis-style ribs and Carolina pulled pork.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Barbecue is a personal thing, and every style has its partisans, but Tennessee Jed’s in Wantagh has all the bases covered. For Texans who think barbecue means beef, the menu has brisket, beef ribs and smoked beef sausages. Those who go for the more typical pork barbecue will find Memphis baby back ribs, St. Louis-style ribs and Carolina pulled pork. Every table has four bottles of house-made sauce: regular, sweet, hot and mustard. The classic North Carolina vinegar-based sauce was dropped because of a lack of popularity, according to Julie Gonzalez, the co-owner with her husband, Francisco, speaking on the phone after my visits. ', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05DINELI2/05DINELI2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05DINELI2/05DINELI2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05DINELI2/05DINELI2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1022, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05DINELI2/05DINELI2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2045, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05DINELI2/05DINELI2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2