rts/music/la-descente-dorphee-aux-enfers-at-st-pauls-chapel.html', 'snippet': 'The Gotham Chamber Opera performed the hourlong “La Descente d’Orphée aux Enfers” at St. Paul’s Chapel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the score of Marc-Antoine Charpentier’s “La Descente d’Orphée aux Enfers” was rediscovered in the French National Library, The New York Times reported the news in a brief article in 1930 that ended with an assessment of the work’s quality: “It is, we are told, worthy of the composer.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03GOTHAM_SPAN/GOTHAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03GOTHAM_SPAN/GOTHAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03GOTHAM_SPAN/GOTHAM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03GOTHAM_SPAN/GOTHAM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03GOTHAM_SPAN/GOTHAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03GOTHAM_SPAN/GOTHAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/arts/03GOTHAM_SPAN/GOTHAM-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subTyp