f snow overnight.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/02/from-chicago-to-boston-winter-storm-creates-havoc-for-travelers/', 'snippet': 'Thousands of flights were delayed or canceled, and drivers faced treacherous driving conditions as the storm dumped piles of snow overnight.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, Friday, Jan. 3, 4:00 p.m. A winter storm that brought bitter cold, strong winds and two feet of snow to parts of New England overnight snarled air travel across the country Friday and created treacherous road conditions for motorists from Chicago to Boston.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/us/02THELEDE-STORM/02THELEDE-STORM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/04/us/02THELEDE-STORM/02THELEDE-STORM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/us/02THELEDE-STORM/02THELEDE-STORM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/us/02THELEDE-STORM/02THELEDE-STORM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1370, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/us/02THELEDE-STORM/02THELEDE-STORM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/04/us/02THELEDE-STORM/02THELEDE-STORM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u