 Museum in Greenwich, you miss out on the calories, the protein and the cost, but you still get to enjoy a treat. “Oysters, Pearls of Long Island Sound” is a fascinating stew of oyster lore, oyster science, oyster commerce and oyster history — not to mention a bit of oyster porn, in the brief but vivid video of several bivalves in turn spraying clouds of eggs and sperm into the water.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1165, 'width': 1921, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPAN/05ARTSCT1COMBO_SPA