ersey’s Coast', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eminent Domain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dunes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricanes and Tropical Storms', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-03T00:57:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb591d47-a958-5d49-8885-2768cd7f470f', 'word_count': 296, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb591d47-a958-5d49-8885-2768cd7f470f'}, {'abstract': 'Jay Prosch, a 6-2, 258-pound H-back and fullback, is a perfect escort for the run-first Auburn offense. The Tigers play Florida State in the B.C.S. title game Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/03/sports/ncaafootball/fearless-fullback-makes-sure-auburn-has-room-to-run.html', 'snippet': 'Jay Prosch, a 6-2, 258-pound H-back and fullback, is a perfect escort for the run-first Auburn offense. The Tigers play Florida State in the B.C.S. title game Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Auburn’s Jay Prosch had an inelegant style as a boy and would sometimes forget about the basics, he said, like common sense. He would take any dare from friends in Saraland, Ala., like building the highest tree fort, hurtling over the biggest dirt piles with his bike, or back flipping into any pool of water he could find. He was muscular and unyielding. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': 