5-8a68-39be8b6fe828'}, {'abstract': 'The moved appeared to reflect a somber assessment of the country’s prospects, even as warring factions were said to have opened preliminary talks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/04/world/africa/us-orders-evacuation-of-staff-from-embassy-in-south-sudan.html', 'snippet': 'The moved appeared to reflect a somber assessment of the country’s prospects, even as warring factions were said to have opened preliminary talks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States on Friday ordered a further reduction of American Embassy staff members in strife-torn South Sudan and said it would cease to provide consular services for its citizens as of Saturday, apparently reflecting a somber assessment of the country’s prospects even as its warring factions were reported to have opened preliminary indirect talks in neighboring Ethiopia.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Orders Evacuation of Staff Members From Embassy in South Sudan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Orders Evacuation of Staff Members From Embassy in South Sudan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Sudan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evacuations and Evacuees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-03T09:12:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Cowell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization'