04, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6e84d81c-42c5-5e82-b8e1-11419790ee2c'}, {'abstract': 'The Carpenters’ mellow ’70s pop music was at the center of my life — including the first punch I ever threw.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/magazine/im-here-im-a-carpenters-fan-get-used-to-it.html', 'snippet': 'The Carpenters’ mellow ’70s pop music was at the center of my life — including the first punch I ever threw.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the basement of my childhood home, there are stacks of old Billboard magazines, dating from the mid-’70s. Recently I rooted through them to find the issue of Jan. 5, 1974. At the top of the album chart inside is the greatest-hits collection by the Carpenters, No. 1 40 years ago this week.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '42', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05riff/mag-05Riff-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 89, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05riff/mag-05Riff-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 89}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05riff/mag-05Riff-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 151, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05riff/mag-05Riff-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05riff/mag-05Riff-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05riff/mag-05Riff-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05riff/mag-05Riff-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘I’m Here, I’m a Carpenters Fan, Get Used to It’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘I’m Here, I’m a Carpenters Fan, Get Used to It’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carpenters, The (Music Group)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hoerburger, Rob', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hoerburger, Rob', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-03T16:01:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rob Hoerburger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoerburger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/48f3c5c9-6e22-5010-8750-e29d7c96bc0a', 'word_count': 1914, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48f3c5c9-6e22-5010-8750-e29d7c96bc0a'}, {'abstract': 'A new MSNBC show for a man who’s tried to leave his looks — and family — in the background.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/magazine/ronan-farrow-reluctant-tv-star.html', 'snippet': 'A new MSNBC show for a man who’s tried to leave his looks — and family — in the background.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ronan Farrow had a cold. “Probably from a source,” he joked. It wasn’t clear who gave it to him — the big pop star in L.A. or the Minnesotans fighting against terrorist recruitment in their community. Farrow had been out of town reporting pieces on both, and his voice was almost shot.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05farrow1/05farrow1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05farrow1/05farrow1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05farrow1/05farrow1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05farrow1/05farrow1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05farrow1/05farrow1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05farrow1/05farrow1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/magazine/05farrow1/05farrow1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ronan Farrow, Reluctant TV Star', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': "'I Grew Up in a Family Where You Could Never Be the Center of Attention'", 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lichtenstein, Jesse', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Farrow, Ronan', 'rank': 2, 'majo