ve actions will make it easier for states to provide information about mentally ill individuals to the federal background check system.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/03/obama-announces-gun-control-actions/', 'snippet': 'Two new executive actions will make it easier for states to provide information about mentally ill individuals to the federal background check system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 10:46 p.m. | HONOLULU — President Obama announced two new executive actions on Friday that nudge his gun control agenda forward by making it easier for states to provide information about people with mental illness to the federal background check system.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Announces Gun Control Actions', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Actions Seek To Further Gun Control', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Health and Human Services Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-03T19:27:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/df0ae814-1c16-5bb3-bebf-26c03ddb381c', 'word_count': 412, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df0ae814-1c16-5bb3-bebf-26c03ddb381c'}, {'abstract': 'Jungles in Paris, a new undertaking from two adventure-obsessed brothers, offers artistic examinations of subjects like the disappearance of the Aral Sea and the Japanese geisha tradition.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/03/site-to-be-seen-an-artistic-armchair-travel-platform-that-visits-the-worlds-most-amazing-places/', 'snippet': 'Jungles in Paris, a new undertaking from two adventure-obsessed brothers, offers artistic examinations of subjects like the disappearance of the Aral Sea and the Japanese geisha tradition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Growing up in rural Maine, the brothers Darrell and Oliver Hartman learned to love the outdoorsy, adventurous life from their dad, who was the director of the state’s parks. Trips in early adulthood to places like Greece, Nicaragua and India ensured their passion for wanderlust, as did the jobs they pursued: Darrell, 32, is a lifestyle and travel writer; Oliver, 30, is a director for the production company North. Last year, the pair decided to combine talents to create a website that celebrates the kind of travel they like to do.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Artistic Armchair Travel Platform That Visits the World’s Most Amazing Places', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-03T19:28:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Zafiris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zafiris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddad92cd-a041-5f82-8e55-3d2b6a0b92cc', 'word_count': 254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddad92cd-a041-5f82-8e55-3d2b6a0b92cc'}, {'abstract': 'A frosty family trip in pursuit of the aurora borealis slides between watching and waiting, panic and prayer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/travel/chasing-the-northern-lights-in-alaska.html', 'snippet': 'A frosty family trip in pursuit of the aurora borealis slides between watching and waiting, panic and prayer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We hurtled across the tundra in the dark. The old train chugged, rattled, occasionally whined. As the sun came up around 10 a.m., the world faded from black to cobalt to white and every shade between. All was snow; it was just a matter of how much, where, what shape. Black spruce trees draped in white rose up from the ground like crystals of hoarfrost.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05-alaska-span-sf/05-alaska-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05-alaska-span-sf/05-alaska-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05-alaska-span-sf/05-alaska-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05-alaska-span-sf/05-alaska-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05-alaska-span-sf/05-alaska-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05-alaska-span-sf/05-alaska-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05-alaska-span-sf/05-alaska-span-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Chasing the Northern Lights in Alaska', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shedding Light on Alaska', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Todras-Whitehill, Ethan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fairbanks (Alaska)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aurora Borealis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-03T19:30:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ethan Todras-Whitehill', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ethan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Todras-Whitehill', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/37f63731-8347-5744-8ccd-6568c03cdb31', 'word_count': 2861, 'uri': 'nyt://article/37f63731-8347-5744-8ccd-6568c03cdb31'}, {'abstract': 'Exploring the many dimensions of what it’s like to see the world as a black traveler, from discovering liberation to experiencing healing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/travel/traveling-while-black.html', 'snippet': 'Exploring the many dimensions of what it’s like to see the world as a black traveler, from discovering liberation to experiencing healing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As I walked through the Forbidden City, the majestic imperial palace at the center of Beijing, with a friend and her teenager, I scanned the crowd. In the maze of shrines and courtyards, there was no one quite like us: I am an African-American with long dreadlocks, and my friend, Maria, a Mexican-American, had her half-Dominican son in tow. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05PERSONAL_SPAN/05PERSONAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05PERSONAL_SPAN/05PERSONAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 352}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05PERSONAL_SPAN/05PERSONAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05PERSONAL_SPAN/05PERSONAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1201, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05PERSONAL_SPAN/05PERSONAL_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05PERSONAL_SPAN/05PERSONAL_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/travel/05PERSONAL_SPAN/05PERSONAL_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Traveling While Black', 'kicker': 'Personal Journeys', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Traveling While Black', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'n