ge for their freedom. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'General Cleburne’s Radical Plan', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Military)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Slavery', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Jefferson F', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-03T20:56:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phil Leigh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leigh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3559721b-9aa1-50de-b4c6-a43ef7493187', 'word_count': 1454, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3559721b-9aa1-50de-b4c6-a43ef7493187'}, {'abstract': 'Al Qaeda-affiliated groups battled security forces and tribal fighters in Anbar province.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/03/videos-of-fighters-and-air-raids-in-iraqs-anbar-province/', 'snippet': 'Al Qaeda-affiliated groups battled security forces and tribal fighters in Anbar province.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Radical Sunni militants aligned with Al Qaeda fought for control of Falluja and Ramadi on Friday, escalating a battle over the two cities that have increasingly become centers of Sunni extremism since American forces withdrew from the country at the end of 2011. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Videos of Fighters and Air Raids in Iraq’s Anbar Province', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': No