ts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-03T21:59:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alison Smale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alison', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/868cdaed-7e73-5229-8fc7-eb42bcc10026', 'word_count': 824, 'uri': 'nyt://article/868cdaed-7e73-5229-8fc7-eb42bcc10026'}, {'abstract': 'On the recently launched Paris-based website RESEE, buyers can find designs from past seasons that they lusted after but let get away.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/03/feeling-for-the-ultimate-vintage-e-shop-for-fashion-fanatics/', 'snippet': 'On the recently launched Paris-based website RESEE, buyers can find designs from past seasons that they lusted after but let get away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After the chaotic holiday months of planning the perfect gifts for others, it’s finally time to think about ourselves. For the fashion conscious, that means planning out your purchases for the upcoming season. But it’s hard to think of the future when you still haven’t crossed off dream items from wish lists of old, like, say those Balenciaga SS 2002 cargo pants or that black oversized Céline coat. Enter Resee, a website that helps track down coveted items that got away. Unveiled last fall by Sabrina Marshall, a former editor at Self Service magazine, and Sofia Bernardin, a Vogue advertising veteran, the secondhand e-shop specializes in vintage pieces by high-end designers like Alaïa, Hermès, Helmut Lang and Raf Simons. In addition to browsing the curated finds —\xa0sourced from some legendary sources, including the Paris vintage shop Nella, which gave Resee all its inventory when it closed last year, and the closets of some of the world’s most stylish women — guests can even fill out a virtual want ad for particularly elusive items. The site’s magazine-caliber design and photography is sure to suck you in for hours at a time — then send you forth into 2014 looking your very best.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/t-magazine/03reese-gilchrist/03reese-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/03/t-magazine/03reese-gilchrist/03reese-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/t-magazine/03reese-gilchrist/03reese-gilchrist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/t-magazine/03reese-gilchrist/03reese-gilchrist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/t-magazine/03reese-gilchrist/03reese-gilchrist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/03/t-magazine/03reese-gilchrist/03reese-gilchrist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/t-magazine/03reese-gilchrist/03reese-gilchrist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fee