om, Stacy Sullivan’s cabaret show, “It’s a Good Day: A Tribute to Peggy Lee,” reveals that singer’s complexity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/04/arts/music/stacy-sullivan-as-peggy-lee-sings-at-the-metropolitan-room.html', 'snippet': 'At the Metropolitan Room, Stacy Sullivan’s cabaret show, “It’s a Good Day: A Tribute to Peggy Lee,” reveals that singer’s complexity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The eye rolls, the swivel, the gowns and the platinum hair: The singer Peggy Lee has been parodied so often, especially by drag performers, that it is easy to confuse the caricature with the complicated pop-jazz singer who died 12 years ago this month. Sorting out the contradictions of Lee’s life and career, Stacy Sullivan’s show at the Metropolitan Room, “It’s a Good Day: A Tribute to Miss Peggy Lee,” paints an empathetic, melancholy portrait.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/04SULLIVAN/04SULLIVAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/04SULLIVAN/04SULLIVAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 667}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/04SULLIVAN/04SULLIVAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 922, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/04SULLIVAN/04SULLIVAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1799, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/04SULLIVAN/04SULLIVAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbn