ar can open their bottles of bubbly in dramatic fashion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/nyregion/opening-champagne-with-a-saber-at-the-baroness.html', 'snippet': 'After a quick lesson, patrons at this Long Island City bar can open their bottles of bubbly in dramatic fashion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the eve of New Year’s Eve, one neighborhood bar was already celebrating — as usual. The Baroness, six weeks old, in a nearly 100-year-old building in Long Island City, was offering instruction in the French art of sabrage. That is to say, patrons could open their own Champagne bottles with a saber, after a quick lesson from Mélanie Lemieux, owner and sommelier.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05TABLE1_SPAN/05TABLE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05TABLE1_SPAN/05TABLE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05TABLE1_SPAN/05TABLE1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05TABLE1_SPAN/05TABLE1_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05TABLE1_SPAN/05TABLE1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/05/nyregion/05TABLE1_SPAN/05TABLE1_SPAN-th