her in 20 Years', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Temperature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Green Bay Packers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lambeau Field', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Francisco 49ers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Minnesota', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-03T22:53:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9858266-2bed-5d32-af4b-6c4fdcfc6bdf', 'word_count': 502, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9858266-2bed-5d32-af4b-6c4fdcfc6bdf'}, {'abstract': 'Carmen Fariña, a 40-year veteran of the city school system, gained a reputation as a stern manager. Ms. Fariña will lean on her experience in her new role.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/nyregion/schools-chancellor-brings-joyful-and-fierce-style.html', 'snippet': 'Carmen Fariña, a 40-year veteran of the city school system, gained a reputation as a stern manager. Ms. Fariña will lean on her experience in her new role.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Late in the afternoon of New Year’s Eve, Carmen Fariña was preparing to have 10 people over to dinner, a plan, she joked, she wouldn’t have made had she known that the next day would mark the beginning of her tenure as the city’s new schools chancellor. Perhaps out of a subliminal sense of premonition or foresight, or just grandmotherly efficiency, she had arranged for a caterer. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_pa