5af'}, {'abstract': 'How can we make sure lawyers defend poor clients with vigor and care? Experiments in two states are trying to offer solutions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/sunday-review/need-blind-justice.html', 'snippet': 'How can we make sure lawyers defend poor clients with vigor and care? Experiments in two states are trying to offer solutions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — FIFTY years ago, in Gideon v. Wainwright, the Supreme Court ruled that poor people accused of serious crimes were entitled to lawyers paid for by the government. But the court did not say how the lawyers should be chosen, how much they should be paid or how to make sure they defended their clients with vigor and care.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/sunday-review/05VOUCHERS/05VOUCHERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1237, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/05/sunday-review/05VOUCHERS/05VOUCHERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1237}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/sunday-review/05VOUCHERS/05VOUCHERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 497, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/sunday-review/05VOUCHERS/05VOUCHERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 994, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/sunday-review/05VOUCHERS/05VOUCHERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/0