rk with in the studio as wet clay, died on Dec. 13 in Spruce Pine, N.C. He was 91.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/littelton-obit-1/littelton-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/littelton-obit-1/littelton-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 735}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/littelton-obit-1/littelton-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 836, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/littelton-obit-1/littelton-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1671, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/littelton-obit-1/littelton-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/littelton-obit-1/littelton-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/04/arts/littelton-obit-1/littelton-obit-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Harvey K. Littleton, a Pioneer in the Art of Glass, Dies at 91', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Harvey K. Littleton, 91, Pioneer in Glassworks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'p