Kinky Friedman — the singer, humorist and hawker of tequila — is running for agriculture commissioner, his third attempt at statewide office in three election cycles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/us/home-from-tour-and-back-on-ballot-singer-finds-a-reason-to-campaign.html', 'snippet': 'Kinky Friedman — the singer, humorist and hawker of tequila — is running for agriculture commissioner, his third attempt at statewide office in three election cycles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MEDINA, Tex. — Kinky Friedman practiced his smile as he sat on the front porch of his cabin on a secluded Hill Country ranch in December, three dogs scampering around his legs. He said he had gotten an instructive tip from a former Miss Mississippi. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/us/05ttFriedman/05ttFriedman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/03/us/05ttFriedman/05ttFriedman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 353}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/us/05ttFriedman/05ttFriedman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 603, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/us/05ttFriedman/05ttFriedman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1205, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/us/05ttFriedman/05ttFriedman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/03/us/05ttFriedman/05ttFriedman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/03/us/05ttFriedman/05ttFriedman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Home From Tour and Back on Ballot, Singer Finds a Reason to Campaign', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Home From Tour and Back on Ballot, Singer Finds a Reason to Campaign', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Friedman, Kinky', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-05T00:28:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Reeve Hamilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Reeve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hamilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10b4db4a-e175-58a8-b311-a72431b7af4a', 'word_count': 1014, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10b4db4a-e175-58a8-b311-a72431b7af4a'}, {'abstract': 'The new year brings a wide range of brand-new albums from Texas recording artists, including Reverend Horton Heat returning to punk-infused rockabilly, Ray Benson going eclectic and Los Lonely Boys sounding like the Beatles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/us/tunes-for-the-new-year-from-the-home-team.html', 'snippet': 'The new year brings a wide range of brand-new albums from Texas recording artists, including Reverend Horton Heat returning to punk-infused rockabilly, Ray Benson going eclectic and Los Lonely Boys sounding like the Beatles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Less than a month ago, a guide to prominent 2014 releases from Texas artists would have begun with a long-rumored Beyoncé album. Although she took that off the plate with her headline-grabbing stealth release on Dec. 13, a robust selection remains of Texans planning on ringing in the first part of the year with new albums. Our roundup — which ranges from a pair of Houston-based alternative rock acts to celebrated veterans branching out in new directions — hints at what the year may bring. And sets from Don Henley, the Austin rock band Spoon and the Old 97s, although still unscheduled, are on the horizon.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/us/05ttCulture1/05ttCulture1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/05/us/05ttCulture1/05ttCulture1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/us/05ttCulture1/05ttCulture1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/us/05ttCulture1/05ttCulture1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1283, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/05/us/05ttCulture1/05ttCulture1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/05/us/05ttCulture1/05ttCulture1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype