o the pond. Out of it stepped Gary Locke, the American ambassador, who this month is expected to leave his post and return to his hometown of Seattle. This was Mr. Locke’s fifth visit to his ancestral village in the Taishan region of Guangdong Province, and his third and possibly final one as ambassador to China.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Ambassador Renews Ties to His Ancestral Village', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Locke, Gary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guangdong Province (China)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Taishan (China)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (State)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-05T21:00:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Wong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86020bfe-091b-5a9c-a30f-956d39abf24e', 'word_count': 824, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86020bfe-091b-5a9c-a30f-956d39abf24e'}, {'abstract': 'Teresa LaBarbera was the local traffic reporter at WTNH in Connecticut. Brandon Dufour was a driving instructor. When they met on-air during a news segment, the connection was immediate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/fashion/weddings/100000002632280/in-love-and-traffic.html', 'snippet': 'Teresa LaBarbera was the local traffic reporter at WTNH in Connecticut. Brandon Dufour was a driving instr