s', '_id': 'nyt://article/a4d30c9c-cdb0-577a-8822-8551c4137afe', 'word_count': 657, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4d30c9c-cdb0-577a-8822-8551c4137afe'}, {'abstract': 'New York’s new mayor, Bill de Blasio, like another populist leader, President Andrew Jackson, threw his official residence open to a long line of well-wishers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/nyregion/de-blasio-holds-open-house-at-gracie-mansion-his-new-home.html', 'snippet': 'New York’s new mayor, Bill de Blasio, like another populist leader, President Andrew Jackson, threw his official residence open to a long line of well-wishers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gracie Mansion, the buttercream-hued mayoral residence on a bluff overlooking the East River, has stood stately but mostly silent for more than 12 years, its elegant interiors reserved for the formal functions of a mayor, Michael R. Bloomberg, who chose to live elsewhere.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'De Blasio Holds Open House at Gracie Mansion, His New Home', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hours’ Wait, to See Where de Blasio Doesn’t Live Yet', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gracie Mansion (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-05T22:02:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5921e33-cbb6-58b9-893f-9bb0a4019f36', 'word_count': 862, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5921e33-cbb6-58b9-893f-9bb0a4019f36'}, {'abstract': 'Capitalizing on three second-half turnovers by Andy Dalton, the upstart Chargers extended the Bengals’ playoff-victory drought to 23 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/sports/football/hungry-for-respect-bengals-have-to-swallow-playoff-loss-against-chargers.html', 'snippet': 'Capitalizing on three second-half turnovers by Andy Dalton, the upstart Chargers extended the Bengals’ playoff-victory drought to 23 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CINCINNATI — Here along the banks of the murky Ohio River, where a generation has wallowed in the futility of the beloved Bengals, the paradigm has shifted: Respect is gained not by reaching the postseason but by winning there.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/sports/football/06afc/06afc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/06/sports/football/06afc/06afc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/sports/football/06afc/06afc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/sports/football/06afc/06afc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1639, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/sports/football/06afc/06afc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/06/sports/football/06afc/06afc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thu