name': 'Steinhauer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0f94f76-cfeb-5d96-a13e-41def9396030', 'word_count': 1330, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0f94f76-cfeb-5d96-a13e-41def9396030'}, {'abstract': 'Next Generation Caterers in the Bronx helps the young adults who serve as interns in their quest for jobs and self-reliance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/nyregion/seeking-independence-three-men-start-in-the-kitchen.html', 'snippet': 'Next Generation Caterers in the Bronx helps the young adults who serve as interns in their quest for jobs and self-reliance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Five men were playing pool recently in the sunny, airy lobby of the Next Generation Center in the South Bronx. One of the men offered pool tips to the others. Later, two men greeted each other with a tight hug.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Seeking Independence, Three Men Start in the Kitchen', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Seeking Independence, Three Men Start in the Kitchen', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times Neediest Cases Fund', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Children's Aid Society", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-06T03:01:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Grippe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grippe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/25266faf-656c-58a2-ae6a-7ec32bf7a74d', 'word_count': 894, 'uri': 'nyt://article/25266faf-656c-58a2-ae6a-7ec32bf7a74d'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Andrew Cuomo is to announce that he will allow 20 hospitals across New York to dispense medical marijuana, but there is little insight into the details.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/nyregion/with-marijuana-access-on-the-horizon-patients-fear-potential-restrictions.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Andrew Cuomo is to announce that he will allow 20 hospitals across New York to dispense medical marijuana, but there is little insight into the details.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nancy Rivera, a cancer survivor, has a bag of pills in her night stand — white, gold and rust, big and little, antidepressants, antiemetics and tranquilizers — given to her by doctors. So it always seemed hypocritical to her that while she could possess such powerful mind-altering pharmaceuticals in fairly generous quantities, she was not allowed to legally smoke marijuana to relieve the nausea and pain of her cancer and chemotherapy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/nyregion/NYPOT-sub/NYPOT-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/06/nyregion/NYPOT-sub/NYPOT-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/nyregion/NYPOT-sub/NYPOT-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/nyregion/NYPOT-sub/NYPOT-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}