s, is acquiring Sense Networks, which mines location and behavioral data to provide targeted search and display ads.', 'lead_paragraph': 'YP, the local search and advertising company owned by Cerberus Capital Management and AT&T, said on Monday that it had acquired Sense Networks, a mobile ad company.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'YP, a Mobile Search Firm, Buys Sense Networks', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mobile Ad Expansion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Advertising', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cerberus Capital Management', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sense Networks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YP.com', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-06T12:34:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gelles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gelles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86f6aad6-64d7-5bf5-aa39-5273e1212d76', 'word_count': 250, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86f6aad6-64d7-5bf5-aa39-5273e1212d76'}, {'abstract': 'As the demands of Indian democracy grew more vocal, Prime Minister Manmohan Singh was defined by an imperturbable silence.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/the-man-who-forgot-he-was-prime-minister/', 'snippet': 'As the demands of Indian democracy grew more vocal, Prime Minister Manmohan Singh was defined by an imperturbable silence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — In political life, perhaps there is no public reaction 