b4841b', 'word_count': 1, 'uri': 'nyt://article/937c21da-af8c-5ae8-908f-664514b4841b'}, {'abstract': 'Don’t count the singer-songwriter Christine Lavin among the fans of “Inside Llewyn Davis.” “I hate this film,” she tells the Bagger.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/a-folkie-takes-issue-with-llewyn-davis/', 'snippet': 'Don’t count the singer-songwriter Christine Lavin among the fans of “Inside Llewyn Davis.” “I hate this film,” she tells the Bagger.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Even before the Oscar nominations are announced next week, this has been a season rife with controversy, from the moral stance of “Wolf of Wall Street” to the religious one of “Philomena.” Incidentally, these brouhahas don’t happen to hurt the marketing of the movies in question, since “come see for yourself” has been an irresistible tagline since the dawn of Hollywood, scandal or no. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Folkie Takes Issue With ‘Llewyn Davis’', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Folk Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lavin, Christine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Van Ronk, Dave', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-06T15:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0468b414-1105-5dde-8c6f-04c6fbe936f2', 'word_count': 403, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0468b414-1105-5dde-8c6f-04c6fbe936f2'}, {'abstract': 'From The International Herald Tribune.', 'web_url': 'htt