classic pop harmonies delivered in a British accent and imaginative lyrics that have stood up for half a century. And when you think of these attributes, surely you also think of Eurythmics, John Mayer, Keith Urban and Maroon 5. Or, at least, CBS is hoping that you will, as those are some of the first artists they’ve lined up to perform in a television tribute to the Beatles that will be broadcast on the network next month.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Eurythmics to Reunite for Beatles Tribute', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keys, Alicia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Legend, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lennox, Annie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mayer, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stewart, Dave', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Urban, Keith', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-06T17:11:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/533b4600-9ce3-56a0-8db6-e1d65b9d1b61', 'word_count': 266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/533b4600-9ce3-56a0-8db6-e1d65b9d1b61'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Giovanni discusses her new book, “Chasing Utopia,” which includes poems, short stories and recipes.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/the-read-around-video-of-nikki-giovanni/', 'snippet': 'Ms. Giovanni discusses her new book, “Chasing Utopia,” which includes poems, short stories and recipes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “The Read Around,” a weekly video fe