nce on Syria if it persuaded President Bashar al-Assad to stop the bombardment of Aleppo and allow the delivery of humanitarian aid to besieged towns and cities, senior State Department officials said on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iran Urged to Use Influence With Syrian Leader', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerry, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-06T18:09:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael R. Gordon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Gordon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a0c32ec-316b-5413-b95d-ad06bf7f66b9', 'word_count': 927, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a0c32ec-316b-5413-b95d-ad06bf7f66b9'}, {'abstract': 'The French actress wore Prada and Miu Miu to accept a nomination for the EE Rising Star Awards today in London.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/the-look-lea-seydouxs-luxe-combo-of-florals-crystals-and-satin/', 'snippet': 'The French actress wore Prada and Miu Miu to accept a nomination for the EE Rising Star Awards today in London.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Girl: The French actress and model, who earne