global rates, had been hired as part of Morgan Stanley’s efforts to balance in its fixed-income operations after the 2008 financial crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/prominent-bond-trader-leaves-morgan-stanley/', 'snippet': 'Glenn Hadden, who was head of global rates, had been hired as part of Morgan Stanley’s efforts to balance in its fixed-income operations after the 2008 financial crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A prominent bond trader who was hired to revitalize Morgan Stanley’s trading business but whose division racked up sizable losses has left the Wall Street firm. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/business/dbpix-hadden/dbpix-hadden-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 375, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/business/dbpix-hadden/dbpix-hadden-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 375, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/business/dbpix-hadden/dbpix-hadden-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/07/business/dbpix-hadden/dbpix-hadden-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/business/dbpix-hadden/dbpix-hadden-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Prominent Bond Trader Leaves Morgan Stanley', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stepping Down'