itual, strange and visually spectacular. Offering decadent visions of alternate realities and mystic rituals, the films became a favorite with audiences of that era, as well as with generations of (often stoned) college students ever since. The 84-year-old director, who lives in Paris, recently returned to his hometown of Tocopilla, Chile, to make “The Dance of Reality,” an autobiographical film that also manages to be a hypnotic surrealist fantasia. The film, which hits American theaters in May, received a standing ovation when it premiered at the Cannes Film Festival last year. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/t-magazine/06jodorowski-miller2/06jodorowski-miller2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/06/t-magazine/06jodorowski-miller2/06jodorowski-miller2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/t-magazine/06jodorowski-miller2/06jodorowski-miller2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1023, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/t-magazine/06jodorowski-miller2/06jodorowski-miller2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1889, 'width': 1890, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/06/t-magazine/06jodorowski-miller2/06jodorowski-miller2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/06/t-magazine/06jodorowski-miller2/06jodorowski-miller2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwi