rn has used two miracles to get to the national championship game; Florida State has climbed on the back of the Heisman Trophy winner. Which team will claim the title? Times reporters will follow the action throughout the game. Follow along and join the conversation.', 'web_url': 'https://sports.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/06/live-analysis-of-the-b-c-s-championship-game/', 'snippet': 'Auburn has used two miracles to get to the national championship game; Florida State has climbed on the back of the Heisman Trophy winner. Which team will claim the title? Times reporters will follow the action throughout the game. Follow along an...', 'lead_paragraph': 'After trailing for most of the game, Florida State stunned Auburn with a late touchdown to win its first national championship since 1999, 34-31. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/sports/football/07BCS_05/07BCS_05-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/07/sports/football/07BCS_05/07BCS_05-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/sports/football/07BCS_05/07BCS_05-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/sports/football/07BCS_05/07BCS_05-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/sports/football/07BCS_05/07BCS_05-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbna