.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/07/opinion/medical-marijuana-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'A limited plan by Gov. Andrew Cuomo to loosen restrictions on its use should be expanded and strengthened by the State Legislature.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Andrew Cuomo of New York is set to use his executive powers to loosen restrictions on the use of marijuana for medical purposes. The Legislature, where medical marijuana bills have stalled repeatedly in the State Senate, ought to expand and strengthen the governor’s effort through appropriate legislation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Medical Marijuana in New York', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Medical Marijuana in New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medical Marijuana', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, State Legislature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-07T02:17:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9254432a-a4a0-59dd-912b-1cc658665b87', 'word_count': 294, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9254432a-a4a0-59dd-912b-1cc658665b87'}, {'abstract': 'As family and friends ascended the steps of Menachem Stark’s brick rowhouse on Monday to pay their respects, they were abuzz with a single question: Why had he been killed?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/07/nyregion/as-mourning-continues-for-abducted-man-rumors-fly-in-hasidic-community.html', 'snippet': 'As family and friends ascended the steps of Menachem Stark’s brick rowhouse on Monday to pay their respects, they were abuzz with a single question: Why had he been killed?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The mourning for Menachem Stark, a Hasidic real estate developer from Brooklyn who was kidnapped and killed last week, was not a quiet affair. As family and friends ascended the steps of his red brick rowhouse on Monday to pay their respects, they were abuzz with a single question: Why had he been killed?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/nyregion/Y-ABDUCT1/Y-ABDUCT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/07/nyregion/Y-ABDUCT1/Y-ABDUCT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/nyregion/Y-ABDUCT1/Y-ABDUCT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/nyregion/Y-ABDUCT1/Y-ABDUCT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 927, 'width': 1390, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/07/nyregion/Y-ABDUCT1/Y-ABDUCT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/07/nyregion/Y-ABDUCT1/Y-ABDUCT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image