tte.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/07/lineup-set-for-tribute-to-music-of-paul-simon/', 'snippet': 'Among the performers for a concert at Carnegie Hall honoring the music of Paul Simon are Joy Williams and Bettye LaVette.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the last nine years Michael Dorf, the owner of City Winery, has made an annual trip uptown to raise money for music education programs by way of a tribute concert at Carnegie Hall. This year’s installment, on March 31, the 10th in Mr. Dorf’s series, honors the music of Paul Simon. The preliminary lineup for the concert, which Mr. Dorf is expected to announce on Tuesday, includes Joy Williams (of the Civil Wars), the soul singer Bettye LaVette, the singer-songwriters Bob Mould, Dan Wilson and Ben Sollee, the composer Allen Toussaint and a collaboration between the jazz singer Madeleine Peyroux and Jon Herington, the lead guitarist of Steely Dan.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lineup Set for Tribute to Music of Paul Simon', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lineup for Tribute To Music of Paul Simon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dorf, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'John, Elton', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LaVette, Bettye', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mould, Bob', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simon, Paul', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sollee, Ben', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Joy Elizabeth (1982- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Dan', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carnegie Hall', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City Winery', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-07T05:01:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62e7bec9-5888-5afd-b32f-30e23e23994b', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62e7bec9-5888-5afd-b32f-30e23e23994b'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in 82 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/07/word-of-the-day-shimmer/', 'snippet': 'This word has appeared in 82 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'shimmer •\\ˈshi-mər\\• verb and noun ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Word of the Day | shimmer', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-07T05:01:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8ee8467-a7aa-55af-9972-09fcf546c3d1', 'word_count': 158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8ee8467-a7aa-55af-9972-09fcf546c3d1'}, {'abstract': 'A larger House of Representatives would be more democratic and more in line with the geography of population, an economist writes.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/07/enlarging-the-house-of-representatives/', 'snippet': 'A larger House of Representatives would be more democratic and more in line with the geography of population, an economist writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bruce Bartlett held senior policy roles in the Reagan and George H.W. Bush