_count': 264, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1d4f891-a87f-5a76-857e-a79810f0c0f8'}, {'abstract': 'On Tuesday, New Yorkers seemed to accept the record cold as just another trial in the gantlet of seasonal indignities city dwellers face.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/07/nyregion/new-yorkers-cope-with-record-cold-temperatures.html', 'snippet': 'On Tuesday, New Yorkers seemed to accept the record cold as just another trial in the gantlet of seasonal indignities city dwellers face.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was 8 degrees at 4:30 a.m., but it felt like minus 12, a fact of which Mike Peters was grimly aware. Mr. Peters, a utility worker, stood neck deep in a two-foot-by-two-foot pit hacked into the pavement of Avenue of the Americas in Greenwich Village, the sidewalk around him slicked with ice that fringed the hole he was in with filthy icicles.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Yorkers Struggle to Shrug Off the Icicles', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Temperature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-07T14:02:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Maslin Nir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': 'Maslin', 'lastname': 'Nir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/593affad-0273-528d-8e09-db05b435af87', 'word_count': 694, 'uri': 'nyt://article/593affad-0273-528d-8e09-db05b435af87'}, {'abstract': 'Christodoulos Xiros, a member of the terrorist group November 17, is at large after failing to 