f other composers’ works.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Given the plentitude of chamber music series in New York, it is easy to take low-visibility offerings for granted, despite the consistency, excellence and affordability of their programs. I had not been to a concert by the Jupiter Symphony Chamber Players in a long while when I attended Monday afternoon’s program at Good Shepherd Church. I will not let so much time slip by again. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oldies Done in New Palettes', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oldies Done in New Palettes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tommasini, Anthony', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jupiter Symphony Chamber Players', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-07T22:12:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anthony Tommasini', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anthony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tommasini', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8887186-5dd6-51d8-aa61-2ac342cbcc9f', 'word_count': 558, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8887186-5dd6-51d8-aa61-2ac342cbcc9f'}, {'abstract': 'The writer Toni Bentley and the actress Laura Campbell discuss preparations for a solo show based on “The Surrender,” Ms. Bentley’s erotic memoir.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/08/theater/the-surrender-adapted-from-toni-bentleys-erotic-memoir.html', 'snippet': 'The writer Toni Bentley and the actress Laura Campbell discuss preparations for a solo show based on “The Surren