ts about its atmosphere suggested the leader might be abandoning ship.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Diane von Furstenberg to Leave Lincoln Center', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'von Furstenberg, Diane', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Council of Fashion Designers of America', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-07T22:33:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7021f09a-1599-5b7f-8459-602fe5bd2f97', 'word_count': 279, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7021f09a-1599-5b7f-8459-602fe5bd2f97'}, {'abstract': 'The Bowl Championship Series, debated and ridiculed during its existence, produced a thrilling last act before a new playoff system took over.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/08/sports/ncaafootball/rest-in-peace-bcs-a-maligned-system-that-sometimes-worked.html', 'snippet': 'The Bowl Championship Series, debated and ridiculed during its existence, produced a thrilling last act before a new playoff system took over.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PASADENA, Calif. — The Bowl Championship Series, a postseason system that drew the ire of college football coaches, players and fans while enriching bowl directors and the establishment that profited from it, died Monday night after Florida State topped Auburn