g operation that brought the ivory tusks from Canada into the United States through Maine, in violation of the Marine Mammal Protection Act. No sentencing date has been set. Mr. Zarauskas is to be tried next month. Mr. Logan was arrested last month in Canada. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Maine: Man Pleads Guilty in Tusk Smuggling Case', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | New England', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Maine: Man Pleads Guilty In Tusk Smuggling Case ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bidgood, Jess', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Conrad, Jay G', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smuggling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMALS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ivory', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Whales and Whaling', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-08T01:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc4ae4ba-0c4b-50d5-8524-6dfc477c69d9', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc4ae4ba-0c4b-50d5-8524-6dfc477c69d9'}, {'abstract': 'Mike Duggan delivered his first public address as the new mayor of Detroit on Tuesday, asking frustrated residents not to move out of the bankrupt city.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/08/us/michigan-new-mayor-asks-detroit-residents-to-stay.html', 'snippet': 'Mike Duggan delivered his first public address as the new mayor of Detroit on Tuesday, asking frustrated residents not to move out of the bankrupt city.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Mike Duggan delivered his first public address as the new mayor of Detroit on Tuesday, asking frustrated residents not to move out of the bankrupt city before giving his fledgling administration time to improve neighborhood services. “Give us six months to prove that we can turn things around,” said Mr. Duggan, who took office on Jan. 1. “Just push the pause button and don’t leave that house yet.” He said the success of his tenure as mayor would be determined by whether Detroit’s population — which has dropped by more than a million since 1950 — increases over the next four years. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Michigan: New Mayor Detroit Asks Detroit Residents To Stay ', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Midwest', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Michigan: New Mayor Detroit Asks Detroit Residents To Stay ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duggan, Mike', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yaccino, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-08T01:07:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Yaccino', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yaccino', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f795fa1-5162-57bd-9810-fe1ff20618fa', 'word_count': 102, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f795fa1-5162-57bd-9810-fe1ff20618fa'}, {'abstract': 'A new G.M.O.-free label is either a cynical marketing ploy or a huge deal or, possibly, both.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/08/opinion/bittman-how-many-cheers-for-cheerios.html', 'snippet': 'A new G.M.O.-free label is either a cynical marketi