t in 2011 after Iranian protesters stormed the British Embassy. Mr. Straw was scheduled to meet with Iran’s foreign minister, Mohammad Javad Zarif, during the four-day visit. It comes a month after Britain’s new envoy to Iran, Ajay Sharma, traveled to Iran, the first diplomatic visit by a British official since 2011. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iran: In Thaw, British Lawmakers Visit', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Middle East', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iran: British Lawmakers Visit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Straw, Jack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-08T02:32:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/87a28abf-35c4-5793-b705-8a25ca7b9b6b', 'word_count': 91, 'uri': 'nyt://article/87a28abf-35c4-5793-b705-8a25ca7b9b6b'}, {'abstract': 'A state judge on Tuesday unexpectedly blocked about half of New York University’s large and hotly debated expansion plan in the school’s leafy and largely low-scale neighborhood.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/08/nyregion/judge-blocks-part-of-nyus-plan-for-four-towers-in-greenwich-village.html', 'snippet': 'A state judge on Tuesday unexpectedly blocked about half of New York University’s large and hotly debated expansion plan in the school’s leafy and largely low-scale nei