bout flaws in the oversight of the ambitious federal program aimed at converting patient records from paper to electronic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/08/business/report-finds-more-flaws-in-digitizing-patient-files.html', 'snippet': 'The report is the second in two months to warn about flaws in the oversight of the ambitious federal program aimed at converting patient records from paper to electronic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Although the federal government is spending more than $22 billion to encourage hospitals and doctors to adopt electronic health records, it has failed to put safeguards in place to prevent the technology from being used for inflating costs and overbilling, according to a new report by a federal oversight agency.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Report Finds More Flaws in Digitizing Patient Files', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Report Finds More Flaws in Digitizing Patient Files', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abelson, Reed', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electronic Health Records', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Privacy', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-08T05:01:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Reed Abelson and Julie Creswell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Reed', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abelson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'ro