nce-enhancing drugs, were elected to the Baseball Hall of Fame on their first try, one year after writers chose no one for Cooperstown.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/09/sports/baseball/maddux-glavine-and-thomas-elected-to-hall.html', 'snippet': 'Greg Maddux, Tom Glavine and Frank Thomas, stars with no connection to performance-enhancing drugs, were elected to the Baseball Hall of Fame on their first try, one year after writers chose no one for Cooperstown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year after delivering a sobering verdict on the game’s recent history, baseball writers on Wednesday found three players to celebrate. Greg Maddux, Tom Glavine and Frank Thomas, decorated stars with no connection to the performance-enhancing drug scandal that warped much of their era, were elected to the Baseball Hall of Fame on their first try.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/08/sports/baseball/FAME/FAME-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/08/sports/baseball/FAME/FAME-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/08/sports/baseball/FAME/FAME-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/08/sports/baseball/FAME/FAME-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/08/sports/baseball/FAME/FAME-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cro