s://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/09/arts/dance/bolshoi-to-visit-lincoln-center-festival.html', 'snippet': 'The 2014 Lincoln Center Festival will feature the Bolshoi Ballet as well as Heisei Nakamura-za, the Japanese Kabuki company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York ballet fans should get an unusual chance to see the growing globalization of dance careers this summer without leaving Lincoln Center: David Hallberg is scheduled to dance in June at the Metropolitan Opera House with American Ballet Theater, where he is a principal dancer, and in July at the David H. Koch Theater with the Bolshoi Ballet, which he joined in 2011.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bolshoi to Visit Lincoln Center Festival', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bolshoi to Visit Lincoln Center Festival', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cooper, Michael', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bolshoi Ballet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lincoln Center Festival', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bolshoi Opera', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-08T21:11:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/17b2e2b9-a77c-5312-b736-4bae8da7f428', 'word_count': 341, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17b2e2b9-a77c-5312-b736-4bae8da7f428'}, {'abstract': 'For some professional skiers, helicopter pilots have emerged as essential partners. One such pilot has come to specialize in helping skiers reach new terrain in Alaska.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/09/sports/video-heli-pilot-and-skiers-redefine-whats-possible.html', 'snippet': 'For some professional skiers, helicopter pilots have emerged as essential partners. One such pilot has come to specialize in helping skiers reach new terrain in Alaska.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Behind the Line is a video series produced by Teton Gravity Research that takes you into the minds of skiers. In each episode, the athletes will look back on a line, a jump or a session, and discuss the moment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video: Heli Pilot and Skiers Redefine What’s Possible', 'kicker': 'Behind the Line', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Teton Gravity Research', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collinson, Angel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skiing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-08T21:12:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ffde9d8-e1e3-5b88-9f60-f4fa7aeee093', 'word_count': 222, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ffde9d8-e1e3-5b88-9f60-f4fa7aeee093'}, {'abstract': 'Frank Luntz is selling a majority stake in Luntz Global to MDC Partners, an agency holding group that owns more than 50 agencies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/09/business/media/republican-pollster-teams-with-madison-avenue-agency.html', 'snippet': 'Frank Luntz is selling a majority stake in Luntz Global to MDC Partners, an agency holding group that owns more than 50 agencies.', 'lead_pa