h-eddy-alvarez/', 'snippet': 'Eddy Alvarez, who will be competing in his first Olympics in Sochi in February, takes us through a speedskater’s workout.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Being a successful short-track speedskater is no easy feat. Members of the United States team follow a grueling schedule that involves up to eight hours of training, six days a week. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Workout: Speedskating With Eddy Alvarez', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muscles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2014)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Short Track Skating', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speedskating', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-09T05:01:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': "By Anahad O'Connor", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anahad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Connor", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f19c0cf-d3b3-5f05-af1c-60725f1f3d02', 'word_count': 1469, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f19c0cf-d3b3-5f05-af1c-60725f1f3d02'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in 153 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/09/word-of-the-day-dissolution/', 'snippet': 'This word has appeared in 153 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'dissolution •\\ˌdi-sə-ˈlü-shən\\• noun ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Word of the Day | dissolution', 'kicker': 'The Lea