super-bowl-lineup/', 'snippet': 'The cable channel VH1 announced a series of six concerts on the nights leading up to the Super Bowl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You might be so busy dancing you’ll forget about the kickoff. VH1’s Super Bowl Blitz, a series of six concerts on the six nights leading up to the Super Bowl on Feb. 2, will include a late-night (11 p.m.) performance in each of the five boroughs of New York, as well as Montclair, N.J., the station announced Thursday. Time Warner Cable has announced a series of Super Bowl events at its Manhattan studios that also include performances.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'VH1 Offers Its Super Bowl Lineup', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DeGraw, Gavin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Drake (Rapper)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Earvin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Monae, Janelle', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Time Warner Cable Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'VH1', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Montclair (NJ)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Staten Island (NYC)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-09T16:00:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'la