amily members sometimes send doctors letters because they aren’t sure they had done everything they could to help prevent a loved one’s death.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/09/letters-to-the-doctor-2/', 'snippet': 'I suspect that family members sometimes send doctors letters because they aren’t sure they had done everything they could to help prevent a loved one’s death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I entered the exam room to see my first patient of the day, a doctor from another department at my hospital, I found her sitting in the chair I usually occupy, typing away at the computer on the tiny desk. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/health/10well_letters/10well_letters-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/10/health/10well_letters/10well_letters-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/health/10well_letters/10well_letters-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 556, 'width': 863, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/health/10well_letters/10well_letters-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 556, 'width': 863, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/health/10well_letters/10well_letters-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/10/health/10well_letters/10well_letters-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge'