ers-some-jokes-some-self-analysis/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Shteyngart was at St. Joseph’s College in Brooklyn on Wednesday to promote his new memoir, “Little Failure.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gary Shteyngart was speaking on Wednesday night about the difficulties of recapturing his past on the page. “There was one acid trip I wanted to write about,” he said, “and in interviewing five people, I realized it never happened.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/09/books/09shteyngart/09shteyngart-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/09/books/09shteyngart/09shteyngart-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 448}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/09/books/09shteyngart/09shteyngart-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/09/books/09shteyngart/09shteyngart-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/09/books/09shteyngart/09shteyngart-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/09/books/09shteyngart/09shteyngart-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/09/books/09shteyngart/09shteyngart-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main'