a2e03ffde', 'word_count': 385, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4f07ff8-b68c-5135-a80e-f70a2e03ffde'}, {'abstract': 'Six electronic-cigarette shops have recently opened in New York City, providing supplies, guidance and something of a scene.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/12/nyregion/e-cigarette-shops-open-even-as-city-cracks-down.html', 'snippet': 'Six electronic-cigarette shops have recently opened in New York City, providing supplies, guidance and something of a scene.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A half-dozen people were gathered around the tasting bar at the Henley Vaporium in SoHo on a recent Friday evening. Behind the bar, two vapologists in white lab coats stood before a selection of dozens of tiny bottles, each containing liquid nicotine. The customers, all students or young professionals, leisurely inhaled on their so-called vape pens. Clouds of mist curled upward and vanished. A slightly sweet smell lingered in the air.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/nyregion/12VAPORIUM_SPAN/12VAPORIUM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/12/nyregion/12VAPORIUM_SPAN/12VAPORIUM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/nyregion/12VAPORIUM_SPAN/12VAPORIUM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/nyregion/12VAPORIUM_SPAN/12VAPORIUM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i