icle/d3bb3972-38b0-56f1-b462-9a1d3e888f04'}, {'abstract': 'Running back David Wilson will have surgery this month to repair a herniated disk in his neck, although it is expected that he will be recovered sufficiently to play next season, the team said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/10/sports/football/giants-david-wilson-to-have-neck-surgery.html', 'snippet': 'Running back David Wilson will have surgery this month to repair a herniated disk in his neck, although it is expected that he will be recovered sufficiently to play next season, the team said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Giants running back David Wilson will have surgery this month to repair a herniated disk in his neck, although it is expected that he will be recovered sufficiently to play next season, the team said Thursday. The Giants had been hoping that rest and treatment might alleviate the injury, which sidelined Wilson for most of the season. Surgery has instead become the recommended option.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants’ David Wilson to Have Neck Surgery', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giants’ Wilson Set For Surgery On Neck', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, David Emmanuel (1991- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-10T00:36:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ce03a4a5-777e-5759-a8e6-5ebc19e4