ess endangerment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/10/nyregion/signs-of-abuse-in-toddlers-death-but-few-warnings.html', 'snippet': 'The police said that Myls Dobson had been in the care of Kryzie King, a family friend he barely knew, who has been charged with assault and reckless endangerment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By age 4, Myls Dobson knew the dislocation of family court hearings and custody fights. He also knew the love of grandparents and aunts. His smiling face beamed from Facebook, a healthy toddler full of promise, dressed up in ties or posing by a courthouse in Manhattan.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/nyregion/10child02/10child02-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 265, 'width': 194, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/nyregion/10child02/10child02-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 265, 'width': 194, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/nyregion/10child02/10child02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/10/nyregion/10child02/10child02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/nyregion/10child02/10child02-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Signs of Abuse in Toddler’s Death, but Few Warnings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Signs of Abuse in Toddler’s Death, but Few