better view of the day’s events: the public hanging of 17-year-old David O. Dodd, a convicted Confederate spy. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Execution of David O. Dodd', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARKANSAS', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-10T16:30:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cate Lineberry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lineberry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/80241597-3ba3-5ff6-870f-aa28f9cf038d', 'word_count': 1146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80241597-3ba3-5ff6-870f-aa28f9cf038d'}, {'abstract': 'Months after announcing a plan to recall Jeep S.U.V.’s, Chrysler said it would go ahead and install trailer hitches as a fix.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/11/automobiles/chrysler-to-recall-fire-prone-jeeps-to-add-trailer-hitches.html', 'snippet': 'Months after announcing a plan to recall Jeep S.U.V.’s, Chrysler said it would go ahead and install trailer hitches as a fix.', 'lead_paragraph': "After announcing a recall last June over a rear-impact collision fire hazard, Chrysler is finally preparing to recall nearly 1.6 million 1993-98 Jeep Grand Cherokees and 2002-7 Jeep Liberty S.U.V.'s. The fix the automaker is using to correct the problem – the vehicles’ fuel tanks are exposed to rear impacts – is controversial: Chrysler will install trailer hitches to protect the fuel tanks and reduce the chance of fires caused by rear-impact collisions.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/automobiles/10HITCH-Jeepimage/10HITCH-Jeepimage-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/10/automobiles/10HITCH-Jeepimage/10HITCH-Jeepimage-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/automobiles/10HITCH-Jeepimage/10HITCH-Jeepimage-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/automobiles/10HITCH-Jeepimage/10HITCH-Jeepimage-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/automobiles/10HITCH-Jeepimage/10HITCH-Jeepimage-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/10/automobiles/10HITCH-Jeepimage/10HITCH-Jeepimage-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/10/automobiles/10HITCH-Jeepimage/10HITCH-Jeepimage-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Chrysler to Recall Fire-Prone Jeeps to Add Trailer Hitches', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub':