, 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/magazine/from-tweet-to-ad-to-mini-modern-scandal.html', 'snippet': 'A descent into the wormhole created by the collision of movie-awards campaigning and paracritical chirping.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’ve seen “Inside Llewyn Davis,” the latest movie by Joel and Ethan Coen, you know that it has an unusual narrative structure: The story unwinds along a loose, rambling path and then loops back on itself, catching hold of (if not quite swallowing) its own tail. The story I’m about to tell has a similar shape. It’s hard to say where it begins or ends and even more difficult to say what it all means.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '46', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19riff/19riff-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 89, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19riff/19riff-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 89}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19riff/19riff-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 151, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19riff/19riff-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 303, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19riff/19riff-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19riff/19riff-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge'