oo-big-to-fail parade, what about a closer look at the asset management firms that oversee trillions of investor dollars?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Everyone knows that the largest of our nation’s banks would be destined for a taxpayer bailout if they ran into trouble anytime soon. But which nonbank financial institutions — say, asset management companies offering hedge funds or mutual funds — might also pose too-big-to-fail risks because of their size and interconnections?', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bailout Risk, Far Beyond the Banks', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bailout Risk, Far Beyond The Banks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morgenson, Gretchen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mutual Funds', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Financial Stability Board', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-11T16:05:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gretchen Morgenson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gretchen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morgenson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac2eabf2-2b4a-5521-9778-a288acd3cde7', 'word_count': 1040, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac2eabf2-2b4a-5521-9778-a288acd3cde7'}, {'abstract': 'A group that creates medical technology for developing countries has found that the job goes far beyond research and design.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/12/business/international/light-bulb-moments-for-a-nonprofit.html', 'snippet': 'A group that creates medical technology for developing countries has found that the job goes far beyond research and design.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No baby should die or be disabled because a light bulb can’t be replaced. Yet during visits to hospitals in India and other countries, Krista Donaldson often saw lifesaving phototherapy systems, used to treat infant jaundice, languishing in dusty corners because of burned-out bulbs and other seemingly simple problems.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/business/12-DREV-JP1/12-DREV-JP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/12/business/12-DREV-JP1/12-DREV-JP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/business/12-DREV-JP1/12-DREV-JP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/business/12-DREV-JP1/12-DREV-JP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/business/12-DREV-JP1/12-DREV-JP1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014