 makes that possible and frees them to make a strong contract offer to Masahiro Tanaka', 'lead_paragraph': 'For more than two years, the Yankees have considered Alex Rodriguez’s record-setting contract a burden, a mistake and a hindrance to their planning. With so much money invested in a rapidly declining player, Rodriguez’s presence was a reminder of the team’s financial folly.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Yanks, Some Payroll Relief Now but Questions Down the Road', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Yanks, Some Payroll Relief Now but Questions Down the Road', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waldstein, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Alex', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tanaka, Masahiro', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cashman, Brian', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-11T19:29:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/96ffdc38-3e07-5586-9bd3-50b14473f921', 'word_count': 887, 'uri': 'nyt://article/96ffdc38-3e07-5586-9bd3-50b14473f921'}, {'abstract': 'Chris Christie groveled like a champ, but the traffic jam scam is still unraveling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/12/opinion/sunday/dowd-thunder-road.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Christie groveled like a champ, but the traffic jam sca