he penalty periods have often been shortened or vacated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Through the decades, suspensions in sports have come in all sizes and for offenses that include attacking a coach and protesting a war. Often assumed to be career-enders, suspensions have often been shortened or vacated, allowing players to resume doing what they do best, which is to compete on a field, a court or a rink.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/sports/SUSPENSIONS-4/SUSPENSIONS-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/12/sports/SUSPENSIONS-4/SUSPENSIONS-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/sports/SUSPENSIONS-4/SUSPENSIONS-4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/sports/SUSPENSIONS-4/SUSPENSIONS-4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1079, 'width': 1732, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/sports/SUSPENSIONS-4/SUSPENSIONS-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/12/sports/SUSPENSIONS-4/SUSPENSIONS-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/12/sports/SUSPENSIONS-4/SUSPENSIONS-4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name'