ants to justice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/13/arts/music/thumbprint-a-chamber-opera-at-baruch-arts-center.html', 'snippet': 'The opera “Thumbprint” tells how a Pakistani rape victim defied convention by bringing her assailants to justice.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Thumbprint,” an earnest new chamber opera, has going for it an inspiring true story. The work, which had its premiere on Friday at the Baruch Performing Arts Center as part of the festival Prototype: Opera/Theater/Now, is about Mukhtar Mai, a Pakistani woman who was gang-raped in 2002 as payback for an “honor crime” allegedly committed by her brother. While custom called for rape victims to kill themselves to avoid dishonor, Ms. Mukhtar spoke out, bringing her assailants to justice. She went on to become a human-rights activist, opening schools and running an ambulance service and a women’s aid group in her village.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/thumbprint/thumbprint-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 284, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/thumbprint/thumbprint-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 284}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/thumbprint/thumbprint-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 485, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/thumbprint/thumbprint-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 969, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/thumbprint/thumbprint-thumbStandard.j