/b445f4e9-7a1c-51f7-8595-1e6ee40759fd'}, {'abstract': 'Working with the start-up is the latest part of NBC’s investment in keeping pace with the new ways that people consume news.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/13/business/media/nbcs-news-unit-teams-with-video-clip-start-up.html', 'snippet': 'Working with the start-up is the latest part of NBC’s investment in keeping pace with the new ways that people consume news.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Broadcasting executives realize that viewers increasingly get their news by glancing on their smartphones instead of spending a half-hour in front of the television.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NBC’s News Unit Teams With Video Start-Up NowThis News', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'NBC’s News Unit Teams With Video Clip Start-Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBCUniversal', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaufman, Leslie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NowThis News', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-13T02:01:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leslie Kaufman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leslie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaufman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/175e72e9-aa44-558a-805a-752db9daade3', 'word_count': 800, 'uri': 'nyt://article/175e72e9-aa44-558a-805a-752db9daade3'}, {'abstract': 'After competing for 25 years in Europe, changing clubs 15 times and living in five countries, Darryl Middleton has advice, a lot of it, to pass along to American players considering a tour abroad.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/13/sports/basketball/the-basketball-players-guide-to-the-european-galaxy.html', 'snippet': 'After competing for 25 years in Europe, changing clubs 15 times and living in five countries, Darryl Middleton has advice, a lot of it, to pass along to American players considering a tour abroad.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALICANTE, Spain — You are a star high school basketball player, a whirlwind on the court. You score points, get rebounds and cover the ball on the defensive end. You get a scholarship and enjoy college. The N.B.A. draft is approaching and you can’t wait to cash in.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/alicante/alicante-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/alicante/alicante-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/alicante/alicante-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/alicante/alicante-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/alicante/alicante-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/alicante/alicante-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/alicante/alicante-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Basketball Player’s Guide to the (European) Galaxy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Basketball Player’s Guide to the (European) Galaxy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Borden, Sam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Middleton, Darryl', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Americans Abroad', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-13T02:01:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac022ba1-0b4f-58fe-8696-d3dcf8ebac34', 'word_count': 1967, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac022ba1-0b4f-58fe-8696-d3dcf8ebac34'}, {'abstract': 'It may be time to resume nonlethal aid to moderate rebels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/13/opinion/treading-water-on-syria.html', 'snippet': 'It may be time to resume nonlethal aid to moderate rebels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nearly three years after the fighting began, many of the most dire predictions about Syria’s civil war have come true. The conflict has not only engulfed the country, killing more than 130,000 people and forcing more than nine million civilians out of their homes. Increasingly, it has metastasized across the region, destabilizing neighboring countries and serving as a magnet for militants, or would-be militants, including some from the United States.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Treading Water on Syria', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Treading Water on Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State of Iraq and Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic Front (Syria)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Al Nusra Front', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-13T02:07:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/070f4493-05f8-50bd-871d-7ad65f54c5c4', 'word_count': 673, 'uri': 'nyt://article/070f4493-05f8-50bd-871d-7ad65f54c5c4'}, {'abstract': 'Peyton Manning avoided another playoff upset, leading Denver past San Diego and setting up a showdown against Tom Brady and New England for the A.F.C. title.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/13/sports/football/amid-gusts-the-broncos-exhale-as-they-hold-off-the-chargers.html', 'snippet': 'Peyton Manning avoided another playoff upset, leading Denver past San Diego and setting up a showdown against Tom Brady and New England for the A.F.C. title.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DENVER — For exactly a year, Peyton Manning had lived with the duplicitous burden of being the N.F.L.’s best quarterback and an underachieving one. On Sunday, the anniversary of a stinging home loss to the underdog Baltimore Ravens, Manning and Broncos fans awoke to a full-page photograph of the quarterback under a dark cloud against a towering Denver Post headline: A Legacy Under a Cloud.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/afc/afc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 542, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/afc/afc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 542}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/afc/afc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 925, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/afc/afc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1849, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/afc/afc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/afc/afc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/sports/