b_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/13/taylor-swift-or-sofia-vergara-quick-next-party/', 'snippet': 'The Golden Globes afterparties are an exercise in fear of missing out, whether it’s a lost opportunity to see a pop star or a television celebrity or two very cool Brits on the dance floor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — There’s a complicated calculus to attending Golden Globes after-parties. Like the show, they’re all in the Beverly Hilton complex, but in far-flung corners. So there’s a scramble as guests and celebrities migrate from one to the other, running through the lobby, where fans congregate with cameras. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/benedict/benedict-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/benedict/benedict-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/benedict/benedict-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/benedict/benedict-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1419, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/benedict/benedict-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/13/arts/benedict/benedict-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image