ffic jam\xa0in Fort Lee, N.J., convulsed the national news shows over the weekend. More subpoenas are expected, probably for staff members Mr. Christie fired last week. Added to the pyre, federal investigators are now looking into whether the governor misused almost $5 million in Hurricane Sandy relief funds for his “Stronger than the Storm” ads featuring himself and his family in the months before his re-election.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Has Christie Lost His Credibility?', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'George Washington Bridge', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fort Lee (NJ)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-13T20:59:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eleanor Randolph', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eleanor', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Randolph', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8a7056f-b620-57fd-8cfa-454901a12fe3', 'word_count': 480, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8a7056f-b620-57fd-8cfa-454901a12fe3'}, {'abstract': 'A report describes the complicated diet of a big-league doper who juggled four injections with two muscle treatments, two skin creams, two lozenges and six oral doses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/sports/baseball/alex-rodriguez-continues-fight-seeking-to-vacate-arbitrators-ruling.html', 'snippet': 'A report describes the complicated diet of a big-league doper who juggled four injections with two muscle treatments, two skin creams, two lozenges and six oral doses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alex Rodriguez took an energy cocktail on Mondays and a therapy