in.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/arts/dance/danah-katzs-troupe-presents-thousand-plateaus.html', 'snippet': 'The new work by the choreographer Danah Katz, “Thousand Plateaus,” felt unfinished, like a conceptual shell waiting to be filled in.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The choreographer Danah Katz waited until the end of her new work, “Thousand Plateaus,” to make a significant disclaimer. “This is an experiment for all of us,” she said on Sunday at the 92nd Street Y, surrounded by the four other members of her company, Danaka Dance; the piece, she added, is still in its “pilot period.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/arts/danaka/danaka-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/14/arts/danaka/danaka-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 353}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/arts/danaka/danaka-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 602, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/arts/danaka/danaka-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1204, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/arts/danaka/danaka-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/14/arts/danaka/danaka-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/arts/danaka/danaka-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Like Solos, but Joined in a Slinky Procession', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Like Solos, but Joined in a Slinky Procession', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': '92nd Street Y', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Katz, Danah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Danaka Dance', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-13T22:54:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Siobhan Burke', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Siobhan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burke', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8eaba5b2-2835-5111-a69c-07da13fd7562', 'word_count': 398, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8eaba5b2-2835-5111-a69c-07da13fd7562'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s revival of a plan for a Metro-North spur serving Co-op City, in the northeast Bronx, would put Midtown just a half-hour away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/nyregion/train-service-could-wake-up-sleepy-co-op-city.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s revival of a plan for a Metro-North spur serving Co-op City, in the northeast Bronx, would put Midtown just a half-hour away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is quiet in Co-op City, the nation’s largest housing cooperative, even though some 50,000 people live there. So quiet that the sound of footsteps crunching on icy sidewalks was louder than the wail of distant police sirens on Friday afternoon. So calm that fewer than a dozen people boarded the express bus, the fastest link to Midtown Man