ouettes. The kilt figured prominently in Sarah Burton’s latest collection for Alexander McQueen — no surprise, given her predecessor’s heritage and fondness for Scottish history and costume. Recent London College of Fashion graduate Sebastiaan Groenen debuted his line Sebastiaan Pieter in a small, provocative presentation that, in his words, explored “lengths unfamiliar in Western men’s wear,” such as a black crewneck sweater attached to a knit skirt with a mildly salacious slash at the midriff, revealing skin and a trouser waistband beneath. And Christopher Shannon showed a pair of heavy-gauge bi-layer sweaters that extended almost to the floor; their side slits bared taut, worked-out legs that looked anything but femme.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/t-magazine/13trend-pask/13trend-pask-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/13/t-magazine/13trend-pask/13trend-pask-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/t-magazine/13trend-pask/13trend-pask-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/t-magazine/13trend-pask/13trend-pask-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/13/t-magazine/13trend-pask/13trend-pask-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/13/t-magazine/13trend-