ns', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-14T03:20:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Schonbrun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schonbrun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3712020-587c-5c9c-ac04-44320958a728', 'word_count': 1143, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3712020-587c-5c9c-ac04-44320958a728'}, {'abstract': 'The company said it would bring new models to the United States and invest $7 billion in North American production.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/business/international/poor-us-sales-are-a-drag-on-volkswagens-ambitions.html', 'snippet': 'The company said it would bring new models to the United States and invest $7 billion in North American production.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — Volkswagen has outlined ambitious plans to become the world’s top-selling automaker within the next four years, but its lackluster sales in the United States have been a significant drag on meeting that goal.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/business/VW/VW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/14/business/VW/VW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/business/VW/VW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/business/VW/VW-super