en babies and selling them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/world/asia/china-doctor-is-sentenced-in-a-case-of-baby-trafficking.html', 'snippet': 'Zhang Shuxia, an obstetrician in Shaanxi Province, received the death sentence but with two years’ reprieve for stealing seven babies and selling them.', 'lead_paragraph': ' A court on Tuesday sentenced\xa0Zhang Shuxia, an obstetrician in Shaanxi Province, to death but with two years’ reprieve for stealing seven babies and selling them. Death sentences with two years’ reprieve are almost always changed later to life sentences. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China: Doctor Is Sentenced in a Case of Baby Trafficking', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Asia', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'China: Doctor Is Sentenced in a Case of Baby Trafficking', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bradsher, Keith', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zhang Shuxia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Trafficking', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-14T03:25:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Keith Bradsher', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Keith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bradsher', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/e30939c3-9ae0-573