_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/nyregion/with-fate-of-safe-deposit-boxes-unknown-bank-customers-fret-after-blaze.html', 'snippet': 'A Citibank branch in Upper Manhattan burned for more than a day, leaving the fate of the bank’s 300 safe deposit boxes unknown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For many people, a bank is a place to safeguard family heirlooms and vital documents from the unpredictable turns of life: theft, fire, flood. But over the weekend, a Citibank branch in Upper Manhattan burned for more than a day, leaving the building a burned-out husk and the fate of the bank’s 300 safe deposit boxes unknown. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/nyregion/CITIFIRE1/CITIFIRE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/14/nyregion/CITIFIRE1/CITIFIRE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/nyregion/CITIFIRE1/CITIFIRE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/nyregion/CITIFIRE1/CITIFIRE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1301, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/nyregion/CITIFIRE1/CITIFIRE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/14/nyregion/CITIFIRE1/CITIFIRE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption':