rich state of Upper Nile.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NAIROBI, Kenya — It happened during a panic that has unfolded with frightening regularity in recent weeks. Fighters were advancing. Crowds of civilians fled to the river to escape the violence, rushing into barges to cross the White Nile. Amid the frenzy, officials said Tuesday, more than 200 people were killed when the ferry carrying them to safety went down.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scores Die in Ferry Accident as They Flee Violence in South Sudan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Scores Die in Ferry Accident as They Flee Violence in South Sudan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kulish, Nicholas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Sudan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kiir Mayardit, Salva', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Machar, Riek', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maritime Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-14T11:57:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kulish', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kulish', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0870f990-9d63-5b35-ab28-e4e905049e9b', 'word_count': 925, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0870f990-9d63-5b35-ab28-e4e905049e9b'}, {'abstract': 'This is uncharted territory for me — my son’s departure for the West Coast to study physics — and it’s as if a chunk of my heart is gone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/booming/when-my-son-flew-out-of-the-nest.html', 'snippet': 'This is uncharted territory for me — my son’s departure for the West Coast to study physics — and it’s as if a chunk of my heart is gone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Physicists discover particles the way shop owners catch embezzlers: not by seeing them, but by noticing something is missing (in high-energy physics, particles are inventory, energy cash). They smash large particles, then tally up the energy and smaller particles produced. If the reckoning is incomplete, another tiny particle must have been there.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/booming/14mystory-booming-physicist/14mystory-booming-physicist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/14/booming/14mystory-booming-physicist/14mystory-booming-physicist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/booming/14mystory-booming-physicist/14mystory-booming-physicist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 639, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/booming/14mystory-booming-physicist/14mystory-booming-physicist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1123, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/booming/14mystory-booming-physicist/14mystory-booming-physicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/14/booming/14mystory-booming-physicist/14mystory-booming-physici