aph': 'If Anna Nicole Smith and Jerry Springer can be opera subjects, why not Milli Vanilli?\xa0 Surely you remember Milli Vanilli, the pop vocal duo — Fab Morvan and Rob Pilatus — who left the record business in disgrace in 1990, after it was revealed that their live performances were lip-synced to recordings, which turned out to have been made not by Mr. Morvan and Mr. Pilatus, but by studio singers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Girl You Know It’s True! An Opera Inspired by Milli Vanilli Is Set for Brooklyn Run', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BRIC Arts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Milli Vanilli', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-14T17:11:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e6b1f97-2c1a-5a3b-87f2-116dc96a3ca7', 'word_count': 460, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e6b1f97-2c1a-5a3b-87f2-116dc96a3ca7'}, {'abstract': 'The boy suspected in the shooting at a middle school in Roswell was apprehended by a State Police lieutenant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/us/2-injured-in-shooting-at-new-mexico-school.html', 'snippet': 'The boy suspected in the shooting at a middle school in Roswell was apprehended by a State Police lieutenant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A 12-year-old boy opened fire with a shotgun on Tuesday at the middle school he attends in Roswell, N.M., striking two among the dozens of students who were gathered inside a gym waiting for the first bell to ring, the 