y federal officials.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/federal-officials-return-looted-antiquities-to-india/', 'snippet': 'Three looted, ancient sculptures, valued at $1.5 million, were returned to India on Tuesday by federal officials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Relations between India and the United States thawed a bit Tuesday as federal officials returned three stolen antiquities worth about $1.5 million to the Indian Consulate in New York, among them a 350-pound sandstone sculpture snatched from an Indian temple in 2009 that had been among Interpol’s Top 10 stolen works of art.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Federal Officials Return Looted Antiquities to India', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stolen Antiquities Returned to India', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Arts and Antiquities Looting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Indian-Americans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smuggling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kapoor, Subhash (1949- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khobragade, Devyani', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Homeland Security Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madison Avenue (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-14T19:42:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Mashberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mashberg', 'qualifier'