s of visa fraud, as it was a protest against Am...', 'lead_paragraph': 'MUMBAI – For the crowd of about 60 people waiting at the airport here on Tuesday for Devyani Khobragade, the Indian diplomat who was indicted in the United States on charges of visa fraud, the gathering was as much a show of support for Ms. Khobragade as it was a protest against the Americans who, in their view, had humiliated her and her country.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Feverish Welcome for Indian Diplomat in Hometown of Mumbai', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khobragade, Devyani', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mumbai (India)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-14T20:55:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neha Thirani Bagri', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neha', 'middlename': 'Thirani', 'lastname': 'Bagri', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/65f6a4e7-a5e2-5435-b63d-585260e41649', 'word_count': 735, 'uri': 'nyt://article/65f6a4e7-a5e2-5435-b63d-585260e41649'}, {'abstract': 'Photos from Egypt, South Sudan, Central African Republic and Pakistan.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/pictures-of-the-day-egypt-and-elsewhere-69/', 'snippet': 'Photos from Egypt, South Sudan, Central African Republic and Pakistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photos from Egypt, South Sudan, Central African Republic and Pakistan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit'