/fb225d8a-004f-53cb-8722-54806b49898e', 'word_count': 860, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb225d8a-004f-53cb-8722-54806b49898e'}, {'abstract': '“Feast,” written and directed by Andrew Ondrejcak, re-enacts the final banquet of Babylon at the Public Theater as part of the Under the Radar festival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/theater/feast-revisits-babylon-with-interactive-whoopee-cushions.html', 'snippet': '“Feast,” written and directed by Andrew Ondrejcak, re-enacts the final banquet of Babylon at the Public Theater as part of the Under the Radar festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m not sure if this is a spoiler, or simply stating the obvious, but there is no feast in “Feast.” The burnished table remains bare, the performers’ insatiable mouths empty, and wretchedly so. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/arts/15FEAST/15FEAST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 312, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/15/arts/15FEAST/15FEAST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 312}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/arts/15FEAST/15FEAST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 532, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/arts/15FEAST/15FEAST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1064, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/arts/15FEAST/15FEAST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/15/arts/15FEAST/15