ing is run in part by Kay Gardiner, who counts Rosanne Cash among her knitting-and-sewing pals.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/14/when-rosanne-cash-is-among-your-close-knit-friends/', 'snippet': 'The blog Mason-Dixon Knitting is run in part by Kay Gardiner, who counts Rosanne Cash among her knitting-and-sewing pals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The blog Mason-Dixon Knitting exists as a series of letters between two friends, Kay Gardiner and Ann Shayne, who share stories about everything from sewing to denim yarn to their husbands and travels. Gardiner — who lives in Manhattan; Shayne is in Nashville — happens to belong to a sewing circle that includes Rosanne Cash, whose new album, “The River and the Thread,” was the occasion for an article about her in last weekend’s magazine.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/magazine/14-knit-sweater/14-knit-sweater-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 892, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/14/magazine/14-knit-sweater/14-knit-sweater-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 892}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/magazine/14-knit-sweater/14-knit-sweater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 689, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/magazine/14-knit-sweater/14-knit-sweater-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 689, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/14/magazine/14-knit-sweater/14-knit-sweater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 