 brunt of natural disasters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/opinion/how-the-poor-get-washed-away.html', 'snippet': 'Poor people who don’t own land routinely bear the brunt of natural disasters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN Typhoon Haiyan struck the Philippines in November, killing more than 6,000 people and leaving more than four million homeless, one group was particularly hard hit: the landless poor. More than a thousand of the dead lived in a single squatter camp.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How the Poor Get Washed Away', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributors', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How the Poor Get Washed Away', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Land Use Policies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Squatters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Third World and Developing Countries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evacuations and Evacuees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typhoon Haiyan (2013)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typhoon Bopha (2012)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typhoons', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Earthquakes', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ACEH PROVINCE (INDONESIA)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Odisha (India)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Haiti', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tacloban (Philippines)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philippines', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-15T00:32:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Hanstad and Roy Prosterman', 'person': [{'firstna