ssues it raised are not resolved, and the damage to India-America relations is unlikely to dissipate soon. This unfortunate episode is a reminder that while both nations are democracies, neither can avoid the hard work necessary to make the relationship work.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'India-America Relations on Edge', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'India-America Relations on Edge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khobragade, Devyani', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Richard, Sangeeta', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Domestic Service', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-15T02:22:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/624c9921-9a1f-55d6-882c-198aba7480e2', 'word_count': 462, 'uri': 'nyt://article/624c9921-9a1f-55d6-882c-198aba7480e2'}, {'abstract': 'Ben McAdoo, who was considered an innovative quarterbacks coach for Green Bay, promises to take an “up-tempo, attacking” approach as the Giants new offensive coordinator.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/sports/football/nfl-roundup.html', 'snippet': 'Ben McAdoo, who was considered an innovative quarterbacks coach for Green Bay, promises to take an “up-tempo, attacking” approach as the Giants new offensive coordinator.', 'lead_paragraph': 