': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cb1cd990-9751-5a85-b555-d24f6b404b48', 'word_count': 823, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb1cd990-9751-5a85-b555-d24f6b404b48'}, {'abstract': 'The owners of the building housing Rizzoli Bookstore say they plan to demolish the six-story, 109-year-old building, as well as two small, adjoining buildings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/nyregion/manhattan-bookstore-may-flee-wrecking-ball-again.html', 'snippet': 'The owners of the building housing Rizzoli Bookstore say they plan to demolish the six-story, 109-year-old building, as well as two small, adjoining buildings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Twenty-nine years ago, Rizzoli Bookstore, whose Old World charm, hand-wrought chandeliers and big storefront windows make it a favorite of noted authors, book lovers and tourists, fled Fifth Avenue two steps ahead of the wrecking ball.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/nyregion/altRIZZOLI/altRIZZOLI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/15/nyregion/altRIZZOLI/altRIZZOLI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/nyregion/altRIZZOLI/altRIZZOLI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/nyregion/altRIZZOLI/altRIZZOLI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 's