: '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/070e0d17-94b9-56a2-91f8-5457c569ff9f', 'word_count': 727, 'uri': 'nyt://article/070e0d17-94b9-56a2-91f8-5457c569ff9f'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Chrystie created the cash management account, a one-stop-shopping convenience for the brokerage business.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/business/thomas-l-chrystie-bank-services-innovator-dies-at-80.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Chrystie created the cash management account, a one-stop-shopping convenience for the brokerage business.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Thomas L. Chrystie became a top executive in the early 1970s at Merrill Lynch & Company, it was a rocky time for Wall Street brokerage firms. A recession, a bear market, high inflation and “stagflation,” the fusion of rising prices and rising unemployment, had stock investors fleeing and taking with them the commissions and fees that brokerage houses lived on. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/business/CHRYSTIE-obit-web/CHRYSTIE-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 793, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/15/business/CHRYSTIE-obit-web/CHRYSTIE-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 793}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/business/CHRYSTIE-obit-web/CHRYSTIE-obit-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 775, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/business/CHRYSTIE-obit-web/CHRYSTIE-obit-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1549, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp