onment of her husband, Liu Xiaobo, after his conviction on charges of inciting subversion of state power.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/in-rare-video-wife-of-jailed-nobel-laureate-reads-poems-while-under-house-arrest/', 'snippet': 'The poet Liu Xia has been held in extralegal detention in her apartment since the imprisonment of her husband, Liu Xiaobo, after his conviction on charges of inciting subversion of state power.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Liu Xia, the wife of the imprisoned Nobel Peace laureate Liu Xiaobo, was shown reading two of her poems in a short video aired at an event on Tuesday in New York. The two-minute video was filmed in December and obtained by the Friends of Liu Xiaobo and the Independent Chinese PEN Center, a free-speech advocacy group that Ms. Liu helped establish.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Rare Video, Wife of Jailed Nobel Laureate Reads Poems While Under House Arrest', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu Hui', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu Xia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu Xiaobo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Independent Chinese PEN Center', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-15T05:13:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0f1279e-c1cc-5cf5-be32-f8a283a65e82', 'word_count': 478, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0f1279e-c1cc-5cf5-be32-f8a283a65e82'}, {'abstract': 'Lawyers for the husband of Marlise Muñoz, a pregnant woman said to have been brain-dead since November, have sued the Texas hospital that is keeping her on life support.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/us/suing-to-end-life-support-for-woman-and-fetus.html', 'snippet': 'Lawyers for the husband of Marlise Muñoz, a pregnant woman said to have been brain-dead since November, have sued the Texas hospital that is keeping her on life support.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — Lawyers for the husband of a pregnant woman being kept on life support at a Fort Worth hospital against her family’s wishes sued hospital officials on Tuesday, asking a judge to order the doctors to remove her from the machines and declare the Texas law at the center of her case unconstitutional.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Suing to End Life Support for Woman and Fetus', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Suing to End Life Support For Woman And Fetus', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Life-Sustaining Support Systems, Withdrawal Of', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fernandez, Manny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fort Worth (Tex)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'John Peter Smith Hospital (Fort Worth, Tex)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Munoz, Marlise', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Munoz, Erick', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-15T05:14:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 