ord_count': 189, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b8aebf1-1f9f-5764-9146-531f74bcd3d0'}, {'abstract': 'The work of art, welcoming arriving international passengers at Terminal 4 since 2001, is scheduled to be removed by this spring and could be destroyed if a new home is not found.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/nyregion/huge-art-installation-at-jfk-airport-faces-possible-destruction.html', 'snippet': 'The work of art, welcoming arriving international passengers at Terminal 4 since 2001, is scheduled to be removed by this spring and could be destroyed if a new home is not found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every year, more than seven million international air passengers are greeted gladly on their arrival in the United States — not by forbidding blank corridors or a blizzard of oversize advertising, but by billowing, cloudlike, buttercream-colored curtains stretching hundreds of feet along a periwinkle sky.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/16BLOCKS/16BLOCKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/16BLOCKS/16BLOCKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/16BLOCKS/16BLOCKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/16BLOCKS/16BLOCKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/16BLOCKS/16BLO