1fd4685c50c'}, {'abstract': 'It is notable that the board of General Motors is reinstating the dividend before sorting out new pay levels for its top executives, Antony Currie writes for Reuters Breakingviews.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/g-m-s-dividend-hits-the-right-spot/', 'snippet': 'It is notable that the board of General Motors is reinstating the dividend before sorting out new pay levels for its top executives, Antony Currie writes for Reuters Breakingviews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'General Motors is hitting the right spot on several levels with its return to paying a common stock dividend.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-gm-barra/dbpix-gm-barra-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-gm-barra/dbpix-gm-barra-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-gm-barra/dbpix-gm-barra-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-gm-barra/dbpix-gm-barra-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-gm-barra/dbpix-gm-barra-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-gm-barra/dbpix-gm-barra-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': '