re-from-house-after-23-years/', 'snippet': 'Representative James P. Moran, Democrat of Virginia, announced on Wednesday that he would not seek re-election in November, making him the latest in a string of recent retirements in the House.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Representative James P. Moran of Virginia announced on Wednesday that he would not seek re-election in November in the deeply Democratic district in Northern Virginia that he has represented for 23 years. His is the latest in a string of recent retirements in the House. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Virginia’s Moran to Retire From House After 23 Years', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moran, Jim', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-15T17:46:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jada F. Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jada', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0cf4945e-b7aa-59a8-b1f0-08191d0bea71', 'word_count': 226, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0cf4945e-b7aa-59a8-b1f0-08191d0bea71'}, {'abstract': 'Robert Redford’s lifetime achievement award was “a little early,” Abigail Breslin came prepared, and Leonardo DiCaprio was “uncomfortable” in a suit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/movies/awardsseason/stars-reminisce-about-academy-awards.html', 'snippet': 'Robert Redford’s lifetime achievement award was “a little early,” Abigail Breslin came prepared, and Leonardo DiCaprio was “uncomfortable” in a suit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Early Thursday morning, the Oscar nominations will be announced, clarifying a race with a surfeit of contenders. The stars and filmmakers behind hopefuls like “12 Years a Slave,” “American Hustle” and “Gravity” will know whether they are indeed front-runners or sudden underdogs; others will abruptly find themselves in the position of also-rans and step off the red-carpet circuit.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Memories of the Way They Were With Oscar', 'kicker': 'The Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Memories of the Way They Were With Oscar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-15T17:47:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'subsection_name': 'Awards Season', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9dd9a301-8ffe-5113-9d89-a113bbbca30d', 'word_count': 1071, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9dd9a301-8ffe-5113-9d89-a113bbbca30d'}, {'abstract': 'In a blog post on the Federal Communication Commission’s website, Tom Wheeler sought to calm the nerves of both backers of Internet regulation and the people fighting against it.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/f-c-c-chairman-adds-more-ambiguity-to-his-position-on-network-neutrality/', 'snippet': 'In a blog post on the Federal Communication Commission’s website, Tom Wheeler sought to calm the nerves of both backers of Internet regulation and the people fighting against it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tom Wheeler, the chairman of the Federal 