e animals at virtually every school and library visit. In some cases, the artists probably come up with something on the spot and then sketch the rabbit or dromedary in question. But the urge to answer more thoughtfully must weigh on them with a little bit of l’esprit de l’escalier.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/books/15childrens-1/15childrens-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/15/books/15childrens-1/15childrens-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/books/15childrens-1/15childrens-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/books/15childrens-1/15childrens-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1280, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/books/15childrens-1/15childrens-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/15/books/15childrens-1/15childrens-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/15/books/15childrens-1/15childrens-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Masterly Menagerie', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, '