iting must make it available to individuals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/your-money/consumers-can-check-on-data-beyond-their-credit-reports.html', 'snippet': 'Specialty consumer reporting agencies that gather information for purposes like insurance underwriting must make it available to individuals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You most likely know the drill when it comes to the importance of checking the accuracy of your credit report, which lenders review before deciding to make a loan or issue a credit card. Federal law allows you to get a free copy of it once a year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Consumers Can Check on Data Beyond Their Credit Reports', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Equifax Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Financial Protection Bureau', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MIB Group Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-15T19:35:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d8804e0-9b9c-57a0-ada7-d9682b4ef0bc', 'word_count': 1136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d8804e0-9b9c-57a0-ada7-d9682b4ef0bc'}, {'abstract': 'A property in the Val d’Aran, consisting of three traditional Pyrenean farm buildings, is on the market for $4.1 million.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/01/16/greathomesanddestinations/20140116-GH-IHH.html', 'snippet': 'A property in the Val d’Aran, consisting of three traditional Pyrenean farm buildings, is on the market for $4.1 million.', 'lead_p