a1cb0e65'}, {'abstract': 'A Florida couple describes an eerily similar encounter in December at the same movie theater where a retired police officer was arrested on Monday for shooting and killing a man during an argument over texting.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/another-florida-couples-possible-encounter-with-movie-theater-gunman/', 'snippet': 'A Florida couple describes an eerily similar encounter in December at the same movie theater where a retired police officer was arrested on Monday for shooting and killing a man during an argument over texting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Florida couple said they believe they encountered a 71-year-old retired police captain in December at the same movie theater where police said he shot and killed a man and injured the man’s wife during an argument that began over texting.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/us/thelede-reeves/THE-LEDE-REEVES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/16/us/thelede-reeves/THE-LEDE-REEVES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 658}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/us/thelede-reeves/THE-LEDE-REEVES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 934, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/us/thelede-reeves/THE-LEDE-REEVES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1053, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/us/thelede-reeves/thelede-reeves-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cr