 were publicly known.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/15/doctor-at-insider-trading-trial-testifies-it-was-like-he-was-in-the-room/', 'snippet': 'On the witness stand for a second day on Wednesday, Dr. Joel S. Ross told the jury that a former SAC Capital Advisors hedge fund manager, Mathew Martoma, knew the specific results of a clinical drug trial before they were publicly known.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prosecutors may not have any recorded conversations showing how a former SAC Capital Advisors trader, Mathew Martoma, engineered what they have called the biggest insider trading scheme in history. But testimony from one doctor indicates that Mr. Martoma knew the specific results of a clinical drug trial before they were known publicly.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-insider/dbpix-insider-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-insider/dbpix-insider-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-insider/dbpix-insider-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-insider/dbpix-insider-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/business/dbpix-insider/dbpix-insider-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'lega