 displayed an assortment of personal quirks and others managed to party without incident.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/fashion/Golden-Globes-party-stars.html', 'snippet': 'At the Golden Globes after-party at the Beverly Hilton hotel in Beverly Hills, Calif., stars displayed an assortment of personal quirks and others managed to party without incident.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Beverly Hills, Calif. — Security was viselike along the red carpet to the Beverly Hilton hotel last Sunday night, the setting of the Warner Brothers and InStyle Golden Globes after-party, which sped on at full throttle inside. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Stars’ Quirks Come Out', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Stars’ Quirks Come Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adams, Amy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Washington, Kerry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Phoenix, Joaquin', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilde, Olivia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Poehler, Amy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerr, Miranda', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beverly Hills (Calif)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-15T21:21:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ruth La Ferla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ruth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'La Ferla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organiza