-520d-bdfe-ebf20a0d0aa6'}, {'abstract': 'A respected columnist was dismissed from the magazine after he wrote that the right to bear arms needs to be subjected to legitimate regulation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/opinion/dissent-guns-ammo.html', 'snippet': 'A respected columnist was dismissed from the magazine after he wrote that the right to bear arms needs to be subjected to legitimate regulation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was a rare peek behind the Oz-like curtain of gun journalism in its role as the gun industry’s mouthpiece: A respected columnist was dismissed from Guns & Ammo magazine in October after he dared to write the obvious — that all constitutional rights, including the right to bear arms, are and “need to be” subject to legitimate regulation. This was heresy for Second Amendment absolutists. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dissent, Guns & Ammo', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dissent, Guns & Ammo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Metcalf, Dick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Guns & Ammo (Magazine)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Second Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-16T02:19:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e808c294-800c-5c52-b723-4b723a3b9687', 'word_count': 279, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e808c294-800c-5c52-b723-4b723a3b9687'}, {'abstract': 'Republicans do not believe that job-seekers who have been out of work for six months or longer deserve government assistance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/opinion/false-reasons-for-filibustering-jobless-aid.html', 'snippet': 'Republicans do not believe that job-seekers who have been out of work for six months or longer deserve government assistance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Republican senators are pulling out every fake excuse they can think of for filibustering an extension of jobless benefits for the long-term unemployed on Tuesday. The majority leader, Harry Reid, was mean to us and wouldn’t let us offer amendments, they say. Democrats refused to pay for the benefits. It’s President Obama’s fault people can’t find work because he won’t approve the Keystone XL oil pipeline.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'False Reasons for Filibustering Jobless Aid', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'False Reasons for Filibustering Jobless Aid', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment Insurance', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-16T02:21:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/827d9acc-e9a4-539b-9fce-164d0cdacebd', 'word_count': 344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/827d9acc-e9a4-539b-9fce-164d0cdacebd'}, {'abstract': 'Workers at the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey’s three airports, who used to work directly for the airlines, toil for little pay, and have no unions, vacation days or pensions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/nyregion/hauling-bags-and-cleaning-planes-for-little-pay-and-no-vacations-of-their-own.html', 'snippet': 'Workers at the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey’s three airports, who used to work directly for the airlines, toil for little pay, and have no unions, vacation days or pensions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Norman Echeverri’s life once glowed with promise. He held a job at a company in Medellín, Colombia, had a car, laughed, played cards with friends.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/gotham/gotham-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/gotham/gotham-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/gotham/gotham-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/gotham/gotham-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/gotham/gotham-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/16/nyregion/gotham/gotham-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit':