t://article/ed3aa376-1e0c-5d0d-9272-d17218d8aea5'}, {'abstract': 'The size of Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s war chest exceeds what he spent on his entire 2010 campaign, and it highlights the challenge that a Republican opponent would face.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/nyregion/cuomo-has-raised-over-33-million-for-re-election-bid.html', 'snippet': 'The size of Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s war chest exceeds what he spent on his entire 2010 campaign, and it highlights the challenge that a Republican opponent would face.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As he prepares to seek re-election in November, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo has already amassed more than $33 million to finance his bid for a second term, his campaign team said on Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuomo Has Raised Over $33 Million for Re-election Bid', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cuomo Has Raised Over $33 Million for Re-election Bid', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaplan, Thomas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Governors', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-16T03:22:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7985ba90-4288-5004-a532-d02c7cdc367c', 'word_count': 433, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7985ba90-4288-5004-a532-d02c7cdc367c'}, {'abstract': 'A revised Constitution validating the military takeover in Egypt appeared headed for approval, according to early tabulations, as international monitors questioned the fairness of the vote.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/world/middleeast/early-tallies-show-revised-charter-passing-in-egypt.html', 'snippet': 'A revised Constitution validating the military takeover in Egypt appeared headed for approval, according to early tabulations, as international monitors questioned the fairness of the vote.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — A revised Constitution validating the military takeover in Egypt this past summer appeared headed for lopsided approval by more than 90 percent of the votes cast, according to early tabulations in the official and private news media on Thursday, as international monitors raised alarms about the fairness of the plebiscite.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/world/egypt/egypt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/16/world/egypt/egypt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/world/egypt/egypt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/world/egypt/egypt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/world/egypt/egypt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'leg