ng performances, and Asian films that rely more on plot than cast.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/divisions-in-the-foreign-language-category/', 'snippet': 'The Academy split the category between European films with strong performances, and Asian films that rely more on plot than cast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The nominations in the best foreign language film category contain no big surprises, but have produced a divided field. Three of the nominations are from Europe, and are powered by strong individual performances from their leading actors. The remaining two are the Cambodian and Palestinian submissions and depend more on the strength of the story they tell than their cast.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Divisions in the Foreign-Language Category', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belgium', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cambodia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Denmark', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-16T15:30:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Rohter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb6edbec-c094-5b77-a58b-4d502cbe1e43', 'word_count': 517, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb6edbec-c094-5b77-a58b-4d502cbe1e43'}, {'abstract': 'In a new clinical trial, babies who got took a probiotic showed a decrease in crying time and an increase in frequency of bowel movements after one month.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/probiotics-may-ease-stomach-upset-in-babies/', 'snippet': 'In a new clinical trial, babies who got took a probiotic showed a decrease in crying time and an increase in frequency of bowel movements after one month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new clinical trial suggests that a daily dose of a probiotic may ease digestive upset in babies.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 233, 'width': 225, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 233, 'width': 225, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Probiotics May Ease Stomach Upset in Babies', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Probiotics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}