thritis.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Maybe we should rewrite that quote usually attributed to Benjamin Franklin. Nothing is certain except death, taxes — and arthritis, the leading cause of disability in the United States. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/blogs/16NOA/16NOA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 426, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/blogs/16NOA/16NOA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 426, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/blogs/16NOA/16NOA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/16/blogs/16NOA/16NOA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/blogs/16NOA/16NOA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Osteoarthritis Primer', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARTHRITIS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Joints (Body Part)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Osteoarthritis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-16T18:17:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paula Span', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paula', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Span', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2cab8639-16d6-57d8-820e-af85feab51e7', 'word_count': 916, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2cab8639-16d6-57d8-820e-af85feab51e7'}, {'abstract': 'The Riverside Symphony, founded in 1981, has been offering adventurous programming for decades.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/arts/music/deep-emotions-explored-in-song.html', 'snippet': 'The Riverside Symphony, founded in 1981, has been offering adventurous programming for decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many orchestras talk up the idea of adventurous programming. The Riverside Symphony, founded in 1981 by the conductor George Rothman and the composer Anthony Korf, has been putting the concept into practice for decades. This accomplished ensemble’s next program, on Saturday at Alice Tully Hall, is titled “Shadow and Light” and is typically intriguing. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deep Emotions Explored in Song', 'kicker': 'The Week Ahead | Classical', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deep Emotions Explored in Song', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-16T18:26:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anthony Tommasini', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anthony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tommasini', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea8291e2-530f-5213-b350-7faa9a6834bd', 'word_count': 163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea8291e2-530f-5213-b350-7faa9a6834bd'}, {'abstract': 'The actress received the news of her supporting actress nomination after flying from Los Angeles to London, and wasn’t sure if she dreamed it all up.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/16/sally-hawkinss-jet-lagged-euphoria/', 'snippet': 'The actress received the news of her supporting actress nomination after flying from Los Angeles to London, and wasn’t sure if she dreamed it all up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The little golden man is, at this point, rather immaterial. To hear Sally Hawkins tell it, she has already won.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/arts/hawkins/hawkins-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 832, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/16/arts/hawkins/hawkins-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 832}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/arts/hawkins/hawkins-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 739, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/arts/hawkins/hawkins-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1478, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/arts/hawkins/hawkins-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/16/arts/hawkins/hawkins-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/arts/hawkins/hawkins-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sally Hawkins’s Jet-Lagged Euphoria', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name