one, 'lastname': 'Eddy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1beaa43-c301-51f5-87d5-a616c8499dbb', 'word_count': 1027, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1beaa43-c301-51f5-87d5-a616c8499dbb'}, {'abstract': 'Ryan received a multiyear extension, but if the Jets fail to return to the postseason, the team will be able to escape without much financial penalty after 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/17/sports/football/rex-ryan-and-jets-agree-on-contract-extension.html', 'snippet': 'Ryan received a multiyear extension, but if the Jets fail to return to the postseason, the team will be able to escape without much financial penalty after 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perhaps the most interesting aspect of Rex Ryan’s new contract with the Jets is not the extension, which was expected after management assured his return nearly three weeks ago, but rather its implications. The deal he signed on Thursday protects Ryan through at least the 2016 season. By then, the Jets will have not only made the playoffs again but won a few games there, too.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/sports/football/17jets/17jets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 785, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/17/sports/football/17jets/17jets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 785}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/sports/football/17jets/17jets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 783, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/sports/football/