oug Aitken, he was hosting Station to Station, a “nomadic happening” aboard a passenger train traveling from New York to San Francisco, which saw a diverse group of artists, musicians, writers and thinkers stage events in cities across the country. At this year’s Sundance Film Festival, he’s presenting the North American premiere of another group project that explores the nature of creativity, the Source. Several years in the making (an early version appeared in 2012 at the Tate Liverpool), it’s a series of candid four-minute video conversations with several dozen noteworthy figures about their creative process.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/t-magazine/16aitken-ashlock2/16aitken-ashlock2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/16/t-magazine/16aitken-ashlock2/16aitken-ashlock2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/t-magazine/16aitken-ashlock2/16aitken-ashlock2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/t-magazine/16aitken-ashlock2/16aitken-ashlock2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/16/t-magazine/16aitken-ashlock2/16aitken-ashlock2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/16/t-magazine/16aitken-ashlock2/16aitken-ashlock2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbn