hat the elderly want to be a part of society.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hanging Out at McDonald’s', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hanging Out at McDonald&#8217;s', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "McDonald's Corporation", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Queens (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Korean-Americans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T00:44:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/59d39f1f-66f0-5ff9-871e-7a29cdd11d65', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/59d39f1f-66f0-5ff9-871e-7a29cdd11d65'}, {'abstract': 'A reader responding to a column by David Brooks writes that leadership is not just about winning elections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/17/opinion/the-leadership-of-citizens.html', 'snippet': 'A reader responding to a column by David Brooks writes that leadership is not just about winning elections.', 'lead_paragraph': '\xa0To the Editor:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Leadership of Citizens', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Leadership of Citizens', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brooks, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T00:46:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/2fc2a84f-a59f-5cea-ab17-6a81c3449020', 'word_count': 220, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2fc2a84f-a59f-5cea-ab17-6a81c3449020'}, {'abstract': 'The police in New Delhi arrested a third man on Thursday in connection with the gang-rape of a Danish tourist and said they were still seeking five other men.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/17/world/asia/india-3rd-arrest-in-rape-of-danish-tourist.html', 'snippet': 'The police in New Delhi arrested a third man on Thursday in connection with the gang-rape of a Danish tourist and said they were still seeking five other men.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The police in New Delhi arrested a third man on Thursday in connection with the gang-rape of a 51-year-old Danish tourist, who was allegedly held at knife point for three hours by a group of men after she approached them to ask directions to her hotel in the city’s downtown. The police described the man, Bhagat Singh, 23, as a “vagabond” and said that they were still seeking five other men implicated in the attack. The woman refused to submit to a medical examination before she left India on Wednesday, but two of the suspects were carrying property they had stolen from her, the police said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'India: 3rd Arrest in Rape of Danish Tourist', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Asia', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'India: 3rd Arrest in Rape of Tourist', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T00:48:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ellen Barry', 'person': [{'firs