der consideration in the American premiere of “I Am the Wind,” by the Norwegian playwright Jon Fosse, at 59E59 Theaters. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/WIND/WIND-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/WIND/WIND-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/WIND/WIND-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 722, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/WIND/WIND-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1444, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/WIND/WIND-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/WIND/WIND-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/WIND/WIND-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Converse All You Want, but Don’t Expect Connection', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Talk if You Want; Don’t Expect Connection', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fosse, Jon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'I Am the Wind (Play)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Takacs, Paul', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tierney, Christopher', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Butelli, Louis', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T02:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Brantley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brantley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8eca0f17-599f-5301-980e-466d54cf0e36', 'word_count': 657, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8eca0f17-599f-5301-980e-466d54cf0e36'}, {'abstract': 'Philadelphia, which had four picks in the first two rounds, swapped places with D.C. United to acquire the No. 1 selection over all in the M.L.S. draft and chose Andre Blake, Connecticut’s goalkeeper.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/17/sports/soccer/goalkeeper-is-top-pick-in-mls-draft.html', 'snippet': 'Philadelphia, which had four picks in the first two rounds, swapped places with D.C. United to acquire the No. 1 selection over all in the M.L.S. draft and chose Andre Blake, Connecticut’s goalkeeper.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Philadelphia, which had four picks in the first two rounds, swapped places with D.C. United to acquire the No. 1 selection over all in the M.L.S. draft and chose Andre Blake, Connecticut’s goalkeeper. Blake is the first goalkeeper to be picked No. 1 in an M.L.S. draft. Chris Duvall, a defender from Wake Forest, was the top pick of the Red Bulls and the No. 22 pick over all. “We like how he gets up and down the flank,” Coach Mike Petke said. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Goalkeeper Is Top Pick in M.L.S. Draft', 'kicker': None, 'conten