ter seeing the struggles of people who would have been helped by the drug.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Senate’s majority leader, Harry Reid, said Thursday that lawmakers should ease their opposition to medical marijuana, telling The Las Vegas Sun, “I think we need to take a real close look at this.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reid Indicates His Support for Medical Marijuana', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Reid Indicates His Support for Medical Marijuana', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kenny, Steve', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medical Marijuana', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reid, Harry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T05:10:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Kenny', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kenny', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d417422b-cadc-543c-a19d-fad9d570eb67', 'word_count': 258, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d417422b-cadc-543c-a19d-fad9d570eb67'}, {'abstract': 'Long known to cause lung cancer and heart disease, smoking also causes diabetes, colorectal and liver cancers and erectile dysfunction, a new report from the United States surgeon general says.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/17/health/list-of-smoking-related-illnesses-grows-significantly-in-us-report.html', 'snippet': 'Long known to cause lung cancer and heart disease, smoking also causes diabetes, colorectal and liver cancers and erectile dysfunction, a new report from the United States surgeon general says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In a broad review of scientific literature, the nation’s top doctor has concluded that cigarette smoking — long known to cause lung cancer and heart disease — also causes diabetes, colorectal and liver cancers, erectile dysfunction and ectopic pregnancy. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/us/SMOKING/SMOKING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/17/us/SMOKING/SMOKING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/us/SMOKING/SMOKING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/us/SMOKING/SMOKING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1054, 'width': 1582, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/us/SMOKING/SMOKING-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/17/us/SMOKING/SMOKING-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/us/SMOKING/SMOKING-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'List of Smoking-Related Illnesses Grows Significantly in U.S. Report', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'List of Smoking-Related Illnesses Grows Significantly in U.S. Report', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tavernise, Sabrina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Liver Cancer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death and Dying', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Cancer Institute', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lung Cancer', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Respiratory System', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Institutes of Health', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Campaign for Tobacco-Free Kids', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colon and Colorectal Cancer', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diabetes', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T05:11:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sabrina Tavernise', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sabrina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tavernise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/17fd6560-5b0a-5fbe-9d24-322dbdb55760', 'word_count': 781, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17fd6560-5b0a-5fbe-9d24-322dbdb55760'}, {'abstract': 'YouTube and Hulu are promoting teaser commercials for ads that will appear during the game on Feb. 2.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/17/business/media/super-bowl-ads-get-their-own-pregame-show-and-its-an-early-one.html', 'snippet': 'YouTube and Hulu are promoting teaser commercials for ads that will appear during the game on Feb. 2.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the last couple of years, Super Bowl advertisers have been drastically changing their decades-old strategy of keeping mum about their commercials until the spots are broadcast during the game. Instead of trying to surprise viewers, many sponsors are filling social-media platforms with previews, teasers and coming attractions in hopes of stimulating additional interest.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Super Bowl Ads Get Their Own Pregame Show (and It’s an Early One)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hulu.com', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T05:12:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Elliott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Elliott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d31251e-11ad-5a93-9382-d96d641a8a56', 'word_count': 481, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d31251e-11ad-5a93-9382-d96d641a8a56'}, {'abstract': 'The Ukrainian Parliament outlawed tents in public spaces and imposed other restrictions aimed at clearing out hundreds of demonstrators from Independence Square in the capital.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/17/world/europe/sweeping-new-restrictions-take-aim-at-protesters-camped-out-in-kiev.html', 'snippet': 'The Ukrainian Parliament outlawed tents in public spaces and imposed other restrictions aimed at clearing out hundreds of demonstrators from Independence Square in the capital.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Ukrainian Parliament on Thursday pushed through sweeping legislation outlawing the installation of unauthorized tents in public spaces and imposing other new restrictions on protests that seemed aimed at authorizing the government to clear hundreds of demonstrators occupying Independence Square in Kiev, the capital. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/world/ukraine-floater/ukraine-floater-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/17/world/ukraine-floater/ukraine-floater-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/world/ukraine-floater/ukraine-floater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 646, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/world/ukraine-floater/ukraine-floater-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1292, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/world/ukraine-floater/ukraine-floater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/17/world/ukraine-floater/ukraine-floater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/17/world/ukraine-floater/ukraine-floater-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sweeping New Restrictions Take Aim at Protesters Camped Out in Kiev', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sweeping New Restrictions Take Aim at Protesters Camped Out in Kiev', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kiev (Ukraine)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yanukovich, Viktor F', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T05:14:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By David M. Herszenhorn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7921c0de-af38-5776-908e-19d7400d1bed', 'word_count': 376, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7921c0de-af38-5776-908e-19d7400d1bed'}, {'abstract': 'Television highlights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/17/arts/television/whats-on-friday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '8 P.M. (Disney) CLOUD 9 (2014) Two ace snowboarders — Kayla Morgan (Dove Cameron), who was dropped from her competition team, and Will Cloud (Luke Benward), a former champion trying to recover after the wipeout that ended his career — become unlikely friends and training partners when Kayla is forced to work at the dog grooming shop owned by Will’s mother. Their mission: for Kayla to learn the Cloud 9, the maneuver that ended Will’s reign. In “I Didn’t Do It,” at 9:40, five teenagers — the supercompetitive twins Lindy (Olivia Holt) and Logan (Austin North, above with Ms. Holt), and their three best friends, Jasmine (Piper Curda), Garrett (Peyton Clark) and Delia (Sarah Gilman) — try to explain through flashbacks just how they wound up in weekly predicaments. The mayhem starts as the twins’ parents return from a night out to find their home covered in foam, with pizza falling from the ceiling, a goat in the living room and a missing 91-year-old babysitter.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On Friday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Friday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T06:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/1bc41749-4aa7-505a-a673-a55c152cc2e2', 'word_count': 754, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1bc41749-4aa7-505a-a673-a55c152cc2e2'}, {'abstract': 'Sebastián Lelio, the director of the Chilean film “Gloria,” talks about the film’s possible role as a historical parable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/movies/sebastian-lelios-gloria-flirts-with-metaphor.html', 'snippet': 'Sebastián Lelio, the director of the Chilean film “Gloria,” talks about the film’s possible role as a historical parable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The story line of “Gloria,” a drama from Chile directed by Sebastián Lelio that opens Friday, is straightforward enough: The title character, divorced and lonely, with self-absorbed adult children, yearns for a companion and frequents singles events looking for one. Gingerly, she begins a romance with Rodolfo, a retired Navy officer who turns out to be a jerk, and so she is forced to decide whether she is better off alone.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19GLORIA1/19GLORIA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 813, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19GLORIA1/19GLORIA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 813}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19GLORIA1/19GLORIA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 756, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19GLORIA1/19GLORIA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1512, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19GLORIA1/19GLORIA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19GLORIA1/19GLORIA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19GLORIA1/19GLORIA1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Woman’s Liberation, a Nation’s Past', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Woman’s Liberation, a Nation’s Past', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Gloria (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'maj