}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03c805aa-d9b3-5209-86b2-e9e23c71838b', 'word_count': 1338, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03c805aa-d9b3-5209-86b2-e9e23c71838b'}, {'abstract': 'To honor Ms. Horne on her birthday, the soprano Renée Fleming and the ageless songstress Barbara Cook turned out at Carnegie Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/18/arts/music/the-american-mezzo-soprano-is-honored-at-carnegie-hall.html', 'snippet': 'To honor Ms. Horne on her birthday, the soprano Renée Fleming and the ageless songstress Barbara Cook turned out at Carnegie Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The formidable American mezzo-soprano Marilyn Horne turned 80 on Thursday, and to honor her, Carnegie Hall presented a song celebration at Zankel Hall. During the prolonged ovation at the end of this sold-out event, Ms. Horne hugged and kissed all 13 artists who participated, an impressive group that featured both emerging and renowned singers, including the superstar soprano Renée  Fleming and the ageless songstress Barbara Cook. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/18HORNE/18HORNE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/18HORNE/18HORNE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/18HORNE/18HORNE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/arts/18HORNE/18HORNE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1310, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt