s are out in a new DVD collection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/movies/tom-clancys-jack-ryan-enters-his-fifth-incarnation.html', 'snippet': 'As “Jack Ryan: Shadow Recruit” hits theaters on Friday, the first four films in the series are out in a new DVD collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Someone once said, “Never trust a man with two first names,” but that wit obviously was not referring to Jack Ryan, the C.I.A. analyst and reluctant action hero of Tom Clancy’s series of spy novels. The closest thing pop culture may have to an American James Bond, the character has appeared in four films, which were collectively rereleased in December by Paramount Home Video as “The Jack Ryan Collection.” And now he is the focus of a fifth, “Jack Ryan: Shadow Recruit,” which arrived in theaters on Friday. It turns out that every era gets a Jack Ryan to fit the times.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19RYAN1/19RYAN1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 618, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19RYAN1/19RYAN1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 618}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19RYAN1/19RYAN1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 995, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19RYAN1/19RYAN1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1927, 'width': 1871, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/arts/19RYAN1/19RYAN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType