b': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T15:46:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e287b4e6-1484-5023-bb98-754cb11fc469', 'word_count': 730, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e287b4e6-1484-5023-bb98-754cb11fc469'}, {'abstract': 'Two strangers gave me the self-help I’d been waiting a lifetime for.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/magazine/members-of-a-very-small-club.html', 'snippet': 'Two strangers gave me the self-help I’d been waiting a lifetime for.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last summer, I rented a house from a stranger. Her name was Robin, and when I arrived to collect the keys, she gave me a quick tutorial on the washer-dryer and showed me how to restart the router. There was an uncomfortable intimacy in seeing her space, her cats, her belongings, which I’d been hoping to avoid so I could more easily pretend the house was mine. But when she offered me a cup of tea, I accepted, mostly because I didn’t want her to change her mind about renting the house to me. ', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '50', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19lives/mag-19Lives-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 556, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19lives/mag-19Lives-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 556}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19lives/mag-19Lives-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 949, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/magazine/19lives/