d-now-night/', 'snippet': 'Hotel spas are usually open only during the day, but some properties around the world are breaking from tradition by offering nighttime treatments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hotel spas are usually open only during the day, but some properties around the world are breaking from tradition by offering nighttime treatments. Chi, the spa at Shangri-La’s Fijian Resort and Spa, has a Dusk Till Dawn experience ($514) for couples where they actually sleep in the spa treatment villa. The service begins with an outdoor bath followed by a body polish, massage and dinner and ends in the morning with a facial and breakfast.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hotel Spa Treatments, Day and, Now, Night', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hotel Spa Treatments, Day and, Now, Night', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lexington (Ky)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rovinj (Croatia)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turks and Caicos Islands', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-17T20:30:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shivani Vora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shivani', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vora', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee410ca8-f85e-5318-ab10-5f2e48ecfb17', 'word_count': 270, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee410ca8-f85e-5318-ab10-5f2e48ecfb17'}, {'abstract': 'Why we struggle to keep the promises we make, even to ourselves.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/opinion/sunday/stop-trusting-yourself.html', 'snippet': 'Why we struggle to keep the promises we make, even to ourselves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TRUST is a double-edged sword. Though you can accomplish more in life if you put your faith in others, doing so also leaves you vulnerable. If your friend, business partner or political ally betrays you, he benefits — in terms of money, power or some other resource — at your expense. This risk is the drawback of trust, and it leads many people to prefer self-reliance, an arrangement that seems more secure because the only person you have to count on is yourself.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/sunday-review/19GRAY/19GRAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 775, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/19/sunday-review/19GRAY/19GRAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 775}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/sunday-review/19GRAY/19GRAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 793, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/sunday-review/19GRAY/19GRAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1586, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/sunday-review/19GRAY/19GRAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/19/sunday-review/19GRAY/19GRAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 