old off, Anheuser-Busch InBev appears poised to pay a price that will allow Oriental Brewery’s current owners, Kohlberg Kravis Roberts and Affinity Equity Partners, to more than double their money.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/17/anheuser-busch-inbev-said-to-be-near-4-5-billion-deal-for-korean-brewer/', 'snippet': 'To regain the asset it had sold off, Anheuser-Busch InBev appears poised to pay a price that will allow Oriental Brewery’s current owners, Kohlberg Kravis Roberts and Affinity Equity Partners, to more than double their money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anheuser-Busch InBev is closing in on a deal to reacquire Oriental Brewery from Kohlberg Kravis Roberts and Affinity Equity Partners for more than $4.5 billion, according to people briefed on the matter. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/business/dbpix-oriental-brewery/dbpix-oriental-brewery-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 434, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/18/business/dbpix-oriental-brewery/dbpix-oriental-brewery-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 434}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/business/dbpix-oriental-brewery/dbpix-oriental-brewery-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 740, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/business/dbpix-oriental-brewery/dbpix-oriental-brewery-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1480, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/business/dbpix-oriental-brewery/dbpix-orien