ole in “Nebraska,” “plugging away” is a way of life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SHERMAN OAKS, Calif. — June Squibb, 84, was nominated for an Oscar on Thursday for playing a way-past-giving-a-hoot Montanan in “Nebraska.” What does her character think of her dead sister-in-law? While standing over the woman’s grave, Ms. Squibb’s foul-mouthed Kate gives her hilariously matter-of-fact answer: “What a whore.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/fashion/19SCENESTEALERS2/19SCENESTEALERS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/19/fashion/19SCENESTEALERS2/19SCENESTEALERS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 522}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/fashion/19SCENESTEALERS2/19SCENESTEALERS2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 891, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/fashion/19SCENESTEALERS2/19SCENESTEALERS2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1168, 'width': 1343, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/fashion/19SCENESTEALERS2/19SCENESTEALERS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/19/fashion/19SCENESTEALERS2/19SCENESTEALERS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/fashion/19SCENESTEALERS2/19SCENESTEALERS2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, '