39c63057bed'}, {'abstract': 'The National Transportation Safety Board said it had interviewed the pilots of a Southwest Airlines flight that landed at the wrong airport this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/18/business/more-details-in-mistaken-landing-of-a-plane.html', 'snippet': 'The National Transportation Safety Board said it had interviewed the pilots of a Southwest Airlines flight that landed at the wrong airport this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Federal investigators said that the pilots of a Southwest Airlines flight that landed at the wrong airport this week realized their mistake only after they were on the runway, forcing them to brake heavily to bring the plane to a stop.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Details in Mistaken Landing of a Plane', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Details in Mistaken Landing of a Plane', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pilots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Transportation Safety Board', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Missouri', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Southwest Airlines Company', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Branson (Mo)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-18T00:45:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jad Mouawad', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mouawad', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article