olarized Congress, voting against each other more than any other state’s senators.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/18/us/politics/2-senators-have-little-but-a-state-in-common.html', 'snippet': 'Tammy Baldwin, a Democrat, and Ron Johnson, a Republican, of Wisconsin personify the polarized Congress, voting against each other more than any other state’s senators.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — He offered to explain the intricacies of the federal budget. She reminded him that she had majored in math.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/us/18divide_375/18divide_375-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 597, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/us/18divide_375/18divide_375-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 597, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/us/18divide_375/18divide_375-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/18/us/18divide_375/18divide_375-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/us/18divide_375/18divide_375-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Senators Have Little but a State in Common', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wisconsin’s Senators Appear to Have Little but Their State in Common', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywo