ons', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disabilities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Port Authority Bus Terminal (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brennan, Fredrick', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-18T02:21:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4828159-de3c-5ca1-9695-d2fa03d567f4', 'word_count': 1308, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4828159-de3c-5ca1-9695-d2fa03d567f4'}, {'abstract': 'At a time when the drugs used in executions are in short supply, an execution in Ohio has raised questions about the obligations of the state toward those it kills.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/18/us/prolonged-execution-prompts-debate-over-death-penalty-methods.html', 'snippet': 'At a time when the drugs used in executions are in short supply, an execution in Ohio has raised questions about the obligations of the state toward those it kills.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the lethal drugs flowed into his veins in the Ohio death chamber, Dennis B. McGuire at first “went unconscious” and his body was still, his daughter, Amber McGuire, said Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/us/EXECUTE/EXECUTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 386, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/18/us/EXECUTE/EXECUTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 386}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/us/EXECUTE/EXECUTE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 659, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/18/us/EXECUTE/EXECUTE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1318, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After a Prolonged Execution in Ohio, Questions Over ‘Cruel and Unusual’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After a Prolonged Execution, Questions Over ‘Cruel and Unusual’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGuire, Dennis B', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ohio', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stewart, Joy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-18T02:26:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erica Goode', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goode', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/09dba530-8140-5555-9408-10a3f370984f', 'word_count': 995, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09dba530-8140-5555-9408-10a3f370984f'}, {'abstract': 'A federal judge on Friday declared unconstitutional the state’s ultrasound requirement for women seeking abortions, saying it violated the First Amendment by requiring doctors to display a fetal image and describe it even to women who covered their eyes and ears.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/18/us/north-carolina-judge-blocks-ultrasound-requirement.html', 'snippet': 'A federal judge on Friday declared unconstitutional the state’s ultrasound requirement for women seeking abortions, saying it violated the First Amendment by requiring doctors to display a fetal image and describe it even to women who covered thei...', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal judge on \xa0Friday\xa0declared unconstitutional the state’s ultrasound requirement for women seeking abortions, saying it violated the First Amendment by requiring doctors to display a fetal image and describe it even to women who covered their eyes and ears.\xa0Judge Catherine C. Eagles of the Middle District of North Carolina called the law, passed in 2011, an impermissible attempt to compel doctors “to deliver the state’s message in favor of childbirth and against abortion.”\xa0The state has not said whether it will appeal to the Fourth Circuit, in Richmond, Va.\xa0A similar law in Texas was upheld by the Fifth Circuit, in New Orleans, and is in effect.\xa0 ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'North Carolina: Judge Blocks Ultrasound Requirement', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | South', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'North Carolina: Judge Blocks Ultrasound Requirement', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eckholm, Erik', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': '