dful of federal agents surrounding a slender 29-year-old man with light brown hair and wearing a T-shirt and jeans.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/business/19-DREAD-JP5/19-DREAD-JP5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/19/business/19-DREAD-JP5/19-DREAD-JP5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/business/19-DREAD-JP5/19-DREAD-JP5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/business/19-DREAD-JP5/19-DREAD-JP5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1439, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/business/19-DREAD-JP5/19-DREAD-JP5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/19/business/19-DREAD-JP5/19-DREAD-JP5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/business/19-DREAD-JP5/19-DREAD-JP5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Eagle Scout. Idealist. Drug Trafficker?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Eagle Scout. Idealist. Drug Trafficker?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ulbricht, Ross William', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bitcoin (Currency)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black Markets', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-18T17:31:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Segal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Segal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5784f958-7aac-5328-907a-da4563701573', 'word_count': 4814, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5784f958-7aac-5328-907a-da4563701573'}, {'abstract': 'The X Games drive revenue while showcasing sports like motocross and freestyle snowmobiling, but last year came a first: a death in competition, of Caleb Moore.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/sports/dizzying-heights-and-a-death.html', 'snippet': 'The X Games drive revenue while showcasing sports like motocross and freestyle snowmobiling, but last year came a first: a death in competition, of Caleb Moore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KEMP, Tex. — The life of an all-terrain vehicle racer is a peripatetic one, big on low-budget adventures but small when it comes to paychecks. The best racers in the nation were here in October for the ATV Pro Challenge in Memory of Caleb Moore, which offered $30,000 in total prize money, a record for the sport. As on most weekends on the ATV tour, however, it meant that competitors shared recreational vehicles and campers as well as fuel pumps and any other part that failed.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dizzying Heights, With Risks', 'kicker': None, 'cont