st consistent at big tournaments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MELBOURNE, Australia — Sloane Stephens, one of the fastest players on the WTA Tour, is a slow starter. She has fallen behind in the first set of her first three matches at the Australian Open and won two of those sets. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/sports/dogSLOANE/dogSLOANE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 657, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/19/sports/dogSLOANE/dogSLOANE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 657}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/sports/dogSLOANE/dogSLOANE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 936, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/sports/dogSLOANE/dogSLOANE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1872, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/sports/dogSLOANE/dogSLOANE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/19/sports/dogSLOANE/dogSLOANE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/sports/dogSLOANE/dogSLOANE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Center Stage Again, Stephens Looks to Rise', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Center Stage Again,