8f-6499-56c8-baf1-6b9d5b7ff900'}, {'abstract': 'As he prepares his State of the Union address, he might get some inspiration from his secretary of education.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/opinion/sunday/friedman-obamas-homework-assignment.html', 'snippet': 'As he prepares his State of the Union address, he might get some inspiration from his secretary of education.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PRESIDENT OBAMA will deliver his State of the Union address on Jan. 28, but, for my money, his secretary of education, Arne Duncan, already gave it. Just not enough people heard it. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/09/16/opinion/Friedman_New/Friedman_New-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 350, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/09/16/opinion/Friedman_New/Friedman_New-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 350, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/09/16/opinion/Friedman_New/Friedman_New-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2010/09/16/opinion/Friedman_New/Friedman_New-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/09/16/opinion/Friedman_New/Friedman_New-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama’s Homework Assignment', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Columnist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama’s Homework Assignment', 'name': None