oney. It’s ‘Let me do a little snip of tissue’ and then they get professional, lab and facility fees. Each patient is like an ATM machine.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, January 19, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-19T04:31:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/582ce249-ae79-5518-843d-e92d1d862b5c', 'word_count': 55, 'uri': 'nyt://article/582ce249-ae79-5518-843d-e92d1d862b5c'}, {'abstract': 'The bride is a doctor; the groom is a lawyer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/fashion/weddings/caitlin-homberger-nicholas-green.html', 'snippet': 'The bride is a doctor; the groom is a lawyer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dr. Caitlin Healy Homberger and Nicholas Glenn Green were married Saturday at McCrady’s, a restaurant in Charleston, S.C. Judge David C. Norton of the United States District Court in Charleston, for whom the groom was a law clerk, officiated. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Caitlin Homberger, Nicholas Green', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Caitlin Homberger, Nicholas Green', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-19T05:15:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc26fe2f-7795-54a2-b0e3-ea87dc74cdfc', 'word_count