dle the onslaught, there is always the extreme option: select all, hit delete and declare email bankruptcy.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/disruptions-looking-for-relief-from-a-flood-of-email/', 'snippet': 'Email is probably one of the most invasive forms of communication yet devised. For those who can’t seem to handle the onslaught, there is always the extreme option: select all, hit delete and declare email bankruptcy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Dec. 31, I had 46,315 unread emails in my inbox. On my first day back to work in the new year, I had zero.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/20/technology/20disrupt/20disrupt-articleLarge.png', 'height': 311, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/20/technology/20disrupt/20disrupt-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 311}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/20/technology/20disrupt/20disrupt-jumbo.png', 'height': 531, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/20/technology/20disrupt/20disrupt-superJumbo.png', 'height': 674, 'width': 1299, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/20/technology/20disrupt/20disrupt-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/20/technology/20disrupt/20disrupt-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':