, 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e4c7f4d-b0f4-50ec-9fd6-521e37bfa754', 'word_count': 594, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e4c7f4d-b0f4-50ec-9fd6-521e37bfa754'}, {'abstract': '100 years ago, The New York Herald shared with its readers a map of Tango from the French press.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/19/1914-a-map-of-tango/', 'snippet': '100 years ago, The New York Herald shared with its readers a map of Tango from the French press.', 'lead_paragraph': '“This is the map of the kingdom of king Tango. The white parts indicate countries it has subjected to his law. The black parts show those who do not recognize his sovereignty yet. We have, otherwise, marked with a black spot the French cities where bishops have forbidden the faithful to dance tango in their diocese.” — The New York Herald, Paris Edition, Jan. 20, 1914 (From Le Matin) ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/blogs/19iht-retrospective-art/19iht-retrospective-art-articleLarge.png', 'height': 566, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/19/blogs/19iht-retrospective-art/19iht-retrospective-art-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 566}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/blogs/19iht-retrospective-art/19iht-retrospective-art-jumbo.png', 'height': 723, 'width': 767, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/19/blogs/19iht-retrospective-art/19iht-retrospective-art-superJumbo.png', 'height': 723, 'width': 767, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption'