ational Association of Theater Owners, The Los Angeles Times said. Statistics compiled by the Motion Picture Association of America showed that the number of nondigital screens in the United States dropped to 6,387 by the end of 2012, from 33,319 in 2008. The last Paramount picture delivered to some theater owners in a film format was “Anchorman 2: The Legend Continues,” The Times reported. Many of the remaining film-only screens are in small towns, where owners have been hard pressed to afford a conversion.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paramount Takes Step With Digital Film', 'kicker': 'Arts, Briefly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Paramount Takes Step With Digital Film', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paramount Pictures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-19T22:50:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cieply', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cieply', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/e7b8a34e-64f6-546d-b0e3-10deaed55a17', 'word_count': 148, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7b8a34e-64f6-546d-b0e3-10deaed55a17'}, {'abstract': 'At the junior trials at the beginning of this month, in the under-21 open division, Oren Kriegel, Christopher Huber, Benjamin Kristensen and Kevin Rosenberg won the first final to become USA-1 in the World Youth Teams Championships.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/20/crosswords/bridge/finals-for-us-world-youth-teams.html', 'snippet': 'At the junior trials at the beginning of this month, in the under-21 open division, Oren Kriegel