 caught off guard by the announcement and suggested that Iran had not met all the conditions for attending the conference to end the war in Syria.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/20/world/middleeast/un-invites-iran-to-peace-conference-on-syria-surprising-us-officials.html', 'snippet': 'American officials appeared to be caught off guard by the announcement and suggested that Iran had not met all the conditions for attending the conference to end the war in Syria.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The announcement by Ban Ki-moon, the United Nations secretary general, that he had invited Iran to a peace conference to end the war in Syria drew strong objections on Sunday from American officials, who suggested that Iran had not met all the conditions for attending and that the invitation might need to be withdrawn.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Invites Iran to Syria Talks, Raising Objections From the U.S.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Invites Iran to Syria Talks, Raising Objections From the U.S.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon, Michael R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ban Ki-moon', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brahimi, Lakhdar', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-20T02:39:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_