ots-of-nebraskas-feisty-wife/', 'snippet': 'June Squibb explains how she recognized her own mother in the foul-mouthed character.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES – At 84, June Squibb is one of the unlikely ingénues of this Oscar season, lauded for her feisty performance in Alexander Payne’s “Nebraska.” Of course, Ms. Squibb has put the work in, starting with her big break, onstage in Ethel Merman’s “Gypsy” in 1959. Since then, as the Bagger’s colleague Brooks Barnes writes, Ms. Squibb “has kept plugging away and plugging away and plugging away,” taking acting classes and auditioning. Though she had worked with Mr. Payne before, she still put herself on tape to play the foul-mouthed Kate, the wife of Bruce Dern’s sullen patriarch in “Nebraska.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video: The Roots of ‘Nebraska’s’ Feisty Wife', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-20T16:29:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f461d0b4-b09e-5195-a36c-c188eaf0beb9', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f461d0b4-b09e-5195-a36c-c188eaf0beb9'}, {'abstract': 'Scenes from the Paris Men’s Fashion Week photo diary of Sarah Aubel.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/20/the-scene-paris-mens-fashion-week-lanvin-fallwinter-2014/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the Paris Men’s Fashion Week photo diary of Sarah Aubel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scenes from the Paris Men’s Fashion Week photo diary of Sarah Aubel.', 'source': 'The New York Times',