terow’s chamber music recital on Sunday at Alice Tully Hall revealed facets of his playing that don’t always come to the fore in an orchestral setting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/21/arts/music/farewells-begin-for-new-york-philharmonics-glenn-dicterow.html', 'snippet': 'Glenn Dicterow’s chamber music recital on Sunday at Alice Tully Hall revealed facets of his playing that don’t always come to the fore in an orchestral setting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When you have served as concertmaster of the New York Philharmonic for 34 years, it is only appropriate that your farewell should be a drawn-out affair. Glenn Dicterow, who will retire from this post in June to take up a teaching position at the University of Southern California, is being celebrated with star billing throughout the Philharmonic’s season.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/arts/21FAREWELL/21FAREWELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/21/arts/21FAREWELL/21FAREWELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/arts/21FAREWELL/21FAREWELL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 717, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/arts/21FAREWELL/21FAREWELL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1434, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/arts/21FAREWELL/21FAREWELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbS