nia still wary of the state’s drinking supply after a chemical spill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is no certainty in science, only knowns and unknowns. Last week, researchers reversed some conventional wisdom about trees. A shark species thought to be extinct turned up in a fish market — 48 times. And no one seemed sure how much to fear the chemical spilled into West Virginia drinking water. Just imagine what we won’t know next week.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Extinct’ Shark Reappears, and Sochi Awaits Snow', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Extinct’ Shark Reappears, and Sochi Awaits Snow', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quenqua, Douglas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water Pollution', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sharks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2014)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drought', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trees and Shrubs', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-20T22:27:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Quenqua', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Quenqua', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Summary', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d20a664-7333-58af-b101-27a7404d5de3', 'word_count': 610, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d20a664-7333-58af-b101-27a7404d5de3'}, {'abstract': 'Joe Johnson scored 25 points for the Nets, who have won seven of their last eight, and the Knicks, meanwhile, lost their fourth in a row.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/21/sports/basketball/nets-continue-surge-clobbering-knicks-at-garden.html', 'snippet': 'Joe Johnson scored 25 points for the Nets, who have won seven of their last eight, and the Knicks, meanwhile, lost their fourth in a row.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Nets began to set screens in the game’s opening minutes, and they never stopped. They set screens at the top of the key. They set screens near the left elbow. They set screens on Raymond Felton and Iman Shumpert, and the Knicks switched and scrambled. They could never figure it out.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 528, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/21/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 528}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1802, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/21/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, '