 more attention should be focused on responsible pet ownership. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Michigan: Study Disputes Stray Dog Numbers', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Midwest', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Michigan: Study Disputes Stray Dog Numbers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yaccino, Steven', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dogs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T01:00:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Yaccino', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yaccino', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/43995670-013a-5f45-ae24-301197644c83', 'word_count': 88, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43995670-013a-5f45-ae24-301197644c83'}, {'abstract': 'The United States ambassador to Haiti disagrees with an editorial suggesting that other countries have forsaken it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/21/opinion/still-committed-to-haiti.html', 'snippet': 'The United States ambassador to Haiti disagrees with an editorial suggesting that other countries have forsaken it.', 'lead_paragraph': ' ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Still Committed to Haiti', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Still Committed to Haiti', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Haiti', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International R