 the negotiating table should not become a pretext for failing to protect civilians caught in the conflict, which has claimed more than 100,000 lives.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Human Rights Watch Criticizes Inaction on Syria', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Human Rights Watch Criticizes Inaction on Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Human Rights Watch', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Torture', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T09:40:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Eddy and Chris Cottrell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eddy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cottrell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/029f3156-78b1-544f-8668-75102223f0a9', 'word_count': 764, 'uri': 'nyt://article/029f3156-78b1-544f-8668-75102223f0a9'}, {'abstract': 'Over the course of his photographic career, Danny Lyon has seen his role as coaxing his fellow man to pursue justice and freedom, whether or not it’s popular or lucrative.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/21/agitating-for-justice-and-freedom-with-a-camera/', 'snippet': 'Over the course of his photographic career, Danny Lyon has seen his role as coaxing his fellow man to pursue justice and freedom, whether or not it’s popular or lucrative.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like an Old Testament prophet, the photographer Danny Lyon has agitated for his fellow man to pursue justice and freedom. This was not always a popular message, nor a lucrative one, but that wasn’t how he saw his role.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/20/blogs/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/20/blogs/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/20/blogs/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/20/blogs/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1374, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/20/blogs/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/20/blogs/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL/20140120-lens-lyon-slide-FYBL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/2