'}, {'abstract': '“Middle-class kids don’t get locked up for smoking pot, and poor kids do,” he said in an interview.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/21/obama-evolves-on-marijuana/', 'snippet': '“Middle-class kids don’t get locked up for smoking pot, and poor kids do,” he said in an interview.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2010, the White House’s National Drug Control Strategy memo included a reminder that the Obama administration “firmly opposes the legalization of marijuana or any other illicit drug.” The 2013 update of that memo reiterated that the administration rejects legalization.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Evolves on Marijuana', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Remnick, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T17:00:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Lapidos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lapidos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43ed261f-e5a0-5562-8db8-9057cf6c15b2', 'word_count': 345, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43ed261f-e5a0-5562-8db8-9057cf6c15b2'}, {'abstract': 'Based on a Greek avgolemono, this soup is familiar and comforting, and fresh lemon adds a sunny brightness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/dining/breaking-free-from-winters-hold-with-a-lemony-escarole-soup.html', 'snippet': 'Based on a Greek avgolemono, this soup is familiar and comforting, and fresh lemon adds a sunny brightness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As winter tightens its frigid grip, I turn