te, though a hefty one,\xa0the concert the label presented\xa0at Madison Square Garden on Oct. 16, 1992, to commemorate the 30th\xa0anniversary of its relationship with Mr. Dylan. A remastered high-definition video version, on DVD and Blu-ray, and a refreshed two-CD edition, are due out\xa0March 4. Both versions will include extra performances and rehearsal material.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Dylan Tribute Concert Is Getting New Life', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Dylan Tribute Concert Is Getting New Life', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Compact Discs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clapton, Eric', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dylan, Bob', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marley, Bob', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Connor, Sinead", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Columbia Records', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T17:43:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eed29b24-04a7-58e6-8af5-cac65e644b5c', 'word_count': 394, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eed29b24-04a7-58e6-8af5-cac65e644b5c'}, {'abstract': 'Despite having few amenities at the site of the Aam Aadmi sit-in demonstration on Tuesday, supporters were determined to stay as long as it took until the party’s demands were met.', 'web_url': 'https://india.b