ws', '_id': 'nyt://article/567aab00-f365-5e54-a05f-39fc849b6e93', 'word_count': 118, 'uri': 'nyt://article/567aab00-f365-5e54-a05f-39fc849b6e93'}, {'abstract': '“Jacuzzi” is set in a Colorado ski resort.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/21/ars-nova-to-stage-new-play-from-debate-society/', 'snippet': '“Jacuzzi” is set in a Colorado ski resort.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Debate Society, the quirky three-person theater troupe, will follow up its breakthrough hits “Buddy Cop 2” and “Blood Play” with “Jacuzzi,” which focuses on a group of characters who populate the “7th-best ski resort in southwest central Colorado.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ars Nova to Stage New Play From Debate Society', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ars Nova to Stage Play From Debate Society', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bos, Hannah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Butler, Oliver', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thureen, Paul', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ARS NOVA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Debate Society (Theater Co)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T18:46:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b6efba9-8f4b-517a-a3d8-9c33342ce338', 'word_count': 137, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b6efba9-8f4b-517a-a3d8-9c33342ce338'}, {'abstract': 'The New York City medical examiner said DNA tests confirmed that remains found last week were of Avonte Oquendo, 14, who disappeared last fall in Queens.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/nyregion/remains-found-in-queens-are-matched-to-missing-autistic-boy.html', 'snippet': 'The New York City medical examiner said DNA tests confirmed that remains found last week were of Avonte Oquendo, 14, who disappeared last fall in Queens.', 'lead_paragraph': 'First there was the disappearance: a 14-year-old boy with autism last seen walking out of his school by the Queens waterfront last fall. Then there were the months of searching, the posters of a fresh-faced teenager that a city came to know simply as Avonte.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/nyregion/avonte_web1/avonte_web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 776, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/21/nyregion/avonte_web1/avonte_web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 776}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/nyregion/avonte_web1/avonte_web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 948, 'width': 733, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/nyregion/avonte_web1/avonte_web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 948, 'width': 733, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/nyregion/avonte_web1/avonte_web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/21/nyregion/avonte_web1/avonte_web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 