ew Jersey took the oath of office at the War Memorial Theater in Trenton on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Chris Christie of New Jersey took the oath of office at the War Memorial Theater in Trenton on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/nyregion/CHRISTIE/CHRISTIE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/nyregion/CHRISTIE/CHRISTIE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/nyregion/CHRISTIE/CHRISTIE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/nyregion/CHRISTIE/CHRISTIE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/nyregion/CHRISTIE/CHRISTIE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/22/nyregion/CHRISTIE/CHRISTIE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/nyregion/CHRISTIE/CHRISTIE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Christie Sworn In for Second Term', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T19:11:12+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/0061569b-da85-5cbd-8d3b-445babe405e1', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/0061569b-da85-5cbd-8d3b-445babe405e1'}, {'abstract': 'The president has vowed to create a rational policy on spying so many times that no one seems to be paying attention anymore.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/21/america-to-obama-were-not-listening/', 'snippet': 'The president has vowed to create a rational policy on spying so many times that no one seems to be paying attention anymore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama has come before the American people so many times now to promise transparency, declare his respect for civil rights and privacy, and vow to create a rational policy on government spying, that no one seems to be listening anymore.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'America to Obama: We’re Not Listening', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T19:12:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fcb6fc00-2364-5b12-94da-6940068ef933', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fcb6fc00-2364-5b12-94da-6940068ef933'}, {'abstract': '“Ghosts of Love: Songs from the Reel World of David Lynch,” a theatrical cabaret at Stage 72, features Lauren Fox and Ritt Henn performing tunes from Mr. Lynch’s films.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/arts/music/ghosts-of-love-evokes-david-lynchs-films.html', 'snippet': '“Ghosts of Love: Songs from the Reel World of David Lynch,” a theatrical cabaret at Stage 72, features Lauren Fox and Ritt Henn performing tunes from Mr. Lynch’s films.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Romantic love in the films of David Lynch is more than passion; as often as not, it is a dangerously morbid obsession expressed in songs that thread through the soundtracks like the tempting voices of sirens. The title song of “Blue Velvet”; Roy Orbison’s “In Dreams,” from the same movie; and Chris Isaak’s “Wicked Game,” from “Wild at Heart,” are prime examples of songs that dangle the keys to supernatural mysteries. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/arts/lauren/lauren-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/arts/lauren/lauren-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/arts/lauren/lauren-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/arts/lauren/lauren-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur