orm surge, over 24 hours, a “Nova” program says, while the surge of Haiyan, in the Philippines, occurred in just minutes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The PBS science program “Nova” has been trying to quicken its pace lately, generating episodes pegged to newsmaking events like Hurricane Sandy and the Boston Marathon bombing. “Killer Typhoon,” about the catastrophic storm in the Philippines in November, is the latest, and from it we learn once again that water is something to be feared.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Conjuring the Global Dangers of Water', 'kicker': 'Television Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Conjuring the Global Dangers of Water', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typhoon Haiyan (2013)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tidal Waves and Tsunamis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typhoons', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public Broadcasting Service', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Nova (TV Program)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T19:19:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Genzlinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Genzlinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/d44e18d2-27db-56f3-b651-27dfb89c1cd3', 'word_count': 412, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d44e18d2-27db-56f3-b651-27dfb89c1cd3'}, {'abstract': 'People, like those affected by the Target breach, who believe their data was stolen have many defenses, including simply changing their passwords.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/your-money/data-breaches-are-scary-but-dont-panic-react.html', 'snippet': 'People, like those affected by the Target breach, who believe their data was stolen have many defenses, including simply changing their passwords.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s always upsetting when you are notified by a business, whether it is a credit card issuer or a retailer, that your personal or financial information may have been stolen in a data breach. The recent incident at Target stores, one of the largest corporate breaches in recent years, affected millions of people.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Data Breaches Are Scary, but Don’t Panic. React.', 'kicker': 'Your Money Adviser', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Data Breaches Are Scary, but Don’t Panic. React.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Identity Theft', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carrns, Ann', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Target Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debit Cards', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Cards', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberattacks and Hackers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T19:20:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/40d1b700-53cc-5e25-8d74-0cd7953d2adc', 'word_count': 916, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40d1b700-53cc-5e25-8d74-0cd7953d2adc'}, {'abstract': 'The disco-inflected musical about Imelda Marcos will be a commercial production in space rented from the Public.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/21/here-lies-love-will-return-to-the-public-theater/', 'snippet': 'The disco-inflected musical about Imelda Marcos will be a commercial production in space rented from the Public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The critically acclaimed musical “Here Lies Love,” which uses discotheque atmospherics to explore the celebrity life of former first lady of the Philippines, Imelda Marcos, will return starting March 24 to the Public Theater for an open-ended run, one of the producers, Joey Parnes, said on Tuesday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21lies/21lies-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21lies/21lies-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21lies/21lies-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21lies/21lies-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1301, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21lies/21lies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'th