pany based in Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/realestate/commercial/jonathan-j-landau.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Landau is the chief executive of the Fortis Property Group, a private real estate development and investment company based in Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mr. Landau, 39, is the chief executive of the Fortis Property Group, a private real estate development and investment company based in Brooklyn that focuses mainly on office and residential properties. The company is involved in several multifamily projects in the New York area, including condominium buildings in North Williamsburg and Brooklyn Heights.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jonathan J. Landau', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jonathan J. Landau', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fortis Property Group LLC', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marino, Vivian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Landau, Jonathan J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate (Commercial)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Renting and Leasing (Real Estate)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-21T22:45:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'subsection_name': 'Commercial Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivian Marino', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Marino', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interview', '_id': 'nyt://article/083837df-fc23-575c-879d-9db53be9a041', 'word_count': 811, 'uri': 'nyt://article/083837df-fc23-575c-879d-9db53be9a041'}, {'abstract': 'Will Eno’s Broadway debut will go into the theater where the Janis Joplin biomusical is now playing.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/21/joplin-will-make-way-for-joneses-on-broadway/', 'snippet': 'Will Eno’s Broadway debut will go into the theater where the Janis Joplin biomusical is now playing.', 'lead_paragraph': '“A Night With Janis Joplin,” a Broadway musical that has been a modest seller at the box office, will close in February and then aim to reopen in March at another space in New York City, the producers announced on Tuesday evening. They declined to specify a closing date or identify the possible new space, only saying in a statement that they were “finalizing a wonderful option to move to another venue.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21joplin/21joplin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21joplin/21joplin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21joplin/21joplin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21joplin/21joplin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1374, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/21/theater/21joplin/21joplin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_n