ch Lists', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Rebuff to Overbroad Watch Lists', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ibrahim, Rahinah', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fourteenth Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Homeland Security Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Security', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alsup, William Haskell', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T02:07:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f7d8e37-4f9b-5cad-ad82-61c4e20b5828', 'word_count': 523, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f7d8e37-4f9b-5cad-ad82-61c4e20b5828'}, {'abstract': 'The lives of millions of civilians depend on an end to the war and the deliveries of humanitarian supplies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/opinion/another-syria-peace-conference.html', 'snippet': 'The lives of millions of civilians depend on an end to the war and the deliveries of humanitarian supplies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Few peace conferences have been set up amid the unrelenting pessimism that surrounds the talks involving Syria that open Wednesday in Switzerland. But while a peace agreement is unlikely to be reached anytime soon, the meeting can still produce useful results. That has to be the approach of the conveners, including the United States, Russia and the United Nations. Crucial early goals should include a cease-fire and the delivery of humanitarian assistance to millions of desperate civilians.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Another Syria Peace Conference', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Another Syria Peace Conference', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zarif, Mohammad Javad', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T02:11:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/45de52c5-5442-54b6-a71f-9b74c4eeaeaa', 'word_count': 654, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45de52c5-5442-54b6-a71f-9b74c4eeaeaa'}, {'abstract': 'The N.F.L. might appear pass happy, with quarterbacks delivering passes to three and four wide receivers, but the rushing game still resonates with talent evaluators.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/sports/ncaafootball/at-senior-bowl-the-focus-is-on-the-ground-game.html', 'snippet': 'The N.F.L. might appear pass happy, with quarterbacks delivering passes to three and four wide receivers, but the rushing game still resonates with talent evaluators.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOBILE, Ala. — If the playoff performances of the