/5b879d71-0cc1-5c8d-947f-0e0c2534ff4b'}, {'abstract': 'A plastic pill box with the days of the week becomes one of the hottest — and strangest — things to own when you reach a certain age.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/booming/hit-60-and-the-must-have-lists-change.html', 'snippet': 'A plastic pill box with the days of the week becomes one of the hottest — and strangest — things to own when you reach a certain age.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was a lot of old lady stuff I swore years ago I would never do: Take an aqua exercise class, bring groceries home in a wheelie cart, address a waiter as “Young Man,” own a plastic pill box with the days of the week on it. And I am proud to say I have yet to address a waiter as “Young Man.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/booming/22wadler-booming-oldlady/22wadler-booming-oldlady-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/booming/22wadler-booming-oldlady/22wadler-booming-oldlady-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/booming/22wadler-booming-oldlady/22wadler-booming-oldlady-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/booming/22wadler-booming-oldlady/22wadler-booming-oldlady-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1696, 'width': 1132, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/booming/22wadler-booming-oldlady/22wadler-booming-oldlady-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su