 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b1f56737-3260-54ab-975d-39970bd412ca', 'word_count': 37, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b1f56737-3260-54ab-975d-39970bd412ca'}, {'abstract': 'The Ojai Music Festival’s artistic director, Thomas W. Morris, is looking ahead. Mr. Morris announced the music directors for the next three years.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/music-directors-named-for-ojai-festival/', 'snippet': 'The Ojai Music Festival’s artistic director, Thomas W. Morris, is looking ahead. Mr. Morris announced the music directors for the next three years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Presumably this year’s Ojai Music Festival in California, scheduled for June 12 to 15, with Jeremy Denk as its music director, is sufficiently settled that its artistic director, Thomas W. Morris, is looking ahead. Mr. Morris announced on Tuesday afternoon the music directors for the next three years. Steven Schick, the percussionist and conductor, will oversee the 2015 festival. The opera and theater director Peter Sellars, who has staged several productions at Ojai, will take over in 2016. And the conductor Esa-Pekka Salonen, who was the festival’s music director in 2001, will return to lead the festival in 2017. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Music Directors Named for Ojai Festival', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ojai Music Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Denk, Jeremy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salonen, Esa-Pekka', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schick, Steven', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sellars, Peter', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ojai (Calif)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T14:25:29+0000', 'document_ty