v (Ukraine)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T17:27:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Heather Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Heather', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/40e57b56-ce9d-5e44-b575-8582367d5c14', 'word_count': 616, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40e57b56-ce9d-5e44-b575-8582367d5c14'}, {'abstract': 'During a break in the schedule, many in the fashion crowd gathered at the American ambassador’s residence for a party hosted by Anna Wintour.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/between-couture-shows-a-fashionable-party/', 'snippet': 'During a break in the schedule, many in the fashion crowd gathered at the American ambassador’s residence for a party hosted by Anna Wintour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday evening, in the break in the couture schedule between Bouchra Jarrar that afternoon and Armani Privé that night, many in the fashion crowd gathered at the residence of the United States ambassador on the Rue du Faubourg St.-Honoré (currently without an actual ambassador since Charles Rivkin ended his tenure this summer) for a party to honor Richard Baker, the chief executive of Hudson’s Bay Company, which recently acquired Saks Fifth Avenue. That morning, Mr. Baker had been to the Chanel show, his first time at couture.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/fashion/22RUNWAYWINTOUR/22RUNWAYWINTOUR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/23/fashion/22RUNWAYWINTOUR/22RUNWAYWINTOUR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/fashion/22RUNWAYWINTOUR/22RUNWAYWINTOUR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/fashion/22RUNWAYWINTOUR/22RUNWAYWINTOUR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1428, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/fashion/22RUNWAYWINTOUR/22RUNWAYWINTOUR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/23/fashion/22RUNWAYWINTOUR/22RUNWAYWINTOUR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/fashion/22RUNWAYWINTOUR/22RUNWAYWINTOUR-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Between Couture Shows, a Fashionable Party', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In a Break From Paris Couture, Time to Talk Tennis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T17:28:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Emmrich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Emmrich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72e89003-4bdc-588d-a038-7cf71abd7083', 'word_count': 349, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72e89003-4bdc-588d-a038-7cf71abd7083'}, {'abstract': 'Systemic risk has been cited as the rationale for special treatment of certain transactions under the bankruptcy code, but the failure to extend these “safe harbors” to actions under state law calls that rationale into question.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/a-safe-harbor-without-full-protection/', 'snippet': 'Systemic risk has been cited as the rationale for special treatment of certain transactions under the bankruptcy code, but the failure to extend these “safe harbors” to actions under state law calls that rationale into question.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A recent ruling by a bankruptcy judge in New York adds to a growing body of opinions that appear to leave the door open for actions under state law that would normally be prohibited in federal bankruptcy proceedings.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/business/dealbook/dbpix-debt/dbpix-debt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/business/dealbook/dbpix-debt/dbpix-debt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/business/dealbook/dbpix-debt/dbpix-debt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/business/dealbook/dbpix-debt/dbpix-debt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/business/dealbook/dbpix-debt/dbpix-debt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/22/business/dealbook/dbpix-debt/dbpix-debt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/business/dealbook/dbpix-debt/dbpix-debt-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Safe Harbor Without Full Protection', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T17:28:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen J. Lubben', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Lubben', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c765ccc-975a-5adb-803f-1653d5bf9d18', 'word_count': 489, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c765ccc-975a-5adb-803f-1653d5bf9d18'}, {'abstract': 'During week one of the Picky Eater Project, 4-year-old twins who’d once demanded that their parents serve as short-order toast chefs during meals prove surprisingly willing to eat what they help prepare.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/a-young-picky-eater-surprises-his-parents-in-the-kitchen/', 'snippet': 'During week one of the Picky Eater Project, 4-year-old twins who’d once demanded that their parents serve as short-order toast chefs during meals prove surprisingly willing to eat what they help prepare.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Have a picky eater? Christine Zanchi and her husband, Fran Nostrame, an I.T. operations engineer at I.B.M., do. They have twin 4-year-old sons, both of whom critiqued what was on the table before they even sat down. They considered one twin, Andrew, the picky one. He turned his nose up at most everything while his brother Nathaniel ate and tried more foods. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/style/motherlode-picky-eater2/motherlode-picky-eater2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/style/motherlode-picky-eater2/motherlode-picky-eater2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 448}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/style/motherlode-picky-eater2/motherlode-picky-eater2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/style/motherlode-picky-eater2/motherlode-picky-eater2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1530, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/style/motherlode-picky-eater2/motherlode-picky-eater2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/22/style/motherlode-picky-eater2/motherlode-picky-eater2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/style/motherlode-picky-eater2/motherlode-picky-eater2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Young Picky Eater Surprises His Parents in the Kitchen', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children a