ction of 21 sparkling yet streamlined styles that she describes as “an ode to a contemporary woman.” Her pieces have a pared-down, architectural quality, with contours molded to accommodate the body’s movements; this standout rose-gold-and-diamond collar took nine months to shape so that it sits on the shoulders and collarbone just so. It’s a marvel of minimalism — yet totally regal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/t-magazine/22jewelry-barsamian/22jewelry-barsamian-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 607, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/t-magazine/22jewelry-barsamian/22jewelry-barsamian-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 607}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/t-magazine/22jewelry-barsamian/22jewelry-barsamian-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1012, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/t-magazine/22jewelry-barsamian/22jewelry-barsamian-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2023, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/t-magazine/22jewelry-barsamian/22jewelry-barsamian-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/22/t-magazine/22jewelry-barsamian/22jewelry-barsamian-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/t-magazine/22jewelry-barsamian/22jewelry-barsamian-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Feeling For | A Modern Heirloom from Fine Jewelry’s Heiress Apparent', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gold', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T17:30:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca978951-a11f-56e8-93b9-473dfca3d3ec', 'word_count': 113, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca978951-a11f-56e8-93b9-473dfca3d3ec'}, {'abstract': 'The soprano Renée Fleming will be the first opera superstar to sing the anthem at the Super Bowl.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/rene-fleming-to-sing-national-anthem-at-super-bowl/', 'snippet': 'The soprano Renée Fleming will be the first opera superstar to sing the anthem at the Super Bowl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the soprano Renée Fleming steps up to the microphone at MetLife Stadium to sing “The Star-Spangled Banner” on Feb. 2, she will be the first opera singer ever to sing the anthem at the Super Bowl. That’s odd, given the song’s range (an octave and a half) and difficulty, but so far the closest the NFL has come to having an opera star sing the anthem was in 2002, when it tapped Mariah Carey, whose mother was an opera singer (and who had the necessary range).', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'cr