: 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0934b47b-1758-5e0d-8983-5a7139eebf14', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0934b47b-1758-5e0d-8983-5a7139eebf14'}, {'abstract': 'The recommendations were sought after voters in some locations waited hours to cast ballots in the 2012 presidential election.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/23/us/politics/us-panel-recommends-ways-to-reduce-voting-delays.html', 'snippet': 'The recommendations were sought after voters in some locations waited hours to cast ballots in the 2012 presidential election.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A bipartisan panel created by President Obama after many voters waited hours to cast ballots in 2012 on Wednesday recommended ways to keep delays to no more than a half-hour. But changes are up to the states and 8,000 local jurisdictions, where voting laws have been a partisan battleground since the 2000 presidential recount.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Panel Suggests Ways to Reduce Voting Delays', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Panel Suggests Ways To Reduce Voting Delays', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T18:38:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jackie Calmes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jackie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Calmes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b175502-0a84-5d70-aa1e-6e420274239f', 'word_count': 602, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b175502-0a84-5d70-aa1e-6e420274239f'}, {'abstract': 'Times critics share what they’ve been listening to lately.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/classical-playlist-olivia-block-william-christie-raschr-saxophone-quartet-and-more/', 'snippet': 'Times critics share what they’ve been listening to lately.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BLOCK: ‘Karren’Olivia Block, electronics, field recordings(Sedimental)Known as a designer of aural environments, the Chicago musician Olivia Block gets lumped together with electronic improvisers and installation artists. That might not be altogether wrong, but the two tremendous pieces that constitute her newest LP are as rigorously assembled, finely detailed and dramatically taut as any modern composition you might care to name, each evoking a dreamlike story without words. (Steve Smith)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/arts/classical-block/classical-block-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/23/arts/classical-block/classical-block-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/arts/classical-block/classical-block-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/arts/classical-block/classical-block-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1267, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/arts/classical-block/c