-3ce2-544d-a0c9-cd5884f8ee7e'}, {'abstract': 'A top-secret surprise screening had everyone talking at Sundance.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/sundance-reactions-from-the-secret-screening-of-nymphomaniac/', 'snippet': 'A top-secret surprise screening had everyone talking at Sundance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARK CITY, Utah — It was the whisper heard up and down the mountains and across the packed restaurants and pop-up lounges of Main Street here — which film would be the top-secret surprise screening that publicists and festival organizers at Sundance started touting early this week? Promising a “highly anticipated film by a major filmmaker” that should not be missed, the guesses included Wes Anderson’s “Grand Budapest Hotel,” Lars von Trier’s epic “Nymphomaniac” and — jokingly — the next Tyler Perry or Muppets movie.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/arts/22carpetbagger-nymphomaniac/22carpetbagger-nymphomaniac-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/arts/22carpetbagger-nymphomaniac/22carpetbagger-nymphomaniac-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/arts/22carpetbagger-nymphomaniac/22carpetbagger-nymphomaniac-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 581, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/arts/22carpetbagger-nymphomaniac/22carpetbagger-nymphomaniac-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 804, 'width': 1417, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20