ening near a computer, even after the website has been closed.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/googles-chrome-browser-could-let-malicious-sites-listen-to-conversations/', 'snippet': 'A software developer discovered a way for malicious websites to use Chrome to listen to conversations happening near a computer, even after the website has been closed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Web developers can exploit bugs in Google’s Chrome browser to listen through a computer’s microphone — even if the browser window is not open, according to a developer who publicly reported the vulnerability Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bugs in Chrome Browser Could Give Access to Microphones', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T22:42:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Cain Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': 'Cain', 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02fcb78d-f120-5cbd-88a3-4f119523f221', 'word_count': 611, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02fcb78d-f120-5cbd-88a3-4f119523f221'}, {'abstract': 'Lupita Nyong’o, who is nominated for an Oscar for her role in “12 Years a Slave,” is this year’s most traditional ingénue and a front-runner for the prize.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/23/movies/awardsseason/lupita-nyongo-is-red-carpet-savvy-and-has-awards-to-match.html', 'snippet': 'Lupita Nyong’o, who is nominated for an Oscar for her role in “12 Years a Slave,” is this year’s most traditional ingénue and a front-runner for the prize.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Lupita Nyong’o was giving a surprise birthday party for her best friend, Ben Kahn. She pulled out a tray of sweets — “vegan, gluten free,” she noted — and organized a rendition of “Happy Birthday” as Mr. Kahn, 32, who has known Ms. Nyong’o since their college days, grinned. He was being feted at a glittery, exclusive soiree here, surrounded by Hollywood luminaries.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gaining Accolades, Friends and Steam', 'kicker': 'The Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gaining Accolades, Friends and Steam', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "Nyong'o, Lupita", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': '12 Years a Slave (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T22:45:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'subsection_name': 'Awards Season', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ae82c41-7a4e-5e41-b095-216321064ec2', 'word_count': 1282, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ae82c41-7a4e-5e41-b095-216321064ec2'}, {'abstract': 'As the winter weather batters the Northeast, people are discovering that their smartphones can shut down in extreme cold. Can these conditions affect the life of your smartphone’s battery?', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/is-the-cold-weather-battering-your-smartphone-battery/', 'snippet': 'As the winter weather batters the Northeast, people are discovering that their smartphones can shut down in extreme cold. Can these conditions affect the life of your smartphone’s battery?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Imagine this: You’re shoveling snow in the blistering cold from another arctic blast. You stop for a moment and pull out your smartphone to see the temperature — “Is it minus 10\xa0degrees yet? It feels like minus 30.” — then your phone shuts off. You frantically press the power button a few times. Nothing. It’s dead, or at least it seems that way.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/technology/22bits-coldiphone/22bits-coldiphone-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/technology/22bits-coldiphone/22bits-coldiphone-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/technology/22bits-coldiphone/22bits-coldiphone-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/technology/22bits-coldiphone/22bits-coldiphone-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/technology/22bits-coldiphone/22bits-coldiphone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/22/technology/22bits-coldiphone/22bits-coldiphone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/technology/22bits-coldiphone/22bits-coldiphone-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Your Smartphone Shuts Down From the Cold', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cellular Telephones', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Temperature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Popular Mechanics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-22T22:50:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/87c32553-2c70-5af8-8b48-141bbd9c4e0e', 'word_count': 503, 'uri': 'nyt://article/87c32553-2c70-5af8-8b48-141bbd9c4e0e'}, {'abstract': 'Greg Kinnear stars as a troubled lawyer in this new Fox comedy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/arts/television/100000002665612/excerpt-rake.html', 'snippet': 'Greg Kinnear stars as a troubled lawyer in this new Fox comedy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Greg Kinnear stars as a troubled lawyer in this new Fox comedy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/multimedia/rake/rake-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 335, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/multimedia/rake/rake-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 335}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/multimedia/rake/rake-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 571, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt