 men who died of bullet wounds and a third who fell to his death. With tensions at a dangerous level, and Ukraine’s citizens inflamed by both economic policy and new laws against public assembly, President Viktor Yanukovich met with the three most prominent opposition leaders: the popular boxer Vitali Klitschko, the former economics minister Arseniy Yatsenyuk, and the far-right nationalist Oleg Tyagnibok. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ukrainian Standoff', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ukrainian Standoff', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tyagnibok, Oleg', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klitschko, Vitali', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yanukovich, Viktor F', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yatsenyuk, Arseniy P', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-23T02:04:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9342ab5f-7bfe-52c7-8bab-8f89e69de405', 'word_count': 475, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9342ab5f-7bfe-52c7-8bab-8f89e69de405'}, {'abstract': 'The trial of Mathew Martoma, a former SAC Capital Advisors portfolio manager, took a turn on Wednesday when Dr. Sidney Gilman, the government’s most important witness, showed signs of forgetfulness.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/22/details-slip-by-insider-trials-main-witness/', 'snippet': 'The trial of Mathew Martoma, a former SAC Capi