kly. I had recently published a book of poems crafted out of family stories, and it had been written up, along with a brief interview. In the interview, I reckon with the complicated history of my family — I am a white descendant of Thomas Jefferson — and the fact that some of my ancestors were slave owners from 1670 until the Civil War. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cousins, Across the Color Line', 'kicker': 'Private Lives', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cousins, Across the Color Line', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Slavery', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jefferson, Thomas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-23T02:29:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tess Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10937ce0-16f0-5748-b18c-51c4fd2297a4', 'word_count': 1389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10937ce0-16f0-5748-b18c-51c4fd2297a4'}, {'abstract': 'Anyone who has played cornerback at any level, who has had to play man-to-man with no help, can identify with Sherman, the Seahawks’ dynamic, breast-beating All-Pro.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/23/sports/football/seahawks-richard-sherman-like-cornerbacks-before-him-plays-man-to-man-and-goes-toe-to-toe.html', 'snippet': 'Anyone who has played cornerback at any level, who has had to play man-to-man with no help, can identify with Sherman, the Seahawks’ dynamic, breast-beating All-Pro.', 'lead_paragraph': '