ly producing his Semana lounge chair.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Weeks designed Semana, a leather-and-steel lounge chair, in 1999, but couldn’t find sturdy enough fabric for its production. (Habitat in London was able to solve that problem and sold the chair for 10 years, paying Mr. Weeks a royalty.) Then, while vacationing in Marfa, Tex., last year, he discovered Big Bend Saddlery, whose eighth-of-an-inch-thick leather had the heft he had long sought.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/garden/23CURR3_MUSIC_SPAN/23CURR3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/23/garden/23CURR3_MUSIC_SPAN/23CURR3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/garden/23CURR3_MUSIC_SPAN/23CURR3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/garden/23CURR3_MUSIC_SPAN/23CURR3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/garden/23CURR3_MUSIC_SPAN/23CURR3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/23/garden/23CURR3_MUSIC_SPAN/23CURR3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/garden/23CURR3_MUSIC_SPAN/23CURR3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'wi