e see a designer’s sketches as insight into the creative process behind the final product. But in the resort collections, scribbles are front and center on statement garments and accessories. Chicken scratch has become a new way of coloring inside the lines, like on a Cedric Charlier shirt with a black scribbled collar set atop a salmon sketch pattern, or on a leather Balenciaga dress covered entirely in childlike scrawl. And as one standout piece — a herringbone-scribbled Marc Jacobs bag with a cheetah-print flap and pink-and-white handle — proves, these artistic accessories look best paired with other eye-catching patterns and colors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/t-magazine/23market-barsamian/23market-barsamian-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/23/t-magazine/23market-barsamian/23market-barsamian-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/t-magazine/23market-barsamian/23market-barsamian-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/t-magazine/23market-barsamian/23market-barsamian-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/t-magazine/23market-barsamian/23market-barsamian-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/23/t-magazine/23market-barsamian/23market-barsamian-thumbStandar