://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/23/a-conversation-with-pankaj-ghemawat-iese-business-school-professor/', 'snippet': 'India Ink spoke with Mr. Ghemawat, who co-authored a study that measured the globalization levels of 139 countries, about why India ranked near the bottom of his rankings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pankaj Ghemawat, a professor of global strategy at the IESE business school in Madrid, and Steven Altman, a senior research associate at IESE, released the\xa02013 Depth of Globalization\xa0report in November, which measures the globalization levels of 139 countries based on flows of trade, capital, information and people. The study found that India, ranked 123rd, was one of the least globalized economies. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/world/asia/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 348, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/world/asia/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 348, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/world/asia/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/23/world/asia/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/world/asia/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk/23-ghemawat-IndiaInk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarg