com/2014/01/23/london-theater-journal-stripped-of-illusions-but-still-glittering-and-gay/', 'snippet': 'The Menier Chocolate Factory’s production of the famously hard-to-stage musical “Candide” suggests that life may just be endurable — as long as we have the pluck to put on a show about how awful it is.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — This is not perhaps a moment — is it ever? — that you need to be reminded that the world can be cruel and dangerous. The various screens in your life — television, laptop, smartphone — will readily confirm this observation at the push of a button. The dire news they offer is unlikely to make you feel good.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/theater/22candide1/22candide1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/22/theater/22candide1/22candide1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/theater/22candide1/22candide1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/theater/22candide1/22candide1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/22/theater/22candide1/22candide1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/22/theater/22candide1/22candide1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credi