 much darker.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Anatomy of a Scene: Video of ‘Stranger by the Lake’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Film Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-23T18:36:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a04f3e35-a591-5f48-96fd-3bb60b3d79a6', 'word_count': 88, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a04f3e35-a591-5f48-96fd-3bb60b3d79a6'}, {'abstract': 'Brian F. O’Byrne and Debra Messing in a scene from John Patrick Shanley’s play “Outside Mullingar,” on Broadway at the Samuel J. Friedman Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/theater/100000002667129/excerpt-outside-mullingar.html', 'snippet': 'Brian F. O’Byrne and Debra Messing in a scene from John Patrick Shanley’s play “Outside Mullingar,” on Broadway at the Samuel J. Friedman Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brian F. O’Byrne and Debra Messing in a scene from John Patrick Shanley’s play “Outside Mullingar,” on Broadway at the Samuel J. Friedman Theater.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/23/multimedia/mullingar/mullingar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/23/multimedia/mullingar/mullingar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit':