ary of people without much personal credit history, but there are some ways to build such a record.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/your-money/starting-to-build-a-credit-history.html', 'snippet': 'Lenders are wary of people without much personal credit history, but there are some ways to build such a record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Katie Brown, a 25-year-old horse trainer in Parkland, Fla., had never given much thought to whether she needed to establish credit. With her parents’ help, she avoided student loans. And she used a checking account and debit card to pay for what she needed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/business/AdviserSUB/AdviserSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/25/business/AdviserSUB/AdviserSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/business/AdviserSUB/AdviserSUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/business/AdviserSUB/AdviserSUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/business/AdviserSUB/AdviserSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/25/business/AdviserSUB/AdviserSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'