objects to a technology called microstamping, which prints a unique code on shell casings to make it easier to trace weapons used in crimes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/us/gun-maker-will-limit-sales-in-protest-of-california-law.html', 'snippet': 'Smith & Wesson objects to a technology called microstamping, which prints a unique code on shell casings to make it easier to trace weapons used in crimes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Smith & Wesson, the firearms manufacturer, announced\xa0Thursday\xa0that it would not sell new semiautomatic pistols in California because of its objections to a gun safety law that took effect in the state last May.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gun Maker Will Limit Sales in Protest of California Law', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gun Maker Will Limit Sales in Protest of California Law', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Smith & Wesson', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T01:05:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew Hamilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hamilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5098c9c2-d142-524a-bc2f-dd580408e8c9', 'word_count': 264, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5098c9c2-d142-524a-bc2f-dd580408e8c9'}, {'abstract': 'As he has each year of his presidency, Mr. Obama made himself available to the news department affiliated with the network covering the Super Bowl.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/business/media/bill-oreilly-to-interview-president-obama-before-super-bowl.html', 'snippet': 'As he has each year of his presidency, Mr. Obama made himself available to the news department affiliated with the network covering the Super Bowl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In what has now become a Super Bowl tradition, President Obama will sit for an interview to be broadcast during Fox’s pregame coverage on Feb. 2. And for the second time he will speak with Bill O’Reilly of the Fox News Channel.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill O’Reilly to Interview President Obama Before Super Bowl', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox News Channel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Reilly, Bill", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T01:11:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/497b92d8-81c9-59f0-8de3-f79d3b0ae795', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/497b92d8-81c9-59f0-8de3-f79d3b0ae795'}, {'abstract': 'His work focused on adaptations of children’s books and included an Emmy-winning collaboration with Ntozake Shange.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/movies/michael-sporn-67-film-animator-dies.html', 'snippet': 'His work focused on adaptations of children’s books and included an Emmy-winning collaboration with Ntozake Shange.', 'lead_pa