 Consumer Financial Protection Bureau, issues rules of its own to protect consumers of small loans from excessive and unaffordable costs. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Progress on Predatory Lending', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Progress on Predatory Lending', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Payday Loans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Financial Protection Bureau', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Office of the Comptroller of the Currency', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Deposit Insurance Corp', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T01:58:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/a41ab88c-9521-5569-9c86-781248d1fb45', 'word_count': 303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a41ab88c-9521-5569-9c86-781248d1fb45'}, {'abstract': 'Wawrinka continued the best stretch of his career with a four-set victory over Tomas Berdych, setting up a possible final against his Swiss countryman Roger Federer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/sports/tennis/still-surging-stanislas-wawrinka-reaches-australian-open-final.html', 'snippet'