816, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ef10bba-927d-5632-83dd-db6428b40207'}, {'abstract': 'Coca-Cola and other corporations are starting to see global warming as an economically disruptive force affecting commodity costs and supply chains.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/science/earth/threat-to-bottom-line-spurs-action-on-climate.html', 'snippet': 'Coca-Cola and other corporations are starting to see global warming as an economically disruptive force affecting commodity costs and supply chains.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Coca-Cola has always been more focused on its economic bottom line than on global warming, but when the company lost a lucrative operating license in India because of a serious water shortage there in 2004, things began to change.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/us/ENVIRO/ENVIRO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/24/us/ENVIRO/ENVIRO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/us/ENVIRO/ENVIRO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/us/ENVIRO/ENVIRO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1329, 'width': 1994, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/us/ENVIRO/ENVIRO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/24/us/ENVIRO/ENVIRO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth'