he robbers had made some calls before he was shot.\xa0', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Case of Innocence, With Missteps Seemingly at Every Turn', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Case of Innocence, With Missteps Seemingly at Every Turn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dwyer, Jim', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'False Arrests, Convictions and Imprisonments', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blyden, Malisha', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Latisha', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T02:44:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Dwyer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dwyer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f19b7166-31b8-5e81-9848-6ad4d6a77ed0', 'word_count': 805, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f19b7166-31b8-5e81-9848-6ad4d6a77ed0'}, {'abstract': 'After Mayor Bill de Blasio acknowledged that plowing lagged on Manhattan’s Upper East Side, he directed Commissioner John J. Doherty to review the management of the storm there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/nyregion/city-sanitation-chief-finds-that-when-it-snows-it-pours.html', 'snippet': 'After Mayor Bill de Blasio acknowledged that plowing lagged on Manhattan’s Upper East Side, he directed Commissioner John J. Doherty to review the management of the storm there.', 'lead_paragraph