 strength of the won currency and concerns that economic growth would slow.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/technology/samsungs-profit-drops-as-apple-squeezes-mobile-sales.html', 'snippet': 'The company cited a range of factors, including the recent strength of the won currency and concerns that economic growth would slow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — Samsung Electronics, the largest maker of smartphones, confirmed on Friday that growth in sales and earnings slowed sharply in the fourth quarter of 2013, and the company said business conditions would remain challenging in the first few months of the year.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Samsung’s Profit Drops as Apple Squeezes Mobile Sales', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Samsung’s Profit Drops as Apple Squeezes Mobile Sales', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pfanner, Eric', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Samsung Electronics Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T03:20:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Pfanner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pfanner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06ca4661-6347-5686-b1b0-f644740d3356', 'word_count': 312, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06ca4661-6347-5686-b1b0-f644740d3356'}, {'abstract': 'Some in both parties see a chance for compromises — perhaps on tax policy, education and even the minimum wage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/us/politics/address-may-hint-at