ntinued inside the schools, but outside doors were locked and people were not allowed to enter or leave. Officials with the Jefferson County sheriff’s office did not describe the threats, but said they did not appear to be “local or credible.” School officials said in a Facebook message to parents that all students were safe inside the school. The lockout was lifted about 2 p.m. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Colorado: Columbine High Takes Precautions After Threats', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Rockies', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Colorado: Columbine High Takes Precautions After Threats', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'School Shootings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lockouts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Columbine High School', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Columbine (Colo)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Denver (Colo)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Threats and Threatening Messages', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T03:56:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/157085b8-a606-5ded-b759-7fa2445af9db', 'word_count': 125, 'uri': 'nyt://article/157085b8-a606-5ded-b759-7fa2445af9db'}, {'abstract': 'Kevin Shattenkirk’s tiebreaking power-play goal at 3 minutes 9 seconds of the third period lifted the Blues past the Rangers at the Garden.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/sports/hockey/rangers-enter-outdoor-series-on-down-note.h