4-01-24T04:33:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Colin Moynihan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Colin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moynihan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a801718f-96bc-57ff-bf05-ba7d748e10d0', 'word_count': 515, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a801718f-96bc-57ff-bf05-ba7d748e10d0'}, {'abstract': 'The city’s unemployment rate fell to 8.1 percent in December, and the number of jobs passed four million for the first time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/nyregion/new-york-citys-jobless-rate-falls-to-8-1.html', 'snippet': 'The city’s unemployment rate fell to 8.1 percent in December, and the number of jobs passed four million for the first time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City’s unemployment rate fell to 8.1 percent in December, the lowest it has been in five years, the state Labor Department reported on Thursday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York City’s Jobless Rate Falls to 8.1%', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'City Jobless Rate Falls to 8.1%', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fitzsimmons, Emma G', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Labor Department (NYS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T04:35:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emma G. Fitzsimmons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emma', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'Fitzsimmons'