an senator. | Goldman Sachs considers a ban on chats.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/morning-agenda-jpmorgans-chief-gets-a-pay-raise/', 'snippet': 'Jamie Dimon, the chairman and chief executive of JPMorgan Chase, will get a pay raise. | Doctor in SAC trial says F.B.I. was after Steven A. Cohen, SAC’s founder. | The ongoing saga between Time Warner Cable and Charter Communications is heating u...', 'lead_paragraph': 'JPMORGAN’S DIMON TO GET RAISE \xa0|\xa0 Despite the legal troubles that JPMorgan Chases faced in 2013, which amounted to more than $20 billion in fines, Jamie Dimon, the bank’s chairman and chief executive, is getting a raise, Jessica Silver-Greenberg and Susanne Craig write in DealBook. The pay increase follows the board’s move last year to cut Mr. Dimon’s compensation in half, to $11.5 million as reprimand for allowing a multibillion-dollar trading mistake known as the London Whale.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'JPMorgan’s Chief Gets a Pay Raise', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T12:27:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/da257782-35bf-5a7d-92ec-6352106d7a60', 'word_count': 2506, 'uri': 'nyt://article/da257782-35bf-5a7d-92ec-6352106d7a60'}, {'abstract': 'Jana accused Juniper of having an “unfocused product line up, a lazy balance sheet and share price underperformance.” The pressure bolsters efforts started by Elliott Management a week ago.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/jana-partners-presses-juniper-networks-to-cut-costs-and-make-other-changes/', 'snippet': 'Jana accused Juniper of having an “unfocused product line up, a lazy balance sheet and share price underperformance.” The pressure bolsters efforts started by Elliott Management a week ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The activist hedge fund Jana Partners has set its sights on Juniper Networks, calling on the networking company to tighten its belt and give more money back to shareholders.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jana Partners Presses Juniper Networks to Cut Costs and  Make Other Changes', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shareholder Rights and Activism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jana Partners LLC', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Juniper Networks Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T12:31:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Stevenson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stevenson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d5cba6e4-9432-5d63-af69-ddf96ad0817f', 'word_count': 335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d5cba6e4-9432-5d63-af69-ddf96ad0817f'}, {'abstract': 'India enacted its most stringent law yet against the dehumanizing task known as manual scavenging, which is exclusively done by Dalits, but human rights activists say the law has no teeth.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/new-law-to-ban-manual-removal-of-human-waste-disappoints/', 'snippet': 'India enacted its most stringent law yet against the dehumanizing task known as manual scavenging, which is exclusively done by Dalits, but human rights activists say the law has no teeth.',