n Union Company spoke about the escalating battle to keep financial transaction systems secure.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/financial-companies-in-street-fight-with-cybercriminals/', 'snippet': 'In a panel discussion at the World Economic Forum on Friday, the top executives of MasterCard and the Western Union Company spoke about the escalating battle to keep financial transaction systems secure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAVOS, Switzerland – Financial companies are engaged in a escalating battle with increasingly sophisticated criminal organizations and some governments trying to hack into electronic payment systems, MasterCard’s top executive said Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/business/dealbook/dbpix-mastercard/dbpix-mastercard-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 491, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/24/business/dealbook/dbpix-mastercard/dbpix-mastercard-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 491}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/business/dealbook/dbpix-mastercard/dbpix-mastercard-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 838, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/business/dealbook/dbpix-mastercard/dbpix-mastercard-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1677, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/business/dealbook/dbpix-mastercard/dbpix-mastercard-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/24/busin