or/', 'snippet': 'John Ismay, a former Navy officer, meets with the actor Eric Bana, who plays the role of his friend in the movie “Lone Survivor.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'I dreaded the idea of seeing my old roommate’s death depicted on screen in the movie “Lone Survivor.” But when I saw a pair of Birkenstocks walking away from the camera on the big screen, I knew someone had taken the time to get the details right. Someone really cared about this story.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Seeing My Friend Depicted in ‘Lone Survivor’', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bana, Eric', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Luttrell, Marcus', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T14:31:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Ismay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ismay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1fafedee-3fae-5d06-9c10-64fc19407d71', 'word_count': 948, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1fafedee-3fae-5d06-9c10-64fc19407d71'}, {'abstract': 'Wolfgang Schäuble, the German finance minister, offered unusually generous praise for efforts being made in Greece, and also cited progress in Portugal and Ireland.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/germanys-finance-minister-praises-progress-made-in-crisis-countries/', 'snippet': 'Wolfgang Schäuble, the German finance minister, offered unusually generous praise for efforts being made in Greece, and also cited progress in Portugal and Ireland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAVOS, Switzerland — One of Germany’s top political leaders on Friday offered unusually generous praise for Greece’s efforts to deal with its economic crisis, and said that other European countries should help Greece deal with an influx of immigrants to prevent them from becoming fodder for right-wing parties.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/business/dbpix-schauble/dbpix-schauble-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 459, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/25/business/dbpix-schauble/dbpix-schauble-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 459}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/business/dbpix-schauble/dbpix-schauble-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 784, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/business/dbpix-schauble/dbpix-schauble-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1568, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/business/dbpix-schauble/dbpix-schauble-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/25/business/dbpix-schauble/dbpix-schauble-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images