N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T16:42:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Noah Millman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Noah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Millman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8342196-5960-5b3a-bb25-78d7dd087ef2', 'word_count': 1005, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8342196-5960-5b3a-bb25-78d7dd087ef2'}, {'abstract': 'Gabriel Sherman, whose unauthorized biography of Roger Ailes is No. 9 on the hardcover nonfiction list, tried hard to secure his subject’s participation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/02/02/books/review/inside-the-list.html', 'snippet': 'Gabriel Sherman, whose unauthorized biography of Roger Ailes is No. 9 on the hardcover nonfiction list, tried hard to secure his subject’s participation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Roger and Me: Gabriel Sherman’s unauthorized biography of Roger Ailes, “The Loudest Voice in the Room,” saunters onto the hardcover nonfiction list this week at No. 9. The book doesn’t arrive without controversy: Ailes, the founder and president of Fox News Channel, refused to cooperate with Sherman and went so far as to grant exclusive access to a rival journalist, the Rush Limbaugh biographer Zev Chafets, in evident hopes of pre-empting Sherman with a friendlier account. (Chafets’s book, “Roger Ailes: Off Camera,” was published in March 2013 and spent a week on the e-book nonfiction list.) On NPR’s “Fresh Air” last month, Sherman described his efforts to interview Ailes in terms that called to mind Michael Moore’s early documentary “Roger and Me,” about the General Motors chief executive Roger Smith. “I reached out to Roger Ailes more than a dozen times in the two and a half years I was doing the researching and writing, both in person and in writing,” he said. “I traveled to different states to see him at public events to tell him I was eager to sit down and discuss every fact in the book. Ultimately, it was his decision not to participate.” Ailes’s opposition, he continued, had provided “a crash course in what it must be like to be involved in a political campaign. . . . I’m not the story. Roger Ailes is the story. But he has elevated me to a place where it’s this kind of me-\xadversus-him dynamic.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/books/review/26sherman/26sherman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 259, 'width': 273, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/books/review/26sherman/26sherman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 259, 'width': 273, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/books/review/26sherman/26sherman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/26/books/review/26sherman/26sherman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/books/review/26sherman/26sherman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside the List', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inside the List', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T16:43:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Bo