itzer Prize-winning photographer, for digitally altering a picture, an ethical lapse with severe consequences.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/truth-and-consequences-for-a-war-photographer/', 'snippet': 'The Associated Press has severed its relationship with Narciso Contreras, a Pulitzer Prize-winning photographer, for digitally altering a picture, an ethical lapse with severe consequences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The ethical commandments on the digital manipulation of photographs in journalism are simple and direct: you do not add or subtract any element of an image in post processing. Ever. If a photo didn’t turn out exactly how you had imagined, there is no laptop digital do-over. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/blogs/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/24/blogs/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 808}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/blogs/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 761, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/blogs/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1521, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/24/blogs/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP/20140124-lens-narciso-slide-UPTP-thumbStandard.jpg', 