rticle/62a2824c-598b-5a6a-a649-e47b2ee14f77', 'word_count': 341, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62a2824c-598b-5a6a-a649-e47b2ee14f77'}, {'abstract': 'The event will be live streamed from Milan’s La Scala Opera House on Jan. 27.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/claudio-abbado-commemoration-at-la-scala-to-be-live-streamed/', 'snippet': 'The event will be live streamed from Milan’s La Scala Opera House on Jan. 27.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A public commemoration of the conductor Claudio Abbado, who died on Monday at 80, will be live-streamed from Milan’s La Scala Opera House on Jan. 27 to allow “the global audience of the web” to participate, the theater announced on Monday. Daniel Barenboim will conduct the “Funeral March” from Beethoven’s third Symphony at 6 P.M. in Milan, noon Eastern Standard Time, and the event will be streamed on the theater’s website and on Youtube.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Claudio Abbado Commemoration at La Scala to Be Live Streamed', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABBADO, CLAUDIO', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'La Scala Opera House (Milan, Italy)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T17:55:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dca84b64-8962-5bd4-b6c3-d575a313a691', 'word_count': 130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dca84b64-8962-5bd4-b6c3-d575a313a691'}, {'abstract': 'Scenes from the Paris Couture Week photo diary of Schohaja.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/the-scene-paris-couture-week-maison-martin-margiela-springsummer-2014/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the Paris Couture Week photo diary of Schohaja.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scenes from the Paris Couture Week photo diary of Schohaja.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris Couture Week: Maison Martin Margiela Spring/Summer 2014', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Couture (Fashion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Maison Martin Margiela', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T18:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Schohaja', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Schohaja', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62b7a0dc-a4b7-51c1-bdba-a22bef480938', 'word_count': 15, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62b7a0dc-a4b7-51c1-bdba-a22bef480938'}, {'abstract': 'Our 2003 minivan saw us through 10 years of family life. It was our concession — our submission — to life as parents. Recently we realized we didn’t need it anymore.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/requiem-for-a-minivan/', 'snippet': 'Our 2003 minivan saw us through 10 years of family life. It was our concession — our submission — to life as parents. Recently we realized we didn’t need it anymore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stella, my 8-year-old, was crying. Her little shoulders heaved with sobs. Her face, buried into my belly, left streaks of tears on my T-shirt. Her grief was acute. I helplessly rubbed her back, murmuring soothing sounds.', 'source':