k started out with no hats, no scarves and coats flapping open. By Friday, you could only see their eyes. One man wore fur trousers, top left. Another wrapped himself in a carpet, while the garment district tailor continued to stitch away. In Bryant Park, a man stood over the open fire pit. For some, a fedora was enough, and a black topcoat set off red kid gloves. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Topping Up', 'kicker': 'On the Street', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Winter (Season)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T21:46:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Cunningham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cunningham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7527ea24-4728-5abc-af17-81c6105f3996', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7527ea24-4728-5abc-af17-81c6105f3996'}, {'abstract': 'A deal for Texas Industries, a construction supplies company with a market value of more than $2 billion, could be announced early next week, people briefed on the matter said.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/martin-marietta-materials-in-merger-talks-with-texas-industries/', 'snippet': 'A deal for Texas Industries, a construction supplies company with a market value of more than $2 billion, could be announced early 