icle', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Cain Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': 'Cain', 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4fe77e0a-b2cd-5c0c-b3a5-f72cf0ac0792', 'word_count': 407, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4fe77e0a-b2cd-5c0c-b3a5-f72cf0ac0792'}, {'abstract': 'The complete text of a letter to President Obama from an American citizen who has been detained in Egypt since August.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/letter-to-obama-from-american-detained-in-egypt/', 'snippet': 'The complete text of a letter to President Obama from an American citizen who has been detained in Egypt since August.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mohamed Soltan, an American citizen whose Egyptian father belongs to the Muslim Brotherhood, was detained in Cairo in August, as our colleague David Kirkpatrick reported last year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Letter to Obama From American Detained in Egypt', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Prisoners', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Soltan, Mohamed', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T23:33:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e4fe382-7761-54ac-9c1d-51fc3334f5d8', 'word_count': 1000, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e4fe382-7761-54ac-9c1d-51fc3334f5d8'}, {'abstract': 'On contractors and our secrets, Syrian peace talks and the standoff in Ukraine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/26/opinion/sunday/distrust-in-america-war-in-syria-and-protests-in-ukraine.html', 'snippet': 'On contractors and our secrets, Syrian peace talks and the standoff in Ukraine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a speech on Jan. 17, President Obama spoke of the challenge of a world “that is remaking itself at a dizzying speed.” The subject of his address at the Justice Department was the complex issues of security, privacy and the limits of government power raised by revelations about the National Security Agency’s spying. That debate continued to rage through the last week. But Mr. Obama could have been speaking as well about conflicts in places like Syria and Ukraine, which seemed to become more intractable with every effort at resolution.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/sunday-review/26QUICK/26QUICK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/26/sunday-review/26QUICK/26QUICK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/sunday-review/26QUICK/26QUICK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/sunday-review/26QUICK/26QUICK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1388, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/sunday-review/26QUICK/26QUICK-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/26/sunday-review/26QUICK/26QUICK-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/sunday-review/26QUICK/26QUICK-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Distrust in America, War in Syria and Protests in Ukraine', 'kicker': 'Quick History', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Distrust in America, War in Syria and Protests in Ukraine', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yanukovych, Viktor F', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-24T23:34:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Serge Schmemann', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Serge', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmemann', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bebfdff-4c0f-5e0d-be88-a92fdcc06045', 'word_count': 1055, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bebfdff-4c0f-5e0d-be88-a92fdcc06045'}, {'abstract': 'A closed-circuit television camera captured video of the largest of four bombings in Cairo, killing four and injuring 70 outside the city’s police headquarters, and the bombers responsible for it.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/24/video-of-deadly-bombing-in-cairo/', 'snippet': 'A closed-circuit television camera captured video of the largest of four bombings in Cairo, killing four and injuring 70 outside the city’s police headquarters, and the bombers responsible for it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As my colleague David Kirkpatrick reported, at least six people were killed and 70 injured in a string of four bombings that targeted police installations across Cairo on Friday. A closed-circuit television camera captured video of the largest blast, a car bomb, which exploded outside the city’s main police headquarters, killing four and badly damaging a museum and library. The bombers responsible for the attack were also briefly captured on video.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video of Deadly Bombing in Cairo', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cairo (Egypt)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-25T00:16:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liam Stack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9166cfb2-78e3-5f81-bd1c-d1497289c330', 'word_count': 381, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9166cfb2-78e3-5f81-bd1c-d1497289c33