8528f9', 'word_count': 1134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/868fef1a-d43d-5359-b1fc-2bd30d8528f9'}, {'abstract': 'The Devils and the Islanders have never played outdoors, and they rarely draw national attention. That will change when they face off against the Rangers at the Stadium.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/25/sports/hockey/at-yankee-stadium-rangers-will-share-glamour-with-rivals.html', 'snippet': 'The Devils and the Islanders have never played outdoors, and they rarely draw national attention. That will change when they face off against the Rangers at the Stadium.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A giant New York City subway map adorns the outfield grass. A children’s hockey rink bounded by blocks of ice covers the home-plate area. Large crests of the Rangers and Devils rest atop the two dugouts. Stretching between first base and third is the rink itself, glinting bright under a cold winter sun. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/GAME1/GAME1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/GAME1/GAME1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/GAME1/GAME1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/GAME1/GAME1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/GAME1/GAME1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, '