14/01/25/sports/basketball/in-the-absence-of-their-owner-the-nets-hang-on.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Cuban, the Mavericks’ owner, was at Barclays Center. Mikhail D. Prokhorov, the Nets’ owner, wasn’t. It didn’t seem to matter as the Nets improved their January record to 9-1.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Early Friday night, Mark Cuban, the outspoken and seemingly omnipresent owner of the Dallas Mavericks, directed some thinly veiled criticisms toward Mikhail D. Prokhorov, his Nets counterpart, saying he could not imagine how anyone could manage a team from thousands of miles away.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 640}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/201