e N.H.L.’s two outdoor games at Yankee Stadium is that the Rangers have been designated the road team for both games, even though their opponents, the Devils and the Islanders, come from outside New York City.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rangers on Road in the Bronx? Money May Be Why', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rangers on Road in the Bronx? Money May Be Why', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Jeff Z', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Credits, Deductions and Exemptions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Madison Square Garden', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yankee Stadium (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-25T04:34:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/23b0c337-99c1-54d2-8cf5-99b685a15cf0', 'word_count': 558, 'uri': 'nyt://article/23b0c337-99c1-54d2-8cf5-99b685a15cf0'}, {'abstract': 'After 2001, many exhibitors at the P.G.A. Merchandise Show scaled back, but the event, seen as a barometer of golf’s health, has shown renewed energy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/25/sports/golf/golf-trade-show-bounces-back-with-the-economy.html', 'snippet': 'After 2001, many exhibitors at the P.G.A. Merchandise Show