ning camp, where he will compete for the fifth spot in the starting rotation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/25/sports/baseball/the-mets-sign-matsuzaka-to-a-minor-league-deal.html', 'snippet': 'The Mets will bring the Japanese right-hander Daisuke Matsuzaka to training camp, where he will compete for the fifth spot in the starting rotation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two days after the Yankees snared Masahiro Tanaka with a seven-year, $155 million contract, the Mets announced Friday that they, too, had signed a Japanese right-hander, but for a lot less money.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-BASEBALL/CITY-BASEBALL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-BASEBALL/CITY-BASEBALL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 500}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-BASEBALL/CITY-BASEBALL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 853, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-BASEBALL/CITY-BASEBALL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1456, 'width': 1747, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-BASEBALL/CITY-BASEBALL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/25/sports/CITY-BASEBALL/CITY-BASEBALL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cre