yt://article/a9973d6d-fd8a-5ebf-aed3-2488787ed896'}, {'abstract': 'At least 49 people died in clashes with security forces at rival antigovernment protests organized by Islamists and left-leaning activists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/26/world/middleeast/egypt.html', 'snippet': 'At least 49 people died in clashes with security forces at rival antigovernment protests organized by Islamists and left-leaning activists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Thousands of Egyptians celebrated the third anniversary of their revolt against autocracy on Saturday by holding a rally for the military leader who ousted the country’s first democratically elected president. Elsewhere, at least 49 people died in clashes with security forces at rival antigovernment protests organized by Islamists and left-leaning activists.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clashes Kill 49 Egyptians on Uprising’s Anniversary', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clashes Kill 29 Egyptians on Uprising’s Anniversary', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirkpatrick, David D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mubarak, Hosni', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sisi, Abdul-Fattah el-', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Muslim Brotherhood (Egypt)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-25T08:56:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 's