38f-5fa98f3c800d'}, {'abstract': 'A statement from security officials in the Xinjiang region accused Ilham Tohti, an economics professor who advocates on behalf of Uighurs, of separatism and inciting ethnic hatred.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/26/world/asia/china.html', 'snippet': 'A statement from security officials in the Xinjiang region accused Ilham Tohti, an economics professor who advocates on behalf of Uighurs, of separatism and inciting ethnic hatred.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — In an ominous sign of the fate awaiting one of China’s best-known Uighur intellectuals, security officials in the far western region of Xinjiang issued a statement on Saturday that accused him of separatism and inciting ethnic hatred. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/world/china1/china1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/26/world/china1/china1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/world/china1/china1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/world/china1/china1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1437, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/world/china1/china1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/26/world/china1/china1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnai