 But let’s not do it again. One of our mantras is ‘Find it, fix it, prevent it.’”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/26/business/noreen-beaman-of-brinker-capital-on-accountability.html', 'snippet': '“Sometimes you’ll make a mistake,” a chief executive says. “Life happens. But let’s not do it again. One of our mantras is ‘Find it, fix it, prevent it.’”', 'lead_paragraph': 'This interview with  Noreen D. Beaman, chief executive of Brinker Capital, based in Berwyn, Pa., was conducted and condensed by  Adam Bryant. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/business/26-CORNER/26-CORNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 916, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/26/business/26-CORNER/26-CORNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 916}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/business/26-CORNER/26-CORNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 671, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/business/26-CORNER/26-CORNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1342, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/business/26-CORNER/26-CORNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/26/business/26-CORNER/26-CORNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/business/26-CORNER/26-CORN