1163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/999f8e42-8272-559f-9faa-033f75899286'}, {'abstract': 'President François Hollande announced Saturday that he and Valérie Trierweiler, who had served as France’s de facto first lady, had separated.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/26/world/europe/frances-president-announces-split-with-his-companion.html', 'snippet': 'President François Hollande announced Saturday that he and Valérie Trierweiler, who had served as France’s de facto first lady, had separated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — President François Hollande announced Saturday that he and his companion, Valérie Trierweiler, had formally ended their relationship, bringing to a close a two-week-long melodrama that began with a glossy magazine’s report of an affair with an actress and Ms. Trierweiler’s emotional collapse over the disclosure. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/world/france1/france1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 430, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/26/world/france1/france1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 430}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/world/france1/france1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 733, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/world/france1/france1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1467, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/26/world/france1/france1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard