r an immediate election to choose a president.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nepal Lawmakers Move Closer to Choosing a Prime Minister', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nepal Lawmakers Move Closer To Choosing a Prime Minister', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nepal', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yadav, Ram Baran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Unified Communist Party of Nepal (Maoist)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nepali Congress Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-26T01:54:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gardiner Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gardiner', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/992fb653-89c8-565d-bb88-16050a8123bd', 'word_count': 399, 'uri': 'nyt://article/992fb653-89c8-565d-bb88-16050a8123bd'}, {'abstract': 'The army dismissed charges against five soldiers in a case from 2000 in which soldiers were accused of rounding up five Kashmiri men, then shooting and burning them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/26/world/asia/india-dismisses-charges-against-soldiers-in-killings.html', 'snippet': 'The army dismissed charges against five soldiers in a case from 2000 in which soldiers were accused of rounding up five Kashmiri men, then shooting and burning them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — The Indian Army last week dismissed charges against five soldiers in a long-running, infamous case in which soldiers were accused of rounding up five Kashmiri men, dressing them in fatigues, then shooting and burning them. The soldiers said the men were Pakistani militants, but locals have insisted for years that they were innocent civilians — a claim lent support by an Indian government investigation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'India Dismisses Charges Against Soldiers in Killings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'India Dismisses Charges Against Soldiers in Killings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir and Jammu (India)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-26T02:11:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gardiner Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gardiner', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0efd9ef1-f7e9-5146-99bd-b8f971100ac3', 'word_count': 617, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0efd9ef1-f7e9-5146-99bd-b8f971100ac3'}, {'abstract': 'It may seem that high-level scandal is breaking out all over, but analysts offer statistics that say otherwise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/26/us/politics/it-only-seems-that-political-corruption-is-rampant.html', 'snippet': 'It may seem that high-level scandal is breaking out all over, but analysts offer statistics that say otherwise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the indictment last week of the former Virginia