 more than 50,000, the Rangers chased Martin Brodeur and beat the Devils soundly in the first hockey game played at Yankee Stadium.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Maybe it was the midwinter cold. Or maybe it was the chipped ice, or even the jovial atmosphere among the fans. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/27Hockey/27Hockey-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/27Hockey/27Hockey-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/27Hockey/27Hockey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/27Hockey/27Hockey-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/27Hockey/27Hockey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/27Hockey/27Hockey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/27Hockey/27Hockey-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Cold at Yankee Stadium, the Rangers Are in Their Element', 'kicker': 'Rangers 7, Devils 3', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In the Cold at Yankee Stadium, The Rangers Are in Their Element', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Jersey Devils', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Jeff Z', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brodeur, Martin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lundqvist, Henrik', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elias, Patrik', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nash, Rick', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yankee Stadium (NYC)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-26T23:09:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2e30b8c-9cc5-526e-a2f8-7e128218b1ca', 'word_count': 930, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2e30b8c-9cc5-526e-a2f8-7e128218b1ca'}, {'abstract': 'Sarah Hay, an American member of the Semperoper Ballet in Dresden, Germany, has won the lead role in the upcoming Starz series, “Flesh and Bone.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/26/dresden-ballet-dancer-wins-lead-role-in-new-starz-series/', 'snippet': 'Sarah Hay, an American member of the Semperoper Ballet in Dresden, Germany, has won the lead role in the upcoming Starz series, “Flesh and Bone.”', 'lead_paragraph': '“Flesh and Bone,” a new drama series produced by Starz, starts shooting this spring and has the ballet world buzzing, especially since the cancellations of ABC Family’s “Bunheads” and, more recently, “Breaking Pointe,” the CW reality show about Ballet West. After an extensive search, the creator and writer Moira Walley-Beckett and the executive producers Lawrence Bender, Kevin Brown and John Melfi have found the show’s lead. Sarah Hay, an American member of the Semperoper Ballet in Dresden, Germany, won the part of Claire, a talented, emotionally troubled dancer from Pittsburgh who ends up in a New York City ballet company. At an open audition last fall, Ms. Walley-Beckett described the character as coming from “an abusive family life.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dresden Ballet Dancer Wins Lead Role in New Starz Series', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ballerina in Germany Wins Lead in Starz Series', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN BALLET THEATER', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Starz', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-26T23:30:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gia Kourlas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kourlas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8411fdd6-b259-5fe3-9642-5346f91272fe', 'word_count': 339, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8411fdd6-b259-5fe3-9642-5346f91272fe'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Klein’s departure from The Washington Post to Vox Media is just one more example of how digital publishing offers its own thing, not an additional platform for established news companies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/27/business/media/ezra-klein-joining-vox-media-as-web-journalism-asserts-itself.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Klein’s departure from The Washington Post to Vox Media is just one more example of how digital publishing offers its own thing, not an additional platform for established news companies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a week of speculation, it turns out that Ezra Klein, the prolific creator of The Washington Post’s Wonkblog, will be going to Vox Media, the online home of SB Nation, a sports site, and The Verge, a fast-growing technology site. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/newdavidcarrpic/newdavidcarrpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 285, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/newdavidcarrpic/newdavidcarrpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 285, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/newdavidcarrpic/newdavidcarrpic-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/27/business/newdavidcarrpic/newdavidcarrpic-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/newdavidcarrpic/newdavidcarrpic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ezra Klein Is Joining Vox Media as Web Journalism Asserts Itself', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Big Hire Signals Web News Is Thriving', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyword