5b33'}, {'abstract': 'Yankee Stadium’s first N.H.L. game got off to a late start, but even the losing team had good things to say about the event.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/27/sports/hockey/first-came-the-sun-and-then-came-the-snow.html', 'snippet': 'Yankee Stadium’s first N.H.L. game got off to a late start, but even the losing team had good things to say about the event.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yankee Stadium, and its predecessor across the street, have combined to host 40 World Series and thousands of other events throughout the decades, dealing often with challenges like capacity crowds and weather-related delays.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/FPOblueshirts1/FPOblueshirts1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/FPOblueshirts1/FPOblueshirts1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/FPOblueshirts1/FPOblueshirts1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/FPOblueshirts1/FPOblueshirts1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/FPOblueshirts1/FPOblueshirts1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/27/sports/FPOblueshirts1/FPOblueshirts1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 7