 607, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bfece16c-5e02-59d2-9a78-ef1269450433'}, {'abstract': 'Images on television and the availability of electronic cigarettes are among the temptations that attract new smokers and weaken the willpower of those who want to quit.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/27/helping-smokers-quit-or-not-start-in-the-first-place/', 'snippet': 'Images on television and the availability of electronic cigarettes are among the temptations that attract new smokers and weaken the willpower of those who want to quit.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Even 50 years after the first surgeon general’s report on smoking and health, we’re still finding out new ways that tobacco kills and maims people,” Dr. Thomas Frieden, director of the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, recently told me. “It’s astonishing how bad it is.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Helping Smokers Quit, or Not Start in the First Place', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fighting Smoking, 50 Years Later', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-27T05:01:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane E. Brody', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Brody', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/357ba28a-666a-5fbf-93f7-41c2cedc48e9', 'word_count': 1078, 'uri': 'nyt://article/357ba28a-666a-5fbf-93f7-41c2cedc48e9'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in 54 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/27/word-of-the-day-con