gets into artificial intelligence for $400 million.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/27/morning-agenda-anger-over-venture-capitalists-letter/', 'snippet': 'A venture capitalist’s letter in The Wall Street Journal spurs outrage and confusion. | The Justice Department takes aim at banks’ business with payday lenders. | Dimon’s pay increase gets mixed reactions. | Liberty Global to buy Ziggo. | Google g...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The San Francisco techno-elite and local activists have not been on good terms in recent weeks, but it may be wise to tread carefully when writing about the latest tensions. In a letter published in The Wall Street Journal on Saturday, Tom Perkins, a founder of the venture capital firm Kleiner Perkins Caufield & Byers, wondered if “progressive radicalism” indicated the possibility of a new Kristallnacht.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-perkins/dbpix-perkins-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-perkins/dbpix-perkins-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-perkins/dbpix-perkins-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-perkins/dbpix-perkins-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1399, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-perkins/dbpix-perkins-thumbStanda