rn paper dollars into grilled steaks when both trust the United States government. That makes Bitcoin the latest sign that its tech elite believers want something beyond the old nation state. Other math-based borderless currencies, and likely more to come, signify their own values.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/27/bitcoin-and-the-fictions-of-money/', 'snippet': 'Beyond the basics, all money is make-believe. We turn paper dollars into grilled steaks when both trust the United States government. That makes Bitcoin the latest sign that its tech elite believers want something beyond the old nation state. Othe...', 'lead_paragraph': 'How should we think about a currency like Bitcoin? The first thing to remember is this: Money is a sort of collective fiction. What money we choose to trust says much about how we see the world.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/technology/25bits-bitcoin/25bits-bitcoin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/25/technology/25bits-bitcoin/25bits-bitcoin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 425}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/technology/25bits-bitcoin/25bits-bitcoin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/technology/25bits-bitcoin/25bits-bitcoin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1451, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/25/technology/25bits-bitcoin/25bits-bitcoin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, '