d3-554f-8981-c296230b987e'}, {'abstract': 'As this year’s recruiting season begins, some college students say they are drawn to the challenge and fast-paced environment. Still others are, naturally, motivated by the high salaries that Wall Street offers.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/27/in-recruiting-game-wall-street-still-competes/', 'snippet': 'As this year’s recruiting season begins, some college students say they are drawn to the challenge and fast-paced environment. Still others are, naturally, motivated by the high salaries that Wall Street offers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite the refrain that the financial crisis has discouraged students from pursuing jobs in finance, the number of elite students who continue to seek lucrative positions at financial firms indicates that Wall Street has not yet lost its luster.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-recruit/dbpix-recruit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-recruit/dbpix-recruit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-recruit/dbpix-recruit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-recruit/dbpix-recruit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1344, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/27/business/dealbook/dbpix-recruit/dbpix-recruit-thumbStandard.j