rket day, the police and witnesses said on Monday. The attack was one of the deadliest yet to be attributed to the militant Islamist group Boko Haram.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Gunmen Kill 45 in Nigeria, Suspicion Falls on Militants', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Gunmen Kill 45 in Nigeria, Suspicion Falls on Militants', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nigeria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boko Haram', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-27T23:41:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Nossiter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nossiter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5408725f-441d-5a2f-a6ee-967903bab68b', 'word_count': 412, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5408725f-441d-5a2f-a6ee-967903bab68b'}, {'abstract': 'Our deputy editor shares her favorite moments from Paris Couture Week.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/27/the-collections-the-top-10-moments-in-spring-2014-paris-couture-week/', 'snippet': 'Our deputy editor shares her favorite moments from Paris Couture Week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, on the heels of Paris Men’s Fashion Week, the City of Light set the scene for the spring 2014 women’s couture shows. From the fashion to the\xa0haute joaillerie to off-the-runway hilarity, these are some of the season’s most memorable moments.', 'source