blockade.html', 'snippet': 'Little progress was seen in the third day of talks on authorizing an international convoy to enter blockaded areas in the city of Homs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — The Syrian government on Monday failed to authorize an international aid convoy to enter blockaded areas in the city of Homs, as the opposition’s Western backers declared that if the delivery was not allowed by next week they would be likely to challenge the government in the United Nations Security Council. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Syria Talks Fail to Yield Pact to Lift Aid Blockade', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Syria Talks Fail to Yield Pact to Lift Aid Blockade', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Homs (Syria)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evacuations and Evacuees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Aid', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brahimi, Lakhdar', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Geneva (Switzerland)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-28T02:15:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Barnard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organizat