in Medicaid money in a way that could help troubled hospitals in Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/28/nyregion/mayor-and-governor-teaming-up-to-save-brooklyn-hospitals.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio and Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo have asked the Obama administration to allow the state to use $10 billion in Medicaid money in a way that could help troubled hospitals in Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio and Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo, at odds over how to pay for prekindergarten, showed a unified front on Monday on helping distressed Brooklyn hospitals and said that without immediate federal support, “there will be closures.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'De Blasio and Cuomo Team Up to Save Brooklyn Hospitals', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'De Blasio and Cuomo Are Teaming Up to Save Hospitals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicaid', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sebelius, Kathleen', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-28T03:48:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anemona Hartocollis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anemona', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hartocollis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/82a43090-a160-536c-a2ea-0da0526c03df', 'word_count': 505, 'uri': 'nyt://article/82a43090-a160-536c-a2ea-0da0526c03df'}, {'abstract': 'If he is com