al judge refused to set aside the 2012 convictions of two former political figures on grounds that a prosecution witness had bribed a municipal employee while he was assisting the authorities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/28/nyregion/motions-denied-in-yonkers-corruption-case.html', 'snippet': 'A federal judge refused to set aside the 2012 convictions of two former political figures on grounds that a prosecution witness had bribed a municipal employee while he was assisting the authorities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal judge on Monday denied motions by two former Yonkers political figures to set aside their convictions in a 2012 corruption trial on grounds that a prosecution witness had not disclosed that he paid a $5,000 bribe to a municipal employee while he was assisting the authorities.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Motions Denied in Yonkers Corruption Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Motions Denied in Yonkers Corruption Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Annabi, Sandy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jereis, Zehy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yonkers (NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-28T03:55:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3