orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ac0f847-1fe5-5365-a634-47d597e562d7', 'word_count': 1165, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ac0f847-1fe5-5365-a634-47d597e562d7'}, {'abstract': 'A rush of new entrants to new media involves people. The latest, called Inside, is a news aggregator that aims to ignore news aggregators and point people to original content (if they want more after reading a 40-word digest.) Other new business, even possibly one at Facebook, are also using humans over machines.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/28/jason-calacanis-shoots-for-human-moments-in-news-feeds/', 'snippet': 'A rush of new entrants to new media involves people. The latest, called Inside, is a news aggregator that aims to ignore news aggregators and point people to original content (if they want more after reading a 40-word digest.) Other new business, ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'This must be the fastest-moving month in the history of new media. The latest entrant features yet one more familiar face.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-inside1/28bits-inside1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 1065, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-inside1/28bits-inside1-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1065}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-inside1/28bits-inside1-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 577, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-inside1/28bits-inside1-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1136, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo',