e-53fa-a804-83e2d01de9a5'}, {'abstract': 'In his short-story collection “The Corpse Exhibition,” Hassan Blasim describes the casual fatalism of life in an Iraq torn by war and terrorism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/29/books/the-corpse-exhibition-stories-about-a-war-torn-life.html', 'snippet': 'In his short-story collection “The Corpse Exhibition,” Hassan Blasim describes the casual fatalism of life in an Iraq torn by war and terrorism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The literature of American warfare tends to land in overlapping waves, like an invasion. First come the novels by the war correspondents. Then, in time, fiction begins to arrive from the returning combatants. Only later, like cries of the wounded after a barrage subsides, can the other side finally make itself heard. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/book/book-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/book/book-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 654}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/book/book-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 939, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/book/book-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1117, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', '