e': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Any Question Thrown at Him, Richard Sherman Has It Covered', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sherman Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seattle Seahawks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Denver Broncos', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sherman, Richard (1988- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-29T02:12:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/b78f0586-45d0-583d-a6b9-c4db5b95ab99', 'word_count': 1674, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b78f0586-45d0-583d-a6b9-c4db5b95ab99'}, {'abstract': 'Comcast, the nation’s largest cable provider and the owner of NBCUniversal, increased its net income 26 percent, to $1.9 billion, compared with a year ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/29/business/media/comcast-profits-up-sharply-along-with-tv-subscribers.html', 'snippet': 'Comcast, the nation’s largest cable provider and the owner of NBCUniversal, increased its net income 26 percent, to $1.9 billion, compared with a year ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Comcast, the nation’s largest cable provider and the owner of NBCUniversal, on Tuesday reported a sharp increase in profit for the fourth quarter of 2013, helped by an increase in television subscribers after six years of decline.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Comcast Profits Up Sharply, Along With TV Subscribers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Comcast Profits Up Sharply, Along With TV Subscribers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cable Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Comcast Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-29T02:14:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fecf90c6-7138-5f97-a5a5-34b4cb9f4181', 'word_count': 443, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fecf90c6-7138-5f97-a5a5-34b4cb9f4181'}, {'abstract': 'The secretary of state is daring to test a question about the Israelis and Palestinians that everyone has wanted to avoid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/29/opinion/friedman-why-kerry-is-scary.html', 'snippet': 'The secretary of state is daring to test a question about the Israelis and Palestinians that everyone has wanted to avoid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TEL AVIV — It is pretty clear now that Secretary of State John Kerry will either be Israel’s diplomatic salvation or the most dangerous diplomatic fanatic Israel has ever encountered. But there isn’t much room anymore for anything in between. This is one of those rare pay-per-view foreign policy moments. Pull up a chair. You don’t see this every day.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/09/16/opinion/Friedman_New/Friedman_New-j