76-3b4723b7d74c', 'word_count': 835, 'uri': 'nyt://article/96fe609c-87d8-5102-9e76-3b4723b7d74c'}, {'abstract': 'Dell said it would offer networking equipment that was built with nonspecialized semiconductors and an open-source operating system, as opposed to the highly proprietary gear.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/29/technology/open-source-system-to-be-offered-by-dell.html', 'snippet': 'Dell said it would offer networking equipment that was built with nonspecialized semiconductors and an open-source operating system, as opposed to the highly proprietary gear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dell said it would offer networking equipment that was built with nonspecialized semiconductors and an open-source operating system, as opposed to the highly proprietary gear and software from like Cisco Systems and Hewlett-Packard. While that is unlikely to be a huge business soon for Dell, it lends credibility and muscle to what has been a growing effort to dislodge these incumbents through cheaper, easier-to-build equipment. If Dell and others can do that, a result would be lower costs at the large data centers run by Google, Facebook and large banks and companies. Cheaper networking could also make the Internet even more ubiquitous. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Open-Source System to Be Offered by Dell', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Open-Source System To Be Offered By Dell', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Open-Source Software', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dell Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-29T02:44:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Quentin Hardy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Quentin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hardy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa1be0ce-523e-58da-aa89-cbd54a1f232a', 'word_count': 102, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa1be0ce-523e-58da-aa89-cbd54a1f232a'}, {'abstract': 'DeVry University, a for-profit institution, has landed 15 students on the United States team heading to the Sochi Games.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/29/sports/olympics/devry-becomes-an-unlikely-olympic-powerhouse.html', 'snippet': 'DeVry University, a for-profit institution, has landed 15 students on the United States team heading to the Sochi Games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They have no mascot or motto, no home rink, oval or stadium. They have no hockey team, curling squad or figure skaters. They have no coaches, no athletic director, and their basketball team once lost by 117 points. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/sports/SUB-Y-DEVRY-JUMP-2/SUB-Y-DEVRY-JUMP-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/29/sports/SUB-Y-DEVRY-JUMP-2/SUB-Y-DEVRY-JUMP-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/sports/SUB-Y-DEVRY-JUMP-2/SUB-Y-DEVRY-JUMP-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/sports/SUB-Y-DEVRY-JUMP-2/SUB-Y-DEVRY-JUMP-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1441, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':