accessories will make Google Glass attractive to a wider variety of people. But accessories draw attention to gadgets, and many Glass owners want the device to stand out less, not more.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/29/can-accessories-make-google-glass-more-stylish/', 'snippet': 'Google hopes third-party accessories will make Google Glass attractive to a wider variety of people. But accessories draw attention to gadgets, and many Glass owners want the device to stand out less, not more.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Even self-described tech geeks want to make Google Glass look a little less geeky before they wear it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-glassaccessory1/28bits-glassaccessory1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-glassaccessory1/28bits-glassaccessory1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-glassaccessory1/28bits-glassaccessory1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-glassaccessory1/28bits-glassaccessory1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-glassaccessory1/28bits-glassaccessory1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-glassaccessory1/28bits-glassaccessory1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/technology/28bits-glassaccessory1/28bits-glassaccessory1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Can Accessories Make Google Glass More Stylish?', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-29T13:02:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Cain Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': 'Cain', 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac9dc3d9-71af-5684-a17e-5e4baaaa694e', 'word_count': 366, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac9dc3d9-71af-5684-a17e-5e4baaaa694e'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama promises to address economic inequality. | Hedge funds are betting banks will pay more for their role in shoddy mortgage practices. | Alibaba’s decisions face scrutiny as it prepares for I.P.O. | J.C. Penney lowers its poison pill threshold, but its reason for doing so is unclear.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/29/morning-agenda-state-of-the-union-spotlights-economic-inequality/', 'snippet': 'President Obama promises to address economic inequality. | Hedge funds are betting banks will pay more for their role in shoddy mortgage practices. | Alibaba’s decisions face scrutiny as it prepares for I.P.O. | J.C. Penney lowers its poison pill ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his State of the Union address before Congress on Tuesday night, President Obama promised to do something about economic disparity in a “year of action,” vowing to act alone if necessary. While Mr. Obama covered a broad swath of issues, his message centered on income inequality. “Those at the top have never done better,” he said. “But average wages have barely budged. Inequality has deepened. Upward mobility has stalled.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'State of the Union Highlights Economic Inequality', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-29T13:05:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef8e4cc6-ffd0-5a9c-bd78-af722e67e497', 'word_count': 2425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef8e4cc6-ffd0-5a9c-bd78-af722e67e497'}, {'abstract': 'Barclays is preparing to eliminate up to 400 jobs in its investment bank as part of its restructuring effort, according to a person familiar with the matter. The bank is trying to reduce its annual costs by 1.7 billion pounds by 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/29/barclays-to-cut-up-to-400-jobs-in-investment-bank-to-trim-costs/', 'snippet': 'Barclays is preparing to eliminate up to 400 jobs in its investment bank as part of its restructuring effort, according to a person familiar with the matter. The bank is trying to reduce its annual costs by 1.7 billion pounds by 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON – The British bank Barclays is preparing to eliminate as many as 400 jobs in its investment bank as part of an effort to trim costs, according to a person familiar with the matter.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/busin