eak with her.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/health/28well-bullycoach/28well-bullycoach-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/28/health/28well-bullycoach/28well-bullycoach-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/health/28well-bullycoach/28well-bullycoach-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/health/28well-bullycoach/28well-bullycoach-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1446, 'width': 1932, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/health/28well-bullycoach/28well-bullycoach-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/28/health/28well-bullycoach/28well-bullycoach-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/28/health/28well-bullycoach/28well-bullycoach-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'My Coach, the Bully', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AMATEUR ATHLETICS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Athletics and Sports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bullies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-29T15:46:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jan Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d59bccaf-177a-5c21-99e0-9f62d969d5d8', 'word_count': 955, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d59bccaf-177a-5c21-99e0-9f62d969d5d8'}, {'abstract': 'In our latest installment of this exclusive series of interviews by Doug Aitken, the artist interviews the genre-hopping musician Beck.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/29/the-source-beck-in-conversation-with-doug-aitken/', 'snippet': 'In our latest installment of this exclusive series of interviews by Doug Aitken, the artist interviews the genre-hopping musician Beck.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s such a dispersal, making a song,” Beck says. “Hoping something works, or connects, somewhere, with somebody.” In conversation with Doug Aitken, the genre-hopping 43-year-old musician and producer likens songwriting to sculpture, calling it “just shaped chaos.” The interview is part of the Source, a series of candid video conversations with several dozen noteworthy figures about their creative processes, currently on view in a custom pavilion at the Sundance Film Festival.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Source | Beck in Conversation With Doug Aitken', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sundance Film Festival (Park City, Utah)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aitken, Doug', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beck', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-29T15:53:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fbe6df58-7efd-5c0b-a957-7e2885271fc7', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fbe6df58-7efd-5c0b-a957-7e2885271fc7'}, {'abstract': 'Hours after the attorney general confirmed that the government was investigating the data breach, Target said that the hackers used a vendor’s credentials in the attack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/30/business/justice-dept-vows-to-find-hackers-of-target.html', 'snippet': 'Hours after the attorney general confirmed that the government was investigating the data breach, Target said that the hackers used a vendor’s credentials in the attack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Attorney General Eric H. Holder Jr. said Wednesday that the Justice Department was committed to finding the hackers behind the holiday season theft of credit card data from millions of Target customers.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Justice Dept. Vows to Find Hackers of Target', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Target Says Hackers Used a Vendor’s Credentials', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberattacks and Hackers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Identity Theft', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Target Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holder, Eric H Jr', 'rank