id': 'nyt://article/7aefcf5e-c414-538e-ab7e-3a1bc62d664e', 'word_count': 670, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7aefcf5e-c414-538e-ab7e-3a1bc62d664e'}, {'abstract': 'During a three-year term as president of the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences, Mr. Sherak sought younger and more diverse members and began a drive to build a museum of world film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/30/business/media/thomas-m-sherak-dies-at-68-film-executive-and-advocate.html', 'snippet': 'During a three-year term as president of the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences, Mr. Sherak sought younger and more diverse members and began a drive to build a museum of world film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thomas M. Sherak, a film studio executive who as president of the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences helped expand its mission beyond the annual awarding of Oscar statuettes, died on Tuesday at his home in Calabasas, Calif. He was 68.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/business/sherakobit/sherakobit-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/30/business/sherakobit/sherakobit-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 366}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/business/sherakobit/sherakobit-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 625, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/business/sherakobit/sherakobit-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1249, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u