p the Hudson River — the group’s symbol is a sloop that Seeger built called the Clearwater — and has continued as a monthly part-advocacy, part-fellowship gathering to which people bring food, talk and make music. At the meetings, Seeger would call out, “Now everyone get in a circle, make it big for everyone.” Chairs would scoot around. “No, it’s not big enough. It has to include everybody.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pete Seeger, Jamming at the Beacon Sloop Club', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Folk Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seeger, Pete', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hudson River Sloop Clearwater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hudson River', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-29T18:44:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Staff', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Staff'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/26aa908b-4e15-56ce-a355-d5c052fd738f', 'word_count': 227, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26aa908b-4e15-56ce-a355-d5c052fd738f'}, {'abstract': 'Today you only have to look as far as your pocket to find new work because there are many apps for mobile devices that can help.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/technology/personaltech/100000002675807/app-smart-job-hunting.html', 'snippet': 'Today you only have to look as far as your pocket to find new work because there are many apps for mobile devices that can help.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today you only have to look as far as your pocket to find new work because there are many apps for mobile devices that can help.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype'