/music/loud-strong-committed-and-always-in-search-of-america.html', 'snippet': 'Musicians and others who were inspired by Pete Seeger recalled their experiences with the folk singer and activist, who died on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pete Seeger, who died at 94 on Monday, inspired generations of musicians to think about music in a particular way – or, it turns out, many particular ways, depending on the musician. Some were inspired to consider the nature of the instruments they played, and for banjo players in particular, Mr. Seeger was a role model and a master teacher. For most, though, he was the consummate political singer, a campaigner for free speech and the right to protest, whether the cause was personal rights or the state of the environment. Since Mr. Seeger’s death, several musicians and others who were inspired by him spoke about their experiences with Mr. Seeger.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/arts/seeger-springsteen/seeger-springsteen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 424, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/30/arts/seeger-springsteen/seeger-springsteen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 424}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/arts/seeger-springsteen/seeger-springsteen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/arts/seeger-springsteen/seeger-springsteen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1448, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/arts/seeger-springsteen/seeger-