a349d688b1', 'word_count': 1748, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec8be25d-9205-574f-91a0-02a349d688b1'}, {'abstract': 'The Seahawks’ Richard Sherman has received the most attention during Super Bowl week, but Wilson, Seattle’s 5-foot-11 quarterback, has a story that’s just as compelling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/30/sports/football/russell-wilson-is-a-standout-whos-easy-to-miss.html', 'snippet': 'The Seahawks’ Richard Sherman has received the most attention during Super Bowl week, but Wilson, Seattle’s 5-foot-11 quarterback, has a story that’s just as compelling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was no surprise that Super Bowl week launched with a frantic rush to surround Richard Sherman but with plenty of good space available in the presence of Russell Wilson. That injustice of unbalanced attention revealed far more about the malleability of the news media — especially during the long, news-starved run-up to the game — than it did about either player.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/sports/CITY-JP-ARATON/CITY-JP-ARATON-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/30/sports/CITY-JP-ARATON/CITY-JP-ARATON-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/sports/CITY-JP-ARATON/CITY-JP-ARATON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/sports/CITY-JP-ARATON/CITY-JP-ARATON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1534, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'captio