nor at a cocktail party at Eclectic, a new restaurant in the 15th Arrondissement here. Mr. Dixon had designed the space, with his usual flair for muscular materials (in this case, concrete warmed by splashes of gleaming metal). He was being feted by Maison et Objet, a trade fair held every January and September, which had anointed him, along with Philippe Nigro of Paris and Dimore Studio of Milan, a “designer of the year.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Global Design Du Jour', 'kicker': 'The Details', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Global Design Du Jour', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maison Et Objet (Trade Show)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-30T02:58:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Lasky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lasky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b528b80-948f-5aee-b76d-799a03dc8a37', 'word_count': 1286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b528b80-948f-5aee-b76d-799a03dc8a37'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on January 30, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/30/pageoneplus/corrections-january-30-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on January 30, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRONT PAGE', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: January 30, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-01-30T03:00:03+0000', 'document_type':