ion later, she has had some success.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — I worked nights from a leather chair in my living room, armed with an iPad, a telephone and a notebook. My mission was to see if I could reconnect Jewish families and others with fine art pillaged from their relatives during World War II.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Loot No Longer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Loot No Longer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Arts and Antiquities Looting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holocaust and the Nazi Era', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-30T13:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Doreen Carvajal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Doreen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carvajal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e32f5e00-d6b6-5d46-8fa1-b8eb7b7d9fee', 'word_count': 1865, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e32f5e00-d6b6-5d46-8fa1-b8eb7b7d9fee'}, {'abstract': 'The Blackstone Group’s results handily beat Wall Street forecasts as it reaped big gains on its investments in private equity and real estate.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/30/blackstone-earnings-double-in-fourth-quarter/', 'snippet': 'The Blackstone Group’s results handily beat Wall Street forecasts as it reaped big gains on its investments in private equity and real estate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 3:00 p.m. | The soaring stock market was a boon last year to private equity firms looking to sell their holdings to investors. For the Blackstone Group in particular, a series of well-timed sales helped the firm double its profit in the fourth quarter.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/dbpix-blackstone2/dbpix-blackstone2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/31/business/dbpix-blackstone2/dbpix-blackstone2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/dbpix-blackstone2/dbpix-blackstone2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 754, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/dbpix-blackstone2/dbpix-blackstone2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1508, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/dbpix-blackstone2/dbpix-blackstone2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/31/business/dbpix-blackstone2/dbpix-blackstone2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/dbpix-blackstone2/dbpix-blackstone2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Blackstone Earnings More Than Doubl