ank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-30T13:53:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Abrams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abrams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43cfd648-87f8-58c8-a4f0-5d03975f98d2', 'word_count': 276, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43cfd648-87f8-58c8-a4f0-5d03975f98d2'}, {'abstract': 'The actress opens up about performing opposite Blythe Danner, her new namesake shoe line and life in New York City.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/30/talking-talent-sarah-jessica-parker-star-of-the-off-broadway-play-the-commons-of-pensacola/', 'snippet': 'The actress opens up about performing opposite Blythe Danner, her new namesake shoe line and life in New York City.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Emmy Award-winning actress Sarah Jessica Parker is just a month away from seeing her new shoe line, SJP, hit Nordstrom stores on Feb. 28. She designed the 25 made-in-Italy styles alongside George Malkemus, the C.E.O. of Manolo Blahnik —\xa0whose heels carried Carrie around Manhattan for the six seasons of “Sex and the City” —\xa0but the SJP collection will fall at a more affordable price point, ranging from $195 to $500. Before she kicks off a multicity tour for SJP, Parker will take her final bow as Becca in the Manhattan Theatre Club production of “The Commons of Pensacola,” on Feb. 9. Last week, she chatted about the Lynne Meadow-directed play —\xa0in which she stars alongside Blythe Danner, who plays her mother —\xa0the much-anticipated heels and what she does when she sees the “Sex and the City” tour bus go by.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/t-magazine/29parker-tabach/29parke