y of killing her roommate in 2007, a case that had already gone through three levels of judgment and produced mixed verdicts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORENCE, Italy — Amanda Knox and her former boyfriend were convicted on Thursday for a second time in the 2007 murder of Meredith Kercher, who shared an apartment with Ms. Knox in the university town of Perugia, where both women were exchange students. The presiding judge in the Florence court sentenced Ms. Knox to 28½ years in prison and the boyfriend, Raffaele Sollecito, to 25 years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/world/subknox1/subknox1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/31/world/subknox1/subknox1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 767}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/world/subknox1/subknox1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 801, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/world/subknox1/subknox1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1161, 'width': 908, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/world/subknox1/subknox1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/31/world/subknox1/subknox1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/world/subknox1/subknox1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Amanda Knox Is Re-Convicted of Murder in Italy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'American Is Again Found Guilty in 2007 Murder of Her Roommate in Italy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Knox, Amanda', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kercher, Meredith', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sollecito, Raffaele', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Perugia (Italy)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-30T14:09:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed70569a-3a3d-54d9-9fad-4f06a60f5b06', 'word_count': 947, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed70569a-3a3d-54d9-9fad-4f06a60f5b06'}, {'abstract': 'However, the vote on a resolution that criticized the formation of Telangana is not binding on Parliament.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/30/andhra-pradesh-assembly-rejects-new-delhis-proposal-to-create-new-state/', 'snippet': 'However, the vote on a resolution that criticized the formation of Telangana is not binding on Parliament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HYDERABAD, Andhra Pradesh — After two months of contentious debate, often interrupted by protests, the Andhra Pradesh Legislative Assembly\xa0on Thursday\xa0rejected\xa0New Delhi’s proposal\xa0to create a new state of Telangana out of Andhra Pra