 his left earlobe. Moving through the cavernous room as though it belonged to him, he reached a bar table where his friend R. J. Bell was waiting and flashed a smile. “My man!” Vegas Runner bellowed.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Super Bowl of Sports Gambling', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Money on the Game', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vlahos, James', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gambling', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Casinos', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Las Vegas (Nev)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fezzik, Steve', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bell, R J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oancea, Dave', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Montoro, Dennis', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Karalis, Gianni', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-30T19:26:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Vlahos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vlahos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7de227ef-eaeb-5f26-9bd9-5117bcec7253', 'word_count': 6230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7de227ef-eaeb-5f26-9bd9-5117bcec7253'}, {'abstract': 'The birthplace of the power breakfast, the Loews Regency Hotel in Manhattan, has renovated and hired a new executive chef.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/31/dining/the-power-breakfast-starts-a-new-day.html', 'snippet': 'The birthplace of the power breakfast, the Loews Regency Hotel in Manhattan, has renovated and hired a new executive chef.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW YORK is filled with enterprising women eager to turn up for breakfast at 8 a.m., decked out in eye shadow and Akris. They sip green tea and push a spoon around a bowl of oatmeal while speaking fervently of “protecting the brand.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31CHAT1_SPAN/31CHAT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31CHAT1_SPAN/31CHAT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31CHAT1_SPAN/31CHAT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31CHAT1_SPAN/31CHAT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31CHAT1_SPAN/31CHAT1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31CHAT1_SPAN/31CHAT1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31CHAT1_SPAN/31CHAT1_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Power Breakfast Starts a New Day', 'kick