imes', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/travel/30beatles/30beatles-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/30/travel/30beatles/30beatles-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/travel/30beatles/30beatles-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/travel/30beatles/30beatles-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1526, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/travel/30beatles/30beatles-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/30/travel/30beatles/30beatles-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/travel/30beatles/30beatles-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Beatles ’14: Two Hotels Celebrate an Anniversary', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'George, Ringo, Etc., Slept Here', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sullivan, Ed', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beatles, The', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Miami (Fla)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-30T21:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elaine Glusac', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elaine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glusac', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/90786397-4139-5f7c-a15e-faa1951ad4ce', 'word_count': 235, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90786397-4139-5f7c-a15e-faa1951ad4ce'}, {'abstract': 'An exhibition of Jean-Michel Basquiat drawings at Acquavella; Christie’s released details on the art it will auction from Huguette Clark’s estate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/31/arts/design/homing-in-on-a-couples-basquiat-drawings.html', 'snippet': 'An exhibition of Jean-Michel Basquiat drawings at Acquavella; Christie’s released details on the art it will auction from Huguette Clark’s estate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Longtime collectors like Herbert and Lenore Schorr are luckier than most. In 1981, while visiting the Annina Nosei Gallery, which was then on Prince Street in SoHo, the couple met Jean-Michel Basquiat, fell in love with his work and bought one of his paintings. That purchase was quickly followed by others — drawings as well as canvases — and, over the years, the Schorrs amassed one of the most important Basquiat collections in the country. The Schorrs also became friends with the artist, who died of a drug overdose at 27 in 1988, and occasionally bought a painting or drawing right out of his Manhattan studio.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31VOGEL/31VOGEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31VOGEL/31VOGEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 807}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31VOGEL/31VOGEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 762, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31VOGEL/31VOGEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1612, 'width': 1199, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31VOGEL/31VOGEL-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31VOGEL/31VOGEL-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31VOGEL/31VOGEL-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Homing In on a Couple’s Basquiat Drawings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Homing In on a Couple’s Basquiat Drawings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vogel, Carol', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Basquiat, Jean-Michel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clark, Huguette M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Christie's", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-30T21:14:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0a943c9-3c8a-5f7b-bcfe-8f02949c7414', 'word_count': 1037, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0a943c9-3c8a-5f7b-bcfe-8f02949c7414'}, {'abstract': 'The artist discusses 10 favorite works in an exhibition at the Museum of the City of New York that gathers the biggest names of ’80s street art.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/30/gallery-the-pioneers-of-graffiti-art-through-the-eyes-of-kaws/', 'snippet': 'The artist discusses 10 favorite works in an exhibition at the Museum of the City of New York that gathers the biggest names of ’80s street art.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the painter Martin Wong moved to New York in the late 1970s, the colorful graffiti around his new hometown so enthralled him that he began collecting and archiving what he knew would soon become historically significant art. He spent the next decade gathering pictures of the artists and their now painted-over masterpieces from photographers like Martha Cooper, who famously documented the emerging art form. In the ’80s, when gallerists began commissioning various mixed-media paintings from the graffiti artists — which were easier to display than tagged subway cars or building facades — Wong began to collect those too.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/30/t-magazine/30kaws-gassman-slide-E4D6/30kaws-gassman-slide-E4D6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/30/t-magazine/30kaws-gassman-slide-E4D6/30kaws-gassman-slide-E4D6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't