rticle/3bf941ae-e125-51cc-8faf-889deeb781a5'}, {'abstract': 'RameNesque, a Japanese cafe, fits right in with the homespun gestalt that is part of Peekskill’s charm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/02/02/nyregion/a-review-of-ramenesque-in-peekskill.html', 'snippet': 'RameNesque, a Japanese cafe, fits right in with the homespun gestalt that is part of Peekskill’s charm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On two different visits to RameNesque, a new Japanese cafe with a brisk takeout business in downtown Peekskill, we couldn’t get our table to stand still. Despite our best efforts — jamming folded paper napkins under the stand, jostling the table this way and that — the wobbles won out. Chopsticks, water glasses, ramen bowls, ramekins — all skittered around on the high-gloss wooden table top like so many pointers on a Ouija board. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02DINEWE3/02DINEWE3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 559, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02DINEWE3/02DINEWE3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 559}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02DINEWE3/02DINEWE3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 953, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02DINEWE3/02DINEWE3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1906, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02DINEWE3/02DINEWE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail',