e, “not simply as a film but in its revelatory cultural erotic intrusion — a vision (message) of genital sexuality and female pleasure which vitalized and agitated the art world.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31BREAKING_SPAN/BREAKING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31BREAKING_SPAN/BREAKING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31BREAKING_SPAN/BREAKING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 566, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31BREAKING_SPAN/BREAKING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1003, 'width': 1815, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31BREAKING_SPAN/BREAKING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31BREAKING_SPAN/BREAKING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/arts/31BREAKING_SPAN/BREAKING-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Woman Whose Ecstasy Ignited a Riot', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Woman Whose Ecstasy Ignited a Riot', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'