to break the rules.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Are you dating or just hooking up? According to Jason (Zac Efron), who narrates “That Awkward Moment,” a vile, witless sex comedy set in contemporary Manhattan, the dreaded word that signals danger to a smug, self-imagined stud is a post-coital “So?” Spoken by a woman wondering if their casual relationship will proceed to the next level — dating — it is a clear warning that the time has come to run for the hills.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For One-Night Lotharios, It’s Time to Face the Truth', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For One-Night Lotharios, It’s Time to Face the Truth', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Efron, Zac', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jordan, Michael B', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Teller, Miles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'That Awkward Moment (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gormican, Tom', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-31T00:15:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/26c3a1c0-5595-5955-b108-0173cc75cc04', 'word_count': 460, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26c3a1c0-5595-5955-b108-0173cc75cc04'}, {'abstract': 'When Denmark gave the company approval to buy a stake in its state utility, the Socialist People’s Party withdrew its ministers from the country’s governing coalition.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/30/goldman-deal-threatens-danish-government/', 'snippet': 'When Denmark gave the company approval to buy a stake in its state utility, the Socialist People’s Party withdrew its ministers from the country’s governing coalition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are groundbreaking business deals. And then there are ones that threaten to break up governments.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/Dong/Dong-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/31/business/Dong/Dong-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/Dong/Dong-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/Dong/Dong-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/Dong/Dong-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/31/business/Dong/Dong-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/Dong/Dong-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Goldman Deal Threatens Danish Government', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_head