et-art-festival-brings-color-to-the-walls-of-delhis-urban-villages/', 'snippet': 'Dozens of the capital’s buildings are hosting larger-than-life paintings as 60 people, from India and overseas, share their love of art with the public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — While looking out from a balcony in one of Delhi’s many urban villages – former villages that were swallowed up by the ever-expanding capital — more often than not, one is confronted by a boring, gray wall – the bare side of another building.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/world/asia/31-street-art-IndiaInk/31-street-art-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 339, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/31/world/asia/31-street-art-IndiaInk/31-street-art-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 339}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/world/asia/31-street-art-IndiaInk/31-street-art-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 578, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/world/asia/31-street-art-IndiaInk/31-street-art-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 894, 'width': 1584, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/world/asia/31-street-art-IndiaInk/31-street-art-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/31/world/asia/31-street-art-IndiaInk/31-street-art-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLar