rn home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/02/01/world/asia/indonesian-militants-join-fight-in-syria.html', 'snippet': 'Analysts say that fighters who have joined the struggle against President Bashar al-Assad could reinvigorate militant movements in Indonesia when they return home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JAKARTA, Indonesia — Indonesians have joined the thousands of foreign fighters who have traveled to Syria to help extremist groups trying to create an Islamic state there, according to a new report, a finding that analysts said Friday could help revive a weakened jihadi movement in Indonesia and set off more attacks on minority Shiites in the Southeast Asian country.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Indonesian Militants Join Foreigners Fighting in Syria', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Indonesian Militants Join Foreigners Fighting in Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cochrane, Joe', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indonesia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-31T13:09:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Cochrane', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cochrane', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/705f427e-4422-571c-b2a8-8834511ce409', 'word_count': 899, 'uri': 'nyt://artic