country to gain bargaining leverage and — in a new complaint — reneging on a pledge to destroy the 12 facilities that produced them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clamor Grows for Syria to Deliver on Chemical Arms Pledge', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Biological and Chemical Warfare', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Organization for the Prohibition of Chemical Weapons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Uzumcu, Ahmet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-31T14:53:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone, Nick Cumming-Bruce and Alan Cowell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bec89ac6-bf04-553e-85aa-ac6c16cd5321', 'word_count': 1069, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bec89ac6-bf04-553e-85aa-ac6c16cd5321'}, {'abstract': 'Andre Braugher, long used to critically acclaimed but unsuccessful dramas, has found both laughs and luck with the comedy “Brooklyn Nine-Nine.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/02/02/arts/television/andre-braugher-in-brooklyn-nine-nine.html', 'snippet': 'Andre Braugher,