enge of designing a realistic spacesuit that does unrealistic things, like unzip in the front.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/31/clothes-and-character-gravity/', 'snippet': 'The costume designer explains the challenge of designing a realistic spacesuit that does unrealistic things, like unzip in the front.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 10:26 a.m. | Jany Temime, the costume designer of Alfonso Cuarón’s space thriller “Gravity,” was scared. After a 40-year career packed with period pieces and one of the biggest fantasy franchises in movies (“Harry Potter”), she was facing the great unknown: space. In 3-D, no less. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/skivvies/skivvies-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 257, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/skivvies/skivvies-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 257}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/skivvies/skivvies-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 438, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/skivvies/skivvies-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 876, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/skivvies/skivvies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/29/arts/skivvies/skivvies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i