The Times since 1998, and the paper’s chief fashion critic since 1999.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/02/01/business/media/times-fashion-critic-cathy-horyn-to-retire.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Horyn had been with The Times since 1998, and the paper’s chief fashion critic since 1999.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cathy Horyn, The New York Times’s chief fashion critic, is retiring, the paper said Friday. Ms. Horyn has been with The Times since 1998 and has been in her current position since 1999.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Times Fashion Critic Cathy Horyn to Retire', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Horyn, Cathy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-31T17:11:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leslie Kaufman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leslie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaufman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61763308-80b4-50ed-b920-51364d770353', 'word_count': 210, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61763308-80b4-50ed-b920-51364d770353'}, {'abstract': 'The dramas “Bethlehem” and the Oscar-nominated “Omar,” as well as the documentary “The Green Prince,” examine the cost of spying in Israeli-Palestinian relations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/02/02/movies/films-about-the-mideast-examine-the-costs-of-spying.html', 'snippet': 'The dramas “Bethlehem” and the Oscar-nominated “Omar,” as well as the documentary “The Green Prince,” examine the cost of spying in Israeli-Palestinian relations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Ten years ago, Yuval Adler, an aspiring Israeli filmmaker, chanced upon a video on a Middle East website that captured one of the most brutal moments of the Palestinian uprising. The footage showed a gang of militants dragging a suspected collaborator through the streets of Bethlehem, and shooting him dead before a crowd of onlookers. “I remember thinking: ‘What is going on there? How does somebody get into that situation?’\xa0” Mr. Adler said. “If these are the stakes in becoming an informant, how would the Israelis manage to recruit somebody?”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/arts/02ISRAELIFILM-2/02ISRAELIFILM-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/02/02/arts/02ISRAELIFILM-2/02ISRAELIFILM-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/arts/02ISRAELIFILM-2/02ISRAELIFILM-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/arts/02ISRAELIFILM-2/02ISRAELIFILM-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/arts/02ISRAELIFILM-2/02ISRAELIFILM-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/02/02/arts/02ISRAELIFILM-2/02ISRAELIFILM-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/arts/02ISRAE