ytimes.com/2014/01/31/video-reviews-of-tims-vermeer-that-awkward-moment-and-labor-day/', 'snippet': 'Times critics on “Tim’s Vermeer,” “That Awkward Moment” and “Labor Day.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this week’s video, Times critics share their thoughts on the documentary “Tim’s Vermeer,” the romantic comedy “That Awkward Moment” and the drama “Labor Day.” See all of this week’s reviews. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Reviews of ‘Tim’s Vermeer,’ ‘That Awkward Moment’ and ‘Labor Day’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-31T20:16:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db655692-9bfe-5ed8-a996-f13b72f47fc9', 'word_count': 32, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db655692-9bfe-5ed8-a996-f13b72f47fc9'}, {'abstract': 'The Super Bowl is the perfect time for a rousing family game of Media Literacy Bingo.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/31/are-they-selling-sex-or-beer-its-super-bowl-media-literacy-bingo/', 'snippet': 'The Super Bowl is the perfect time for a rousing family game of Media Literacy Bingo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My children (12, 9, 8 and 7) all fully understand that one watches the Super Bowl as much for the advertisements as for the game, especially when one’s team isn’t playing. And here on the East Coast, Super Bowl watching tends to be a family affair for people with young children. (As my husband said when I mentioned missing Super Bowl parties, “You want to take the kids to a party at 6:30 on a school night?”) ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u