ings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Gropman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gropman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33844e70-2261-5187-893f-e749054307e3', 'word_count': 1069, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33844e70-2261-5187-893f-e749054307e3'}, {'abstract': 'Millions of dollars’ worth of financial transactions are flowing in conference rooms above Times Square, while Super Bowl revelers gather on the streets. And the financial workers are mostly just annoyed with the hubbub..', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/01/31/from-high-above-times-square-a-super-bowl-tease/', 'snippet': 'Millions of dollars’ worth of financial transactions are flowing in conference rooms above Times Square, while Super Bowl revelers gather on the streets. And the financial workers are mostly just annoyed with the hubbub..', 'lead_paragraph': 'The football carnival that has taken over 14 blocks of Broadway around Times Square may be fun for Super Bowl crowds, but those who work in the surrounding buildings are growing weary.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/01/business/dbpix-super-bowl/dbpix-super-bowl-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/02/01/business/dbpix-super-bowl/dbpix-super-bowl-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/01/business/dbpix-super-bowl/dbpix-super-bowl-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/01/busine