on.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/02/02/nyregion/passions-in-a-pastors-wake.html', 'snippet': 'Lafayette Avenue Presbyterian Church chose not to renew the contract of its interim pastor, the Rev. Carmen Mason-Browne. Some say her race and her gender influenced the decision.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the Rev. Carmen Mason-Browne’s farewell party in January, many supporters stood to give impassioned testimonials to the profound effect she had had on them in her two years as interim pastor at Lafayette Avenue Presbyterian Church in Fort Greene, Brooklyn. One spoke of her poetic sermons, another of her initiative to include children in the service, and another of her commitment to social justice.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02JPCHURCH1_SPAN/02-jp-CHURCH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02JPCHURCH1_SPAN/02-jp-CHURCH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02JPCHURCH1_SPAN/02-jp-CHURCH1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02JPCHURCH1_SPAN/02-jp-CHURCH1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1385, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/nyregion/02JPCHURCH1_SPAN/02JPCHURCH1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2