ep collaboration began to evolve. They formed an accessories company, incorporating work so complex that it takes them up to three years to complete a single handbag. Ideas for packaging led them to the tower installations that now lie at the heart of their artistic practice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Magical World of Steven and William Ladd', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ladd, Steven', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ladd, William', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mingei International Museum', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Neue Galerie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Diego (Calif)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-01-31T21:57:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooke Hodge', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooke', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hodge', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bfb84fb0-f87f-5999-b411-fffaf34d7768', 'word_count': 400, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bfb84fb0-f87f-5999-b411-fffaf34d7768'}, {'abstract': 'The new African American Heritage guide offers information on significant sites in the history of Wilmington, N.C.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/01/31/in-north-carolina-sites-that-honor-black-history/', 'snippet': 'The new African American Heritage guide offers information on significant sites in the history of Wilmington, N.C.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thirty-seven sites that highlight the contributio