down-with-a-history.html', 'snippet': 'About 40 years ago, the uncle of a New Jersey man taught his nephew how to drive in a 1952 MG TD. Now, the nephew owns the car.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rambling over the back roads that neighbor Duke Farms, a 2,700-acre estate and nature preserve in central New Jersey, the 1952 MG TD called to mind a little pooch eager to impress the big hounds at the dog park: The confident bark of its exhaust belied the timid 55-horsepower bite of its tiny 4-cylinder engine.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/automobiles/EGO1/EGO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 329, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/02/02/automobiles/EGO1/EGO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 329}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/automobiles/EGO1/EGO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 561, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/automobiles/EGO1/EGO1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1122, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/automobiles/EGO1/EGO1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/02/02/automobiles/EGO1/EGO1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/02/automobiles/EGO1/EGO1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLa